    "title": "Let’s Talk About Loss - Support for the 18 to 35's",
    "excerpt": "<p>A safe space for 18-35 year olds to meet and discover resources to help them with their loss through bereavement.</p>\n",
    "featured": true,
    "publishOn": 1626518880050,
