    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8a92e279d2e18f6eea7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"4bbc04878e5348c974ee\" id=\"block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A safe space to talk about loss with other people who will understand. Various groups around the country- check by location in the search to see if there is a group near you. Peer support, befriending and social meet ups to help bereaved 18-35 year olds. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Let's Talk About Loss is a support organisation for young people who have been bereaved.  Peer-led meet ups across the UK for those aged 18-35 who have been bereaved of anyone, at any time. On the website you can find information about your local monthly meet up. You can also read, or submit to, our blog that gives advice and information for those who are bereaved. Together, we're talking through the taboo.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They also run an online group. For more see website or email: <a href=\"mailto:online@letstalkaboutloss.org\">online@letstalkaboutloss.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://letstalkaboutloss.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Let’s Talk About Loss (Bereavement Support Groups for 18 - 35’s)</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-4bbc04878e5348c974ee .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
