    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/survivors-of-bereavement-by-suicide-sobs",
    "title": "Survivors of Bereavement by Suicide (SoBS)",
    "excerpt": "<p>NATIONAL: SoBS is a national charity providing befriending and support for people bereaved by suicide of a family member or friend.</p>\n",
    "featured": true,
    "publishOn": 1626520620050,
    "updatedOn": 1763651015874,
