    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6e1cae1897849b94f93\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"e19474579e21bd2980d4\" id=\"block-e19474579e21bd2980d4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Survivors of Bereavement by Suicide (SoBS) is a registered national charity that exist to meet the needs and break the isolation of those bereaved by suicide, and over 18 years old. It is made up mainly of volunteers, nearly all of whom have themselves lost someone to suicide.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Peer-led support groups and national helpline can provide a safe, confidential environment in which those impacted by suicide can share experiences and feelings, thus giving and gaining support from each other.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services also include email support through <a href=\"mailto:email.support@uksobs.org?\" target=\"_blank\">email.support@uksobs.org</a> and an online community forum.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>SoBS has branches all over the country. Please use the location filter to search for a group near to where you live.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://uksobs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">SoBs (Suicide Bereavement Charity)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">National Office <a href=\"tel:01159441117\" target=\"_blank\">0115 944 1117</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@uksobs.org\" target=\"_blank\">info@uksobs.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">National Helpline number is <a href=\"tel:03001115065\" target=\"_blank\">0300 111 5065</a> and available Monday to Sunday 9am -7pm  </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-e19474579e21bd2980d4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
