    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc02\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03\" id=\"block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Lullaby Trust offer a safe and confidential listening helpline to bereaved adult relatives of a baby or young child who has died suddenly and unexpectedly, this may be for any reason such as SIDS, accident, illness. They can be reached on the Freephone number: <a href=\"tel:08088026868\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>0808 802 6868</strong></a> Monday to Friday 10am to 2pm. Alternatively email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@lullabytrust.org.uk\">support@lullabytrust.org.uk</a>. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They also offer peer to peer support from a trained Befriender; a family member who has experienced a similar sudden death of their baby or child in the past. Support from a Befriender can be given over the phone or by email.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lullaby Trust Befrienders also answer calls to their Freephone support line during Weekends and Bank Holidays between 6pm to 10pm where they are ready to listen.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can find their bereavement support information <a href=\"https://www.lullabytrust.org.uk/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a><a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lullabytrust.org.uk%2Fbereavement-support%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csummer.othman%40ataloss.org%7Cfffc77c9ae3045e3150208dd66048083%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638778891699151149%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=1JM5En5eFzOWenCePJhLHIbhVWzFtHZFf7NsQY%2F%2FPG0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"https://www.lullabytrust.org.uk/bereavement-support/\">&nbsp;</a>and more about their bereavement helpline <a href=\"https://www.lullabytrust.org.uk/bereavement-support/find-support/bereavement-support-helpline/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">.</span></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.lullabytrust.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">The Lullaby Trust (Baby and Child Loss Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@lullabytrust.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">support@lullabytrust.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">FREE PHONE <a href=\"tel:08088026868\" target=\"_blank\">0808 802 6868</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Also find them on Instagram, Twitter and Facebook.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d212ac6c8e765ee8bc03 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
