    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a96\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97\" id=\"block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">There are over 700 Al-Anon groups throughout the UK and Eire where you will be welcomed with acceptance and understanding. When family life with a problem drinker is chaotic, an Al-Anon meeting can provide a much-needed safe haven in which to share experience, strength and hope. Whether your relationship with some one who drinks is in the past or present, Al-Anon is for you.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact the helpline</h3><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Friendly helpline volunteers, who are all Al-Anon members, are available 365 days a year to answer questions in complete confidence. You are more than welcome to simply turn up to an Al-Anon meeting. Click on <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.al-anonuk.org.uk%2Ffind-a-meeting%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C2696d0ae57844499564208de1d1cdbeb%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980207009644803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=OXKydnlGEq59HKqqZpKTYVSMGiQyGBFHYectwfYDDUU%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Find a Meeting</a> for details of a meeting near you or an online meeting. Many members prefer to call our confidential helpline first.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Residents of the UK can call <a href=\"tel:08000086811\" target=\"_blank\">0800 0086 811</a> (10am to 10pm, seven days a week).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Residents of the Eire can call <a href=\"tel:018732699\" target=\"_blank\">01 873 2699</a> (10am to 10pm, seven days a week).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Residents in Northern Ireland can call <a href=\"tel:02890682368\" target=\"_blank\">02890 68 2368</a> (6pm to 11pm, seven days a week; 10am to 1pm Monday to Friday).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email <a href=\"mailto:helpline@al-anonuk.org.uk\">helpline@al-anonuk.org.uk</a> to find out more about Al-Anon.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.al-anonuk.org.uk/getting-help/\" target=\"_blank\">Al-Anon (Alcoholism Charity)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a97 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
