    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Amanda Doran is a fully qualified therapeutic counsellor based in Wirral, UK, offering professional therapy services to support individuals through various challenges.​</p>",
