    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e\" id=\"block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anne Robson Trust believes that everyone deserves to have the comfort and companionship of another human being as they die, and the support to prepare for the end of their life. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The charity was set up by Liz Pryor following the unexpected death of her mother, Anne Robson, and the impact it had on her family. They work to support people facing the end of their life and those closest to them, and ensure every person receives the compassion, comfort, and companionship they wish for at the end of their life. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you feel that your loved one needs more support and compassion as their life journey draws to a close, Anne Robson Trust can help. Get in touch with them via their website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://annerobsontrust.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Anne Robson Trust (End of Life Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"mailto:info@annerobsontrust.org.uk\">info@annerobsontrust.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"tel:01438873257\">01438873257</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1c5c17191127df23c4e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
