    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c56\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57\" id=\"block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Antenatal Results &amp; Choices (ARC) is a national charity providing support to individuals bereaved following the loss of a baby as a result of a prenatal diagnosis.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This loss may be recent or many years ago.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">National helpline-</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The helpline is answered by trained staff Monday to Friday, 10.00am-5.30pm, Tuesday &amp; Thursday evenings 8 -10pm (please email <a href=\"mailto:info@arc-uk.org\">info@arc-uk.org</a> to book an evening call) Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02077137486\" target=\"_blank\">0207 713 7486</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Password protected, moderated Forum-</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A safe place for ARC parent members to make contact with others who have lost a baby following a prenatal diagnosis, in order to provide support and lessen the sense of isolation.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Volunteer Support Network-</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Support Network is made up of trained parent volunteers who have themselves faced difficult decisions about the future of their pregnancy, giving them a unique insight into support newly bereaved parents.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Range of publications- </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>ARC offers a range of highly regarded literature for parents and families which you may find useful at this difficult time. These are available to view and download from the website.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.arc-uk.org\" target=\"_blank\">ARC (Baby loss Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:02077137356\" target=\"_blank\">020 7713 7356</a>        Helpline: <a href=\"tel:02077137486\" target=\"_blank\">020 7713 7486</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@arc-uk.org\">info@arc-uk.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1c6c17191127df23c57 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
