    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c28d0390e25028fdef9e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d\" id=\"block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Get in touch if you need support with:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Trauma and grief. Therapy with a qualified psychotherapist – delivered via the phone or online, with access to interpreters </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Advice on a range of issues e.g., housing, accessing key health services, education, employment and more via our trained helpline support workers </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Practical support - access to digital devices to ensure families stay connected to loved ones during this worrying time, as well as stimulating toys for children, vital baby items and more (subject to demand)</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All services include access to interpreters in Ukrainian and Russian.   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The Helpline is open: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Monday – Friday 10.00am-8.00pm  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Saturday 10.00am-3.00pm  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.barnardos.org.uk/get-support/services/barnardos-ukrainian-support-helpline\" target=\"_blank\">B</a><a href=\"https://www.barnardos.org.uk/merged-search?q=ukraine&amp;ct=#gsc.tab=0&amp;gsc.q=ukraine&amp;gsc.page=1\" target=\"_blank\">arnardo’s Ukrainian Support Helpline</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08001488586\"><strong>0800 148 8586</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:ukrainiansupport@barnardos.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">ukrainiansupport@barnardos.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Znayditʹ na tsʹomu veb-sayti spetsializovanu pidtrymku ta informatsiyu, dostupnu ukrayins koyu chy rosiysʹ koyu movamy. Zminitʹ movu, natysnuvshy knopku 'pereklasty' u verkhniy chastyni domashnʹoyi storinky.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-8fa68bf4e3f54fbef49d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
