    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2960390e25028fdf04e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"0c8fd7d1e71eec386810\" id=\"block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The death of a child, of any age, brings heartbreak and devastation. Whether your child died recently or some time ago, Bereaved Parent Support from Care for the Family, will help you find hope, healing, peace, and a way forward. Resources, telephone befriending and events to help those who have lost a son or daughter of any age, in any circumstance. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Bereaved Parent Support team support those who’ve lost a child up to the age of 35 through their telephone befriending and offer support for any age at their events.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Care for the Family also provides useful support films on YouTube at the following. You can find their films <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLpKdCCKmSoAFPfJ2-0tg37F1M33p4TKSl\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a> and you can sign up for our regular email support newsletter.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.careforthefamily.org.uk/support-for-you/family-life/bereavement-support/bereaved-parent-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Care for the Family (Bereaved Parent Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:mail@cff.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">mail@cff.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02920810800\" target=\"_blank\">029 2081 0800</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-0c8fd7d1e71eec386810 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
