    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix4C",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b\" id=\"block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement Care is a service designed to support your emotional, practical and social needs, providing access to one to one bereavement counselling, friendship/social and support groups, walk and talk groups, life coaching and memorial services. The service is offered to anyone, regardless of which Funeral Director they used.</p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The Bereavement Care team</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement Care is run by a team of professionals with extensive knowledge and experience in counselling, bereavement and life coaching.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement support</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will be supported by a qualified Counsellor, trainee Counsellor or a Befriender/Listener in a private and confidential space. They offer face to face, telephone, email and online support. This service is free to those who use The Co-operative Funeralcare. Offers are also available for Southern Co-op members.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Wellbeing groups</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our free wellbeing groups provide a time and place where you will be able to meet other people experiencing the effects of bereavement. The people you meet will have a shared understanding of how you may be feeling. The groups are either face to face or online. More information can be found at on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BereavementCareSC/\" target=\"_blank\">our Facebook page here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Friendship groups</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The purpose of groups is to provide a time and place where you will be able to meet with other people who are experiencing the effects of bereavement and will understand something of how you are feeling. The groups meet socially once a month in different areas or online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.funeralcare.co.uk/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Care (by Southern Co-op)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"/s/Bereavement-Care-Price-guide.png\" target=\"_blank\">See the pricing chart</a> for fees and information. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone (Bereavement Care):  <a href=\"tel:08081691922\" target=\"_blank\">08081 691 922</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@bereavementcare.uk\">info@bereavementcare.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45702dc126ebbf55f8b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
