    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c359dc11c0396ca8389f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0\" id=\"block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">BAATN is the UK’s largest independent therapy organisation to specialise in working informed by an understanding of people who identify as Black, African, South Asian and Caribbean. Our primary focus and area of expertise is to support people from these heritages. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">On the website you can search and find therapists that represent a range of different theoretical orientations and specialisms and are experienced in working with the distinctive African, Caribbean and Asian experience.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All listed therapists have completed, at the minimum, a diploma training in counselling and are affiliated to a professional association - either <a href=\"http://www.bacp.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">BACP</a> (British Association for Counselling &amp; Psychotherapy), <a href=\"http://www.ukcp.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">UKCP</a> (UK Council for Psychotherapy) or <a href=\"http://www.bpc.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">BPC</a> (British Psychoanalytic Council).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.baatn.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">BAATN (Therapy Organisation)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:administrator@baatn.org.uk\">administrator@baatn.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c359dc11c0396ca838a0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
