    "title": "Bravecore Counselling CIC",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Bravecore Counselling CIC is a UK-based not-for-profit organisation dedicated to providing high-quality, affordable, and accessible counselling services to individuals from all backgrounds.</p>",
