    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-682b298a35ff3c6736c0642d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"ea8119c21ab8e9becacd\" id=\"block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bravecore Counselling CIC is a UK-based not-for-profit organisation dedicated to providing high-quality, affordable, and accessible counselling services to individuals from all backgrounds. However, they only offer services to <strong>adults 18 years and over.</strong> Their mission is to ensure that everyone, regardless of social, economic, or racial background, has access to the support they need during challenging times.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bravecore offers compassionate online counselling for individuals experiencing grief and loss. Their trained counsellors provide a safe and supportive environment to help clients navigate the complexities of bereavement, offering tailored support to meet individual needs. Their counselling is subsidised.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All counselling sessions are conducted online, making them accessible to clients across the UK. To learn more or to book a session, visit their website below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://bravecorecounselling.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Bravecore Counselling (CIC)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:<a href=\"mailto:info@bravecorecounselling.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\"> info@bravecorecounselling.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:<strong> </strong><a href=\"tel:07502183899\" target=\"_blank\">07502183899</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-ea8119c21ab8e9becacd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
