    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix3M",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c44b22796e02012641a6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c44b22796e02012641a7\" id=\"block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CDH UK is the leading UK charity making a BIG difference to all affected by Congenital Diaphragmatic Hernia. They offer support and advice to both those affected, their families and medical professionals. We are constantly working to raise awareness of CDH and continue to campaign and promote research, study and trials into the cause, prevention and treatment of this devastating condition. CDH is a birth defect that can affect any unborn child. Current statistics show that it affects around 1 in 2500 babies born and has a 50/50 survival rate</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For parents who have lost their baby, they have volunteers who have undertaken a Bereavement course and who understand the processes and requirements of parents during their grieving. If this is still not helping or there are any concerns about your welfare, they can put you in touch with a professional counsellor or provide advice on who you should contact with regards to receiving NHS counselling.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.cdhuk.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">CDH UK (Congenital Diaphragmatic Hernia Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@cdhuk.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">support@cdhuk.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08007316991\" target=\"_blank\">0800 731 6991</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c44b22796e02012641a7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
