    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45122796e0201264240\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0\" id=\"block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement is often the reason why hundreds of people end up feeling lonely after the loss of a loved one, often a partner. The Chatty Cafe scheme was not set up as a bereavement support service but many bereaved people are finding the scheme offers the support and option to meet other people and end their loneliness. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Chatty Cafe Scheme offers three ways to connect.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Venues around the UK </strong>Chatter &amp; Natter tables are where customers can sit if they are happy to talk to other customers. Hundreds of venues have signed up to the scheme, in cafes, pubs, libraries, hospitals – anywhere that people can sit and chat over a coffee.Chatty cafe's official partner is Costa Coffee and hundreds of their stores are participating in the scheme. Coffee isn't free, but good conversation is!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Virtual Chatty Café Sessions Held every Tuesday 1pm – 1.30pm. </strong>Anyone over 18 is welcome to join, there is no agenda, just chat and company.  We have people join from all over the UK. To join these sessions, please contact <a href=\"mailto:jenny@thechattycafescheme.co.uk\">jenny@thechattycafescheme.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Chatter &amp; Natter Telephone Friendship Service</strong> This supports those experiencing loneliness and/or social isolation. They will accept referrals from Social Prescribers and arrange for volunteers to call people every week for a chat although there is high demand for this service, so it is currently running in certain areas of the UK.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>To find out more about what Chatty Cafe or to find a Chatter &amp; Natter table near you, please visit their website.</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://thechattycafescheme.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">The Chatty Cafe Scheme (Loneliness-tackling Social Enterprise)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: <a href=\"mailto:jenny@thechattycafescheme.co.uk\">jenny@thechattycafescheme.co.uk</a>.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-27fdfd36e67f4c42e9e0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
