    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45422796e02012642a6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45422796e02012642a7\" id=\"block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Child Bereavement UK helps children and young people (up to age 25), parents, and families, to rebuild their lives when a child grieves or when a child dies or is dying. We also provide training to professionals, equipping them to provide the best possible care to bereaved families.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For more information or to support the work of the charity, please email:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.childbereavementuk.org/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Child Bereavement UK</span>&nbsp;</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:helpline@childbereavementuk.org\">helpline@childbereavementuk.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Call our national helpline: 0800 02 888 40 - Monday to Friday 09:00 – 16:30&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Facebook :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fchildbereavementuk&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C16ad29985f9441f66a5b08de1d1cf627%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980207421147797%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=fKnzscpdh9DbBp4fdV4CoV5rcvFx%2B3HO4ybGxacRFdM%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.facebook.com/childbereavementuk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Instagram :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fchildbereavementuk&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C16ad29985f9441f66a5b08de1d1cf627%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980207421202109%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=VV9IFKKobtE90r6wqVn%2FevxGhADfjgVcMeNrgUZcwmg%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.instagram.com/childbereavementuk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45422796e02012642a7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
