    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix3n",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45722796e02012642cc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45722796e02012642cd\" id=\"block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Children of Jannah's main ethos is based on the belief that the souls of children who die enter Heaven or Jannah (in Arabic), and has become our key message in providing comfort, education and training to thousands affected by child bereavement.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their services are centred around supporting bereaved parents, raising awareness through education and training and, ultimately, providing comfort to those in need. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Children of Jannah Telephone Support &amp; Information Line is staffed by specially trained bereavement support volunteers, who offer a listening ear and emotional support to bereaved parents.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.childrenofjannah.com/home/\" target=\"_blank\">Children of Jannah (Islamic Child Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@childrenofjannah.com?\" target=\"_blank\">info@childrenofjannah.com</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45722796e02012642cd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
