    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/death-cafe",
    "title": "Death Café",
    "excerpt": "<p>What is a 'Death Café'?\nIt's a group directed friendly discussion about death - no agenda, objectives or themes. An opportunity to talk about the only certainty in life. READ MORE HERE</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626519480050,
    "updatedOn": 1755093499724,
