    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9\" id=\"block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Down to Earth is the only UK-wide service for people struggling with funeral costs. Their website contains lots of information and tools to support people on low incomes and benefits who are arranging a funeral, including:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Keeping funeral costs down</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Raising money towards funeral costs</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Government support towards funeral costs – including an eligibility checker.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Benefits after a death</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For people who need more support, they operate a small helpline service. Demand for the helpline is high. If you can, please check if your question is answered on their website before calling. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please note that Down to Earth can only offer one-to-one support when they are contacted before the funeral has happened.&nbsp; Their online guides can be used by anyone, at any stage of the funeral arrangements. <em>This service is a national organisation with the following exceptions: Channel Islands, County Donegal, County Mayo and Jersey.</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://quakersocialaction.org.uk/we-can-help/helping-funerals/down-earth\" target=\"_blank\">Down to Earth (Funeral Cost Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:downtoearth@qsa.org.uk\">downtoearth@qsa.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Helpline Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02089835055\">020 8983 5055</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong><em> </em></strong></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c5951f66970dbfbb35e9 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
