    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/dying-matters",
    "title": "Dying Matters",
    "excerpt": "<p>WEBSITE: Dying Matters is a coalition of individual and organisational members across England and Wales, which aims to help people talk more openly about dying, death and bereavement, and to make plans for the end of life.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
