    "salesforceId": "a01dP00000HAJXS",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67f50eac721f6e4ebbf5cb7c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd\" id=\"block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Embark2 is an online forum dedicated to supporting individuals who have lost a partner <strong>within the past six years</strong>, offering opportunities for peer support and shared activities to help rebuild their lives.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peer Support Community:</strong> A compassionate online space where members can connect with others who have experienced similar losses, fostering mutual understanding and encouragement. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Organised Activities and Holidays:</strong> Embark2 arranges various events, including holidays and walking weekends, providing members with opportunities to engage in enjoyable experiences within a supportive group. Past trips have featured destinations such as Barcelona, Portugal, the Lake District, Yorkshire, and Northumberland. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Guidance on Post-Bereavement Travel:</strong> Recognising the challenges of traveling alone after the loss of a partner, Embark2 offers advice and organizes group holidays to ease the transition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Embark2 was established by individuals who have personally experienced the loss of a partner, ensuring an empathetic and understanding environment for all members. ​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://embark2.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Embark2 (Support and Holidays for Widows/Widowers)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@embark2.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">enquiries@embark2.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-4c26b8517f68bb6d2afd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
