    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6835a08f99c78c54c6cc192b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"effaa9000b921555e715\" id=\"block-effaa9000b921555e715\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">FD Counselling Therapy offers paid psychodynamic counselling to individuals seeking to understand how past experiences influence current behaviours and emotions. Providing a non-judgmental space, the service supports clients in exploring issues such as anxiety, depression, and grief, aiming to foster self-awareness and personal growth. Sessions are available both in-person at therapy rooms in Dalston and Stoke Newington, Hackney, and <strong>Nationally</strong> online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Support Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Psychodynamic therapy sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support for anxiety, depression, grief, and other emotional challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Weekly 50-minute sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Initial free informal chat to discuss needs and suitability</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Who Can Access This Service:</strong><br>Adults seeking support for emotional and psychological challenges, including those dealing with bereavement. Self-referrals are welcome. An initial informal chat is offered to discuss needs and determine suitability for therapy. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://fd-counselling-therapy.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">FD Counselling Therapy</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:fd.counselling.therapy@gmail.com\">fd.counselling.therapy@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:07814155705\">07814155705</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-effaa9000b921555e715 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-effaa9000b921555e715 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-effaa9000b921555e715 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-effaa9000b921555e715 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-effaa9000b921555e715 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-effaa9000b921555e715 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-effaa9000b921555e715 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
