    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a8c28955e481c62d8ae1a80\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b\" id=\"block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Found My Niche is a not-for-profit Community Interest Company offering peer support to adults experiencing grief and loss in the Doncaster area. Their <strong>Life After Loss Grief Cafes</strong> provide a relaxed, welcoming space where people can talk openly about their experiences, share feelings and meet others who understand what grief can be like.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Found My Niche also offers <strong>grief therapy</strong>, including the Edu-Therapy Grief Resolution programme, available in person or online, on a one-to-one or small-group basis. A range of therapeutic and wellbeing activities are also offered, including creative writing, crafts, relaxation activities, health and wellbeing walks, outings and guest speakers.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Grief Cafe sessions can also be accessed via Zoom nationwide, and members can join a WhatsApp group for ongoing peer support between meetings.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Who can use this service?</strong><br>Adults aged 18 and over who have experienced grief or loss.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Cost:</strong> Grief Cafes and many workshops and sessions are free. Grief therapy is also available; please contact Found My Niche for details of prices.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Location:</strong> Doncaster, South Yorkshire, with some support available online.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Official Website: </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.foundmyniche.co.uk/\">Found my Niche CIC</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-293cb6d12bdecc1cee6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
