    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8362\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363\" id=\"block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Good life, Good Death, Good Grief wants <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Scotland</span> to be a place where people help each other through the difficult times that can come with death, dying, loss and care. Their website links to sources of bereavement support and information about the practicalities of dealing with a death in Scotland: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.goodlifedeathgrief.org.uk%2Fsupport-after%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C0915dcd466ef4204137e08de1d1c3bad%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980204563952007%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2B9ueEXxDiDCKVwHwACj3wQg1ilGgDxUPpIUgieeKayU%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.goodlifedeathgrief.org.uk/support-after/</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>What does good life, good death, good grief do?</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They run annual participative events such as Good Death Week and the To Absent Friends festival, creating opportunities for people to take local action to increase knowledge, skills and confidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They proactively encourage local and national media engagement and dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They identify and share good practice, learning from and engaging with practitioners within Scotland and internationally.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They provide networking opportunities for their members.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They publish a monthly newsletter for their members, sharing the latest developments, events and news in Scotland and beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They provide information resources and practical tools for their members, making them freely available on our website.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They run small grants schemes to support local activities by their members.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They work to influence public policy.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They run a website that provides and signposts to resources for people who are dealing with death, dying and bereavement in a personal capacity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.goodlifedeathgrief.org.uk%2Fsupport-after%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C0915dcd466ef4204137e08de1d1c3bad%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980204563952007%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2B9ueEXxDiDCKVwHwACj3wQg1ilGgDxUPpIUgieeKayU%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.goodlifedeathgrief.org.uk/support-after/</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:office@palliativecarescotland.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">office@palliativecarescotland.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01312722735\" target=\"_blank\">0131 272 2735</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c7402a17bf0e569f8363 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
