    "title": "Help Texts",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Help Texts is a paid service that provides ongoing, expert-written support messages sent directly to your phone. The messages are designed to bring comfort, understanding and practical guidance after a bereavement. Each text is tailored to the type of loss you’ve experienced, and continues over time to support you through anniversaries and milestones.</p>",
