    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d\" id=\"block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A team of over 30 people consisting of qualified counsellors, coaches, an occupational therapist, clinical supervisors and many befrienders and volunteers. All staff members are based nationally in different parts of the UK working together remotely. Hope Bereavement Support initially offers FREE counselling to all clients</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Counselling</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Coaching</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement support groups</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Mental health and emotional wellbeing resilience workshops</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Educational and awareness building workshops</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Training and consultancy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Research</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Media</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://hopebereavementsupport.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Hope Bereavement Support</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:referrals@hopebereavementsupport.com?\" target=\"_blank\">referrals@hopebereavementsupport.com</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
