    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69ca5174be5f6943078eb71c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4\" id=\"block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Paid bereavement support services (not free), are available both nationwide online and in person in Brighton, UK, from Jessica Conway Counselling. </strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">She offers compassionate bereavement support for adults navigating grief, loss and life transitions. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The service provides a calm, confidential and non-judgemental space where individuals can explore and process difficult emotions at their own pace. Jess is a qualified integrative counsellor and registered member of the BACP, drawing on a range of therapeutic approaches to tailor support to each person’s needs.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Bereavement is understood as a deeply personal experience that can bring feelings such as anxiety, low mood, confusion or a sense of being stuck. Counselling sessions focus on helping clients make sense of their grief, develop self-awareness, and find ways to move forward while honouring their loss. Support is available on a short- or long-term basis, with an emphasis on building resilience, self-compassion and a renewed sense of hope.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Sessions are offered face-to-face in Brighton, as well as through walk-and-talk therapy, telephone and online counselling. <strong>Online support is available to clients across the UK, making the service accessible regardless of location.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">In addition to one-to-one counselling, Jessica Conway Counselling runs a free weekly bereavement meet-up:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>You can join the group every Wednesday at 4pm at MEO Café in Brighton.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>This provides an informal, supportive space for people to connect with others who are experiencing grief.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">An initial consultation is available to explore individual needs and determine whether the service is the right fit, with ongoing sessions typically lasting 50 minutes.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Official Website:  </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://jessicaconwaycounselling.co.uk/\">Jessica Conway Counselling (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:Info@jessicaconwaycounselling.co.uk\">Info@jessicaconwaycounselling.co.uk</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:07834244484\">078 3424 4484</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-f5d2c7f7cec0f48fbfa4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
