    "title": "Lavender Path Counselling",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">At <strong>Lavender Path</strong>, Charlotte offers tailored counselling services for those experiencing bereavement or anticipatory grief. Available online and via telephone, each session provides a calm, empathetic space to explore feelings such as loneliness, anxiety, anger, and depression .</p>",
