    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d\" id=\"block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Let’s Talk About Loss' was set up by young people for young people. They run peer-led meet up groups in a growing number of cities across the UK for young people aged 18 to 35 who have been bereaved at any stage. It is a safe space to talk through taboos and address the reality of losing someone close to you when you are young.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They believe that by meeting other young people who have experienced loss, young people can share their stories and struggles without fear, judgement or awkward silences. They’d love you to join them. Meetings are face to face and virtual, there is a blog on the website and individuals can submit their story by emailing <a href=\"mailto:blog@letstalkaboutloss.org\">blog@letstalkaboutloss.org.</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The online meet up is for anyone aged 18-35 and runs on Zoom once a month. You're welcome to join from anywhere in the world.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://letstalkaboutloss.org/meet-up/meet-up-online/\" target=\"_blank\">Let’s Talk About Loss (Online Groups)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: <a href=\"mailto:online@letstalkaboutloss.org\">online@letstalkaboutloss.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8a62e279d2e18f6ee7d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
