    "title": "Men's Sheds in the UK",
    "excerpt": "<p>Men’s Sheds are kitted out community spaces where men can enjoy practical hobbies. They’re about making friends, learning and sharing skills. Many guys find peer support when they are bereaved. Some come just for the tea and banter.</p>\n",
