    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd71\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72\" id=\"block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Making a difference, every day, to save lives and rebuild futures through awareness, research and support, Meningitis Now is here to help you when you need them, for as long as you need them.  They have Community Support Officers providing support across the UK in England, Scotland Northern Ireland and Wales.  And although they are not bereavement specialists, they do have over 30 years’ experience of understanding the impact a sudden loss of a loved one from meningitis can have.  Visit their website for the range of support they offer.   </p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can access the Helpline by:</h4><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Phone</strong>: <a href=\"tel:08088010388\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>0808 80 10 388</strong></a> (9am-4pm Monday - Thursday and 9am-1pm Friday)</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:helpline@meningitisnow.org\">helpline@meningitisnow.org</a>. Emails are answered during office hours only</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>By post</strong>: Helpline, Meningitis Now, Fern House, Daniels Industrial Estate, Bath Rd, Stroud, GL5 3TJ</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.MeningitisNow.org\" target=\"_blank\">Meningitis Now (Support Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"mailto:info@meningitisnow.org?\" target=\"_blank\">info@meningitisnow.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"tel:01453768000\" target=\"_blank\">01453 768000</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd72 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
