    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd75\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76\" id=\"block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Meningitis Research Foundation is a leading international charity, working to defeat meningitis and septicaemia since 1989. In 2021, we strengthened our long-standing collaboration with the global member network, <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.comomeningitis.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C522940ef31d242e73b5308dcf75efd34%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638657234587414430%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=n%2FHKYO0BiozbX1fmnTkFSz4EogGSif%2BdKCpl8EuZN6U%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Opens in new window/tab\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Confederation of Meningitis Organisations (CoMO)</strong></a>, becoming one organisation.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Together our vision is of a world free from meningitis and septicaemia. A world where effective vaccinations can protect everyone from meningitis and septicaemia. A world where people who do get ill, often very seriously, get the most effective diagnosis and treatment possible. A world where those affected by meningitis and septicaemia, their families and communities have the best support possible. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can call our free helpline, email us, or use our live chat. However, if you think that you, or someone you know, has meningitis please call your doctor or emergency services immediately. For meningitis, minutes saves lives so always trust your instincts and get medical help fast</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.meningitis.org/get-support/get-support\" target=\"_blank\">Support for you | Meningitis Research Foundation</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:helpline@meningitis.org\">helpline@meningitis.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Helpline: <a href=\"tel:08088003344\" target=\"_blank\">0808 800 3344</a> (UK) / <a href=\"tel:1800413344\" target=\"_blank\">1800 41 33 44</a> (Republic of Ireland)</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Live Chat: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.meningitis.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C522940ef31d242e73b5308dcf75efd34%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638657234587473696%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=neeXy72B7YOm4nXJs7jor%2FCjnS0DRBehC1Sa%2FFuoUfQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\">www.meningitis.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca0ece761d61c703bd76 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
