    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixBe",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6\" id=\"block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Supporting those affected by bereavement by MPS, Fabry and related diseases.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Respectful and compassionate care for a child or young person and their family members at the end of life, ensures their physical, psychological, social needs are met. Ways we can help;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you would like to talk to someone confidentially for as long as you need, you can call our helpline. Our support &amp; advocacy team understand how hard it can be to talk about what you are going through and are patient and empathetic.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can create your own special remembrance website in tribute to your loved one, where you can share memories, thoughts and stories with family and friends as well as light candles, add music, photos and videos. By creating a Remembrance tribute you can also collect donations in your loved one's name, organise events and celebrate anniversaries.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.mpssociety.org.uk/bereaved-family\" target=\"_blank\">MPS Society (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Helpline: <a href=\"tel:03453899901\" target=\"_blank\">0345 389 9901</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:mps@mpssociety.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">mps@mpssociety.org.uk</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bec6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
