    "title": "Mummy's Star",
    "excerpt": "<p>Pre Bereavement support for Mother's diagnosed with terminal Cancer</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626519180050,
    "updatedOn": 1763645168408,
    "catWho": [
      "Parent",
      "Adult child",
      "Spouse/partner"
    ],
    "catCDeath": [
      "Cancer"
    ],
    "catAgePerson": [
      "Young people (11-18)",
      "30-50",
      "18-30",
      "Children up to 11"
    ],
    "catLocation": [
      "NATIONAL ORGANISATIONS"
    ],
    "catType": [
      "Specialist Services",
      "Help with admin",
      "Other Support"
    ],
    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixBg",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7\" id=\"block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mummy's Star is the only charity in the UK dedicated to supporting women and birthing people diagnosed with cancer in or around pregnancy. For eligible parents facing incurable cancer and/or end of life they offer memory making support (including a memory box), an online space where you and your loved ones can build a virtual memory store for the future, guidance in making end of life preparations, support in choosing and accessing the right palliative care, referrals and signposting to additional sources of bereavement support and articles and advice specifically related to incurable cancer.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.mummysstar.org/support-me\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy’s Star</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@mummysstar.org\">info@mummysstar.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca19ce761d61c703bef7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
