    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69f07cbdf9b64a41a6875a70\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"9fb7045fe95d482723a2\" id=\"block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Navigate Loss offers compassionate counselling (paid) and support for people experiencing bereavement, whether a death was recent or many years ago. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Sessions are offered in London SE16 and online nationally.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The service supports adults navigating grief in all its forms, providing a safe and understanding space to explore loss, adjustment and healing.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>It’s possible to book a free 20-minute call with an MBACP registered therapist but then following sessions require payment of a fee.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Recognising that grief is not limited to bereavement, Navigate Loss also supports people experiencing loss connected to life transitions, identity changes, relationship endings, health changes, and other unacknowledged or <em>disenfranchised</em> losses, where grief may not always be recognised by others.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Support is offered through counselling tailored to individual needs, helping people process their experiences, make sense of change, and find ways forward at their own pace.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://navigateloss.co.uk/\">Navigate Loss, Navigate Loss, Online Grief and Loss Counselling</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07780874818\">0778 087 4818</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@navigateloss.co.uk\">hello@navigateloss.co.uk</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-9fb7045fe95d482723a2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
