    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixCI",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd\" id=\"block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you’ve experienced the expected death of a relative, friend or partner or you’ve been affected by a palliative diagnosis, and your GP is in Nottingham or Nottinghamshire, the Hospices Pre &amp; Post Bereavement Services can help you.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The care is person-centred and non-judgemental. Support is given by fully qualified counsellors, and those in training. They offer a listening ear and an understanding of the ways bereavement may affect you. They may also offer practical advice and information. Emotional support is initially for eight sessions, with the possibility of extending this if required. Support can be provided in person or over the telephone, whatever is easiest to access.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A bereavement support group and a friendship group meet monthly, facilitated by trained volunteers. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All the services are free.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.nottshospice.org/service/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Nottinghamshire Hospice (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01159621222\" target=\"_blank\">01159621222</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca1bc171814713b3e6dd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
