    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d\" id=\"block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A lot of people don’t understand who farmers are or what they do. RABI does! They know it’s challenging being a farmer – and that those challenges do not stop when you’re no longer physically working. That’s why they also support those who have retired and / or cannot work because of illness, injury or disability.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">It’s easy to see ‘being strong’ as keeping your head down, getting on with things, not complaining and not admitting there is problem. However, RABI believe it takes more courage to accept there is a problem, pick up the phone and seek help sooner rather than later.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Practical care and guidance to bereaved farming people of all ages, including farmers and farmworkers (working and retired) and any of their dependants. There is a free helpline you can call:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>24 hour Freephone Helpline: </strong><a href=\"tel:08001884444\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>0800 188 4444</strong></a><strong> or email </strong><a href=\"mailto:help@rabi.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>help@rabi.org.uk</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://rabi.org.uk/how-we-can-help/\" target=\"_blank\">RABI (Practical Care and Guidance following Bereavement for Farmers)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@rabi.org.uk\">info@rabi.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08082819490\" target=\"_blank\">0808 281 9490</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Shaw House<br>27 West Way<br>Oxford<br>OX2 0QH</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb8c51f554220a9e41d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
