    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Racing Welfare is a registered charity dedicated to supporting the workforce of British horseracing, including stud, stable, and racecourse staff, as well as those in associated professions. Their mission is to enhance the well-being of individuals in the racing industry by providing professional guidance and practical help throughout their careers and into retirement. ​</p>",
