    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67f50fd90c1ba51d566cf857\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"8e5722bf26674fa0d217\" id=\"block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Racing Welfare is a registered charity dedicated to supporting the workforce of British horseracing, including stud, stable, and racecourse staff, as well as those in associated professions. Their mission is to enhance the well-being of individuals in the racing industry by providing professional guidance and practical help throughout their careers and into retirement. ​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>24/7 Support Line:</strong> Racing Welfare operates a confidential helpline available 24 hours a day, seven days a week, offering assistance on various issues, including mental health, physical health, careers advice, financial matters, retirement, and housing. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Counseling Services:</strong> The charity provides access to trained BACP-qualified counselors for those in need of emotional support. Counseling sessions can help individuals explore their feelings and identify solutions to challenging life situations. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Support:</strong> Racing Welfare offers resources and guidance for individuals coping with the loss of a loved one, acknowledging the profound impact bereavement can have on mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Check-in and Chat Service:</strong> To combat loneliness and social isolation, especially among retired or incapacitated individuals, Racing Welfare provides a telephone befriending service, offering regular social interaction and emotional support. ​</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://racingwelfare.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Racing Welfare (Horseracing Workforce Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone helpline: <a href=\"tel:08006300443\" target=\"_blank\">08006300443</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-8e5722bf26674fa0d217 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
