    "title": "Rainbows Bereavement Support GB",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rainbows Bereavement Support GB is a national charity dedicated to supporting children and young people who have experienced significant loss due to death, separation, divorce, or other painful transitions.</p>",
