    "salesforceId": "a01dP00000JI3kW",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-681a297e67a412369d37a3b9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"899eab2739e8ab253b9f\" id=\"block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Rainbows Bereavement Support GB is a national charity dedicated to supporting children and young people who have experienced significant loss due to death, separation, divorce, or other painful transitions. Through age-appropriate, peer-group programmes delivered in schools and communities, Rainbows Bereavement Support GB helps participants express their feelings, build resilience, and develop healthy coping strategies.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Programmes Offered: </strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>SunBeams</strong>: For children in Foundation Stage and lower Key Stage 1 </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Rainbows</strong>: For children in Year 2 and Key Stage 2</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Spectrum</strong>: For young people in Key Stages 3 to 5</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>SunRise</strong>: For children and adults with additional learning needs</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Silver Linings</strong>: A community crisis response programme for ages 5–18</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Each programme is facilitated by trained adults within a safe and supportive environment, encouraging participants to share experiences and emotions with peers facing similar challenges.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Training and Resources:</strong><br>Rainbows Bereavement Support GB provides high-quality training for school staff and community leaders to implement these programmes effectively. Ongoing support and resources are available to ensure facilitators can confidently guide participants through their grief journey.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Get Involved:</strong><br>Schools, professionals, and communities interested in offering Rainbows programmes can access training and support tailored to their needs. Additionally, individuals can support Rainbows through donations, volunteering, or fundraising efforts.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.rainbowsgb.org\" target=\"_blank\">Rainbows Bereavement Support GB (Childhood Bereavement Support)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-899eab2739e8ab253b9f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
