    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67f51153de84ed033a6e3a24\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"0a6976f78e01a0dec21d\" id=\"block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sara Strivens is a dedicated end-of-life companion and bereavement specialist committed to supporting individuals and families during terminal illness and through the grieving process. With a background in midwifery and a passion for bereavement care, Sara offers compassionate guidance tailored to each individual's needs.​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>End-of-Life Companionship:</strong> Providing emotional and practical support to individuals nearing the end of life and their loved ones.​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Support:</strong> Assisting families and individuals in navigating the complexities of grief and loss.​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Group Support Sessions:</strong> Facilitating bereavement support groups to create a safe space for sharing and healing.​</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Professional Background:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sara holds a BSc in Midwifery from the University of Surrey and has extensive experience working as a midwife specializing in bereavement care within the NHS. Her dedication to supporting those experiencing loss is evident in her compassionate approach and commitment to providing personalized care.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://sarastrivens.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Sara Strivens (End of Life and Bereavement Companionship and Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:sara@sarastrivens.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">sara@sarastrivens.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07977186003\" target=\"_blank\">07977 186003</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-0a6976f78e01a0dec21d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
