    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a8c2afcf91e9158ac6d1e83\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"f51d42e2adf384338cca\" id=\"block-f51d42e2adf384338cca\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Grief Navigator is a grief support service founded by Sarah Brason, a certified grief coach and trainer who supports adults navigating life after loss. Drawing on her own experience of losing her daughter, Sarah offers a compassionate, personal approach to grief, helping people find their footing and begin to move towards a sense of peace while continuing to honour their loss.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Free Online Peer Support</strong></p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Grief Navigator also runs <strong>Griefspace</strong>, a free online gathering where people can explore different aspects of life after loss without judgement or pressure to 'move on'. Each session focuses on a different theme and offers an opportunity to talk about grief, share experiences and discover ways of living alongside grief.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Paid for 1-1 Sessions</strong></p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The <strong>1:1 Grief Journey</strong> provides a private, nurturing space for people who may feel weighed down by grief, disconnected from their former selves, or unsure how to begin living differently after loss. Guided sessions focus on acknowledging grief, finding meaning and gradually rediscovering a sense of calm and strength.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Official Website:  </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.griefnavigator.co.uk/\">Sarah Brason - Grief Navigator</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-f51d42e2adf384338cca {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-f51d42e2adf384338cca .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-f51d42e2adf384338cca {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-f51d42e2adf384338cca {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-f51d42e2adf384338cca .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
