    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-688b6330cc25b5730f01ddfc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"c848069ae346196475a0\" id=\"block-c848069ae346196475a0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Shifa Therapy offers therapy services specifically for Muslim service users. Although the business is based in Canada they offer online Muslim  therapy sessions to UK customers. They offer online therapy for a range of reasons including grief and bereavement.<br><br>At Shifa Therapy, mental health support is woven with cultural respect and spiritual sensitivity. Led by licensed Muslim therapists, including psychologists, counsellors, and clinical practitioners, clients benefit from evidence-based therapies blended with Islamic-informed care. The platform emphasises confidentiality, compassion, and accessibility in multiple languages via virtual video or audio sessions.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://shifatherapy.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Shifa Therapy (Muslim Therapy)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-c848069ae346196475a0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-c848069ae346196475a0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-c848069ae346196475a0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-c848069ae346196475a0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-c848069ae346196475a0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-c848069ae346196475a0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-c848069ae346196475a0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
