    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7\" id=\"block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sibling Support is the UK's only sibling specific bereavement charity, helping children and young people cope when their brother or sister dies. Their website contains free resources, information, explanations and advice for bereaved siblings and those who support them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sibling Support also has a support line which is facilitated by trained bereavement specialists at Child Bereavement UK. The support line number is <a href=\"tel:0800028884\" target=\"_blank\">0800028884</a>,  staffed between 9am - 5pm Monday - Friday, a message can be left outside of these hours. It is open to both young people experiencing a sibling bereavement, and also friends, family and adults around them. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.siblingsupport.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Sibling Support (Sibling Specific Bereavement Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08000288840\">0800 02 888 40</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@siblingsupport.co.uk\">hello@siblingsupport.co.uk</a> for support.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccb6e22cb244bb7e36d7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
