    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f\" id=\"block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anyone bereaved by suicide is warmly invited to <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fspeaktheirname.org%2Fcreate-a-page%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csummer.othman%40ataloss.org%7C110a8779fc3c4f71bf2e08dd242007a1%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638706442235673339%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2F4FNwhVtMZ5D8Y%2BSlwBk3V%2FvHVapgJK2eOP88aKSugM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">create a memorial page here</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Speak Their Name also aims to:</p><ol data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Raise awareness about the increased suicide risk in families and communities bereaved by suicide.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Provide pathways to accessible support (e.g. charities and lived experience groups) that can help mitigate that risk, because, as you’re no doubt aware, a major survey confirmed that over a third of people bereaved by suicide were unaware of available help, and 60% did not access any support despite their own increased suicide risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Help ease the loneliness often felt by those bereaved by suicide, providing a platform for connection and support with others who have experienced similar loss.</p></li></ol><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://speaktheirname.org/home/\" target=\"_blank\">Speak Their Name (Suicide Bereavement Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e381f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
