    "title": "SSAFA support Armed Forces Veterans and their families",
    "excerpt": "<p>If you lose someone who has previously served in our Armed Forces, or you are ex-Forces and you lose someone, then SSAFA is committed to supporting you during your bereavement.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626518940050,
