    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b\" id=\"block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sue Ryder is here to connect you with the right support for you. Whether that’s information and resources, personalised text messages, qualified counsellors or a community of others with similar experiences.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Talk to others who are grieving</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our Online Bereavement Community is a place to share experiences, get things off your chest and chat to people who understand.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ask questions and get support from other bereaved people.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Share your story and emotions anonymously.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Offer advice and support to others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcommunity.sueryder.org%2F%3F_gl%3D1*1v1edlr*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3Mjk3NzA0MjcuQ2owS0NRanc0T2U0QmhDY0FSSXNBRFEwY3NtOUpad2VyWWVnQVkxM1l1UVE2WjB3aFd5dzhNanNsRmdiaW5iTFdUMDhQdXNucU00U2Q0TWFBcmdRRUFMd193Y0I.*_gcl_au*NzEzODc0MTQwLjE3MjMxMDU0MjY.*_ga*ODk4MTQ2MzYuMTY5ODk0MjUzOA..*_ga_9HX5JQ7HN7*MTczMDExNzQ5NS40NjEuMS4xNzMwMTE3NTc3LjUzLjAuMA..&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C64b03ff9c1464dc343d508dcf74a6e1a%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638657146293127451%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=46IIapPIVT9wGL1dBoGamXZz%2B59rPVaZ%2BlciQ0JnuvA%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://community.sueryder.org/</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Expert advice and tools for grief</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Grief Guide is a safe space, free from other distractions, where you can find self-help tools and information to help you cope with grief.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Explore your emotions and feelings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Read about other people’s experiences of grief.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Access our interactive self-help tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgriefguide.sueryder.org%2F%3F_gl%3D1*1v1edlr*_gcl_aw*R0NMLjE3Mjk3NzA0MjcuQ2owS0NRanc0T2U0QmhDY0FSSXNBRFEwY3NtOUpad2VyWWVnQVkxM1l1UVE2WjB3aFd5dzhNanNsRmdiaW5iTFdUMDhQdXNucU00U2Q0TWFBcmdRRUFMd193Y0I.*_gcl_au*NzEzODc0MTQwLjE3MjMxMDU0MjY.*_ga*ODk4MTQ2MzYuMTY5ODk0MjUzOA..*_ga_9HX5JQ7HN7*MTczMDExNzQ5NS40NjEuMS4xNzMwMTE3NTc3LjUzLjAuMA..&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C64b03ff9c1464dc343d508dcf74a6e1a%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638657146293144262%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=LxODx09MIZG7vip%2FsXJEXgv%2BXqL%2B%2FmGFoHJVwfw2t00%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://griefguide.sueryder.org/</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Talk to an expert via video</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our online counselling service provides free, short-term support for people struggling with grief.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">talk to a qualified counsellor by video</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">up to 6 online sessions, at times that suit you</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">speak from the comfort of your own home</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sueryder.org%2Fgrief-support%2Fonline-bereavement-support%2Fonline-bereavement-counselling%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C64b03ff9c1464dc343d508dcf74a6e1a%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638657146293159642%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=WpvBfSOat%2F2owqtsjLM9zubg0MhTaWLeUkeZog1%2B7VE%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://www.sueryder.org/grief-support/online-bereavement-support/online-bereavement-counselling/</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.sueryder.org/onlinesupport\" target=\"_blank\">Sue Ryder (Online Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:online.community@sueryder.org\">online.community@sueryder.org</a> / <a href=\"mailto:online.counselling@sueryder.org\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">online.counselling@sueryder.org</span></a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6e538dfd32e935a9f4b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
