    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf148\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149\" id=\"block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Compassionate Friends is a national peer support charity for bereaved parents, adult bereaved siblings (aged 18+) and grandparents offering support after the death of a child, from one month old up to an adult child and from any cause. Our support is facilitated by bereaved parent or adult sibling volunteers. Our national helpline&nbsp;is here for parents on 0345 123 2304 – we aim to open every day and as often as possible between 10am and 4pm and 7pm and 10pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We encourage parents to contact us directly for support either by phoning our&nbsp;helpline&nbsp;or emailing&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:helpline@tcf.org.uk\">helpline@tcf.org.uk</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The Compassionate Friends also offers:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Grief companions offering peer support by phone or email to those in early bereavement in UK locations where there is no other TCF support</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Local in person support groups and 1:1 local support contacts</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Private and moderated Facebook Groups for loss in all and specific circumstances and online sharing sessions for loss in specific circumstances&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Occasional supportive weekend retreats and bereavement support days</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Online sharing sessions for loss in specific circumstances</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Supportive walks for the bereaved parents, siblings (18+) and grandparents in some areas of  the UK</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Information leaflets, bereavement support publications and a unique postal library on all aspects of bereavement</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A comprehensive website and moderated private online Forum</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.tcf.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">TCF (Bereaved Parents Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:    <a href=\"mailto:helpline@tcf.org.uk\">helpline@tcf.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c8c676dc911dd0caf149 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
