    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixIE",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20af929934533b56999\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20af929934533b5699a\" id=\"block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">On average, a deceased person will continue to receive 110 items of direct mail during the first twelve months following their death.  With upwards of 580,000 people dying annually in the UK (based on current ONS figures), this amounts to a massive 64 million pieces of unnecessary direct mail every year.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If someone you know has died, The Bereavement Register can reduce the amount of unwanted marketing post being sent to them, stopping painful daily reminders.<br><br>By registering with their free service, the names and addresses of the deceased are removed from mailing lists, stopping most advertising mail within as little as six weeks. Go to the website to register the name and address of your loved one.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.thebereavementregister.org.uk/about\" target=\"_blank\">The Bereavement Register (Mail Stopping Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Bereavement Register<br>FREEPOST RTEU-JSHJ-LCTZ<br>1 Newhams Row<br>London<br>SE1 3UZ</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:02070896403\" target=\"_blank\">(020) 7089 6403</a><br><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:help@thebereavementregister.org.uk\">help@thebereavementregister.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20af929934533b5699a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
