    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b\" id=\"block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Coroners’ Court Support Service (CCSS) is an independent voluntary organisation whose experienced volunteers offer emotional support and practical help to bereaved families, witnesses and others when attending an Inquest at a Coroner’s Court. The CCSS volunteers are able to help at court, via the helpline and local telephone support service as they are not always able to be at court for you. They can also support people attending Public Inquiries and Major Incident Inquests. All support is free and confidential and can be accessed over the phone or by email.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.coronerscourtssupportservice.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">CCSS (Coroners’ Courts Support Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:03001112141\" target=\"_blank\">0300 111 2141</a><a href=\"tel:0300%20111%202141\" target=\"_blank\"> </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Working hours: <strong>10.00 am to 4.00 pm weekdays</strong>, we are closed weekends and bank holidays.<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:helpline@ccss.org.uk\">helpline@ccss.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This booklet gives free and helpful information about inquests and the Coroners Courts</p><p style=\"text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"><a href=\"https://coronerscourtssupportservice.org.uk/information-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Coroner's Court Support Service Leaflet 2024</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba4b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
