    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixId",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3\" id=\"block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Ectopic Pregnancy Trust believes that the deaths and trauma associated with ectopic pregnancy should be prevented or minimised and seeks to support women and their families through this difficult period of their lives. They are unable to provide medical advice, but offer peer support from women and people who have been through a similar experience. They find that many people feel so alone in their experiences and that, eventually, people around them are expecting them to move on and talk about what happened less when they still may need to continue to talk about things or gather more information. They have the following services that could help:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/how-we-can-help \" target=\"_blank\">Discussion forums</a> | <a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/how-we-can-help \" target=\"_blank\">Telephone helpline</a> | <a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/how-we-can-help \" target=\"_blank\">Email support</a> | <a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/how-we-can-help \" target=\"_blank\">Zoom support group</a> | <a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/how-we-can-help \" target=\"_blank\">Treatment leaflets</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Charity also provides Information, Education and Support to medical professionals who treat early pregnancy complications.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://ectopic.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">The Ectopic Pregnancy Trust (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:ept@ectopic.org.uk\">ept@ectopic.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02077332653\" target=\"_blank\">020 7733 2653</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d206ac6c8e765ee8bab3 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
