    "title": "The Loss Foundation",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Support for anyone bereaved by cancer. Read more and view the video about their new CONNECT project- connecting bereaved people to others with similar experience and who 'get it'.</p>",
    "featured": true,
    "publishOn": 1626519120050,
    "updatedOn": 1762788821179,
