    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ee\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef\" id=\"block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The 'New Normal' is a project connecting young adults to help and supporting one another through life and bereavement's difficult moments.  The New Normal proudly provides non professional support through peer to peer meetings for general support through facilitated groups although they will refer you to professional support if they consider that best suits your needs.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Group meetings available:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Good Grief</strong>- offers a safe space for grievers all over the world to share in their experiences of life, loss and love.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Black and Brown Good Grief</strong> - a safe space for our black and brown grievers.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>It's Complicated</strong> - for those of us that feel our grief has that extra, added layer of complication.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Boys Talk</strong> - Hosted by men who are navigating their own emotional journeys.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Queer Good Grief</strong> - a safe space for our grievers from the LGBTQ+ community.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For time and date of sessions please see the website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.thenewnormalcharity.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The New Normal (Young Adult’s Bereavement Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT: Through website only. Click <a href=\"https://www.thenewnormalcharity.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\">HERE</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: 8 Devonshire Square, London EC2M 4PL</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768ef .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
