    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69c0fc30fed5585eaf65fd66\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"918912213aa1a5902a4c\" id=\"block-918912213aa1a5902a4c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Pet Loss Studio publishes The Pet Loss Support Series by C. Arden, covering areas such as pet loss guilt, the first year of grief, sudden loss, euthanasia-related guilt, supporting children, grief in men, and multiple losses. All titles are available worldwide via Amazon.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">They also provide two free resources: The First 72 Hours After Pet Loss, a downloadable guide offering immediate support, and The Healing Letter, a weekly email offering gentle support during the early stages of grief.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">These resources are currently used by the veterinary social work team at Cornell University and are recommended by The Ralph Site, a UK-based pet bereavement charity.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Pet Loss Studio aims to provide compassionate, accessible support for grieving pet owners and to improve awareness of available resources.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:petlossstudio@gmail.com\">petlossstudio@gmail.com</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Official Website</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.thepetlossstudio.com/\">The Pet Loss Studio (Pet Bereavement Resources)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-918912213aa1a5902a4c {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-918912213aa1a5902a4c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-918912213aa1a5902a4c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-918912213aa1a5902a4c {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-918912213aa1a5902a4c .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
