    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The SHIA Family CIC is a compassionate community interest company dedicated to supporting bereaved parents and families affected by pregnancy, baby, and child loss.</p>",
