    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9\" id=\"block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Its work encompasses those who have suffered bereavement as a result of World War II and all conflicts since then including Iraq and Afghanistan. The WWA also represents those who have suffered the loss of their partner and in peacetime, when the death was attributable to their service life. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The War Widows’ Association signposts members to the appropriate help and through our network of Regional Organisers we offer friendship and support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.warwidows.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">WWA (War Widows Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:+448452412189\">0845 2412 189</a><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@warwidows.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">info@warwidows.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The War Widows’ Association of Great Britain.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">c/o 199 Borough High Street<br>London<br>SE1 1AA</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1d9 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
