    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/you-are-loved-cic",
    "title": "YOU ARE LOVED CIC",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">You Are Loved provides a free and judgement free space, online and in-person in London for LGBTQ+ people who have lost a loved one to suicide or drugs.</p>",
