    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-68d290b07f8cc83c15e122a8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"bb40585dceece1853cc7\" id=\"block-bb40585dceece1853cc7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You Are Loved CIC was founded to fight the silent epidemic of premature deaths in the LGBTQ+ community due to suicide and drug-related causes. They create space for LGBTQ+ people to talk, share, and support one another—particularly where mainstream services fall short.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They offer free, queer-led emotional support and community connection, helping individuals feel seen, valued, and less alone in their grief or struggles.</p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered</strong></h4><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peer-Led Grief &amp; Emotional Support</strong> for LGBTQ+ individuals affected by suicide, loss, or mental health challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Community Connection Spaces</strong> where people can talk openly and support each other</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Ask Bobby</strong> – An inclusive wellbeing directory that signposts users to LGBTQ+-affirming services and community initiatives</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Awareness &amp; Advocacy</strong> to highlight mental health and suicide issues within the LGBTQ+ community</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Official Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://youare-loved.com/\" target=\"_blank\">YOU ARE LOVED CIC (LGBTQ+ bereavement support and signposting)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-bb40585dceece1853cc7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
