    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26fce502633397e6688\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26fce502633397e6689\" id=\"block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">YDUK offers support services for young people with dementia (young onset dementia refers to people under 65) and their families. This includes individual support both before and after a bereavement. Some people who care for someone with dementia find that they have grieved the loss of the person for so long that they do not have strong feelings of grief when the person dies.  Others do experience a range of emotional reactions including numbness, shock, pain or sadness. Look on the UDUK website for groups in your area that provide support and companionship after someone with dementia has died.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.dementiauk.org/information-and-support/young-onset-dementia/\" target=\"_blank\">YDUK (Young Dementia Related Bereavement Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:fundraising@youngdementiauk.org\">fundraising@youngdementiauk.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:01993776295\" target=\"_blank\">01993 776295</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: YoungDementia UK<br>PO Box 315<br>Witney<br>Oxfordshire<br>OX28 1ZN</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26fce502633397e6689 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
