    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1b1c17191127df23941\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1b1c17191127df23942\" id=\"block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Young Persons Counselling' is a confidential service for people between the ages of 12 and 18 years. Counselling is offered on a no-waiting list basis, within two weeks of first contact.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If the young person is under the age of 16, the parents, or carers, permission is required, although the counsellor can work on a one to one basis with the young person. Counselling is offered to support any issues that may be caused by bereavement such as anxiety, depression, pain of loss, grief or abandonment. All counsellors are BACP accredited.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://thirdlevelfoundation.co.uk/counselling-services/young-people\" target=\"_blank\">3rd Level Foundation (Young Person’s Counselling Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@thirdlevelfoundation.co.uk\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">info@thirdlevelfoundation.co.uk</span></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08000217704\" target=\"_blank\">0800 021 7704</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">35A Union St</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Aberdeen</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">AB11 5BN</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">[70324]</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1b1c17191127df23942 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
