    "title": "Aashna Counselling and Psychotherapy",
    "excerpt": "<p>Counselling and therapy specialising in supporting people for whom culture, faith, colour, sexuality, gender and disability impacts on their lived experience of bereavement.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626520920050,
