    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Angela Bedford PGDip TA</strong> is a UKCP-governed psychotherapeutic counsellor and trainee psychotherapist. She specialises in relational work and transactional analysis, believing in client-led exploration and long-term collaborative therapeutic work.</p>",
