    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6850010dca4d8d0bda93e2b4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"d2ae351f974fc5116e40\" id=\"block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Angela Bedford PGDip TA</strong> is a UKCP-governed psychotherapeutic counsellor and trainee psychotherapist. She specialises in relational work and transactional analysis, believing in client-led exploration and long-term collaborative therapeutic work.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Angela offers:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Client-focused, empathetic therapeutic relationship in all formats</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Skilled use of Transactional Analysis to build lifelong tools &amp; self-awareness</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Flexible, multicultural-friendly approach; supporting couples and small groups</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">UKCP ethical governance providing professional oversight and standards</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>She also offers:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support for anxiety &amp; stress</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Depression &amp; bereavement</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Trauma, abuse &amp; relationship issues</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Work-related challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LGBTQ+ concerns &amp; sexuality exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Group sessions:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Depression &amp; bereavement groups</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support for domestic violence survivors</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.abctherapist.com\" target=\"_blank\">ABC Therapy (Counselling by Angela Bedford)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07554836672\" target=\"_blank\">07554836672</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:angelacounsellingservices@gmail.com\" target=\"_self\">angelacounsellingservices@gmail.com</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-d2ae351f974fc5116e40 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
