    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a91\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92\" id=\"block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you are aged 60+, have been bereaved and would value the opportunity to meet with others who understand, Age UK Oxfordshire groups offer the chance for you to get together at regular walks, pub lunches and other social activities. They are places where you can be yourself and feel supported as you explore what life without your loved one will mean for you. <br><br>Their support line is available Monday to Friday (10am-4pm), where you can talk to one of their team members. They will be able to link you to all the information and support that is available and arrange for you to receive a regular call moving forward if that would help.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.ageuk.org.uk/oxfordshire/our-services/bereavement-support-2e87a635-a2ff-ed11-a81c-6045bd94e88e/\" target=\"_blank\">Age UK Oxfordshire (Bereavement Support Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:communit@ageukoxfordshire.org.uk\">community@ageukoxfordshire.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07827235424\" target=\"_blank\">07827 235 424</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1bbc17191127df23a92 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
