    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1bcc17191127df23ace\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf\" id=\"block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Alice House Hospice offers bereavement counselling to adults who reside in the communities of Hartlepool and East Durham. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Hospice’s Counselling &amp; Support Service offers a monthly support group to parents who have experienced the death of an adult child.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This drop-in group is facilitated by a member of the Counselling Team and gives parents the opportunity to meet other bereaved parents, to talk about their feelings and share experiences openly in a safe and confidential environment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://alicehousehospice.co.uk/patients-carers/outpatient-services/therapeutic-support-services/\" target=\"_blank\">Alice House Hospice (Bereavement Counselling)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01429855550\" target=\"_blank\">01429 855550</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@alicehousehospice.co.uk\">enquiries@alicehousehospice.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Alice House Hospice, Alice House, Wells Avenue, Hartlepool, TS24 9DA</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1bcc17191127df23acf .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
