    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix1B",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f\" id=\"block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Improving Mental Wellbeing in West Cumbria</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Offering a variety of support services - in schools, home and out and about in the community. Here's a selection of what's on offer.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Coping Strategies 1:1 </strong>- Tailored around the needs of the individual, we help you learn the best alternative approaches for managing your mental well-being from 11+ years to adults. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Alternative Therapies -</strong> Provided by fully qualified staff: Aromatherapy, Reiki, Massage, Laughter Yoga. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Colour Coded </strong>- A weekly drop-in group for LGBTQ+ individuals aged 11-15 and 16-25. It is a safe space to be yourself and engage in planned activities with your friends. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Walking Football</strong> - Every Wednesday at Whitehaven 11am and Workington 1.30pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Mental Health Awareness</strong> - Short courses delivered to local organisations, designed to raise awareness of mental health issues. We teach effective coping strategies that you can implement to improve your well-being. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Counselling</strong> - If you're a parent or caregiver to a child under 18, we can offer you counselling with our qualified counsellor.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Connect Group </strong>- A weekly adult drop-in group that meets weekly in:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Whitehaven on Fri 12pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Workington Thu 12.30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Workington Thu 5pm (Evening group)</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Join in a range of Arts and Crafts activities, games and discussions to help you connect with like-minded people in your community. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to get in touch using the email below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.alwaysanotherway.co.uk/\">Always Another Way (Mental Wellbeing Support Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:contact@alwaysanotherway.org.uk\"><u>contact@alwaysanotherway.org.uk</u></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a href=\"mailto:contact@alwaysanotherway.org.uk\">Telephone: 07597700249</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c1bec17191127df23b1f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
