    "title": "Angels United FC",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Angels United FC was co-founded by a group of fathers who have all suffered the heartbreak of losing a baby or child. The club uses football as a platform to \"Break The Silence\" around baby and child loss, offering a unique blend of emotional support and physical activity to help members navigate their grief journey. The focus is on peer support.</p>",
