    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67e406c8ff62716e57b9fbf2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"c7d9b8d972a07db680a6\" id=\"block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Angels United FC was co-founded by a group of fathers who have all suffered the heartbreak of losing a baby or child. The club uses football as a platform to \"Break The Silence\" around baby and child loss, offering a unique blend of emotional support and physical activity to help members navigate their grief journey. The focus is on peer support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peer-to-Peer Bereavement Support:</strong> A supportive community for fathers who have experienced the loss of a baby or child at any age or stage of pregnancy. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Weekly Support Sessions:</strong> Free support sessions held every Tuesday night in Manchester, providing a safe space for bereaved fathers to connect and share their experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Football Activities:</strong> Engaging in football matches and activities as a means to foster camaraderie, physical activity, and emotional healing among members. </p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://angelsunitedfc.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Angels United FC (Baby and Child Loss Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-c7d9b8d972a07db680a6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
