    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6\" id=\"block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Artlift (Gloucestershire) sessions are informal and fun; an experienced artist gently introduces a range of ideas and techniques to help you explore your own creativity and learn new skills at your own pace. Specifically, the courses are for those at risk of developing (or who have developed) poor mental health due to anxiety or depression, a long term chronic condition or a major life change such as <strong>bereavement,</strong> redundancy or low self-esteem.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Artlift run a range of great <a href=\"https://artlift.org/our-courses/\" target=\"_blank\">courses</a> and creative <a href=\"https://artlift.org/what-we-do/projects/\" target=\"_blank\">projects</a> for anyone registered with a doctor in Gloucestershire, where their experienced artists offer a personalised approach in a relaxed atmosphere through which participants can move forward. It is possible to self refer via the Artlift telephone number below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Artlift also provides <a href=\"https://artlift.org/what-we-do/residencies/\" target=\"_blank\">residencies</a> and Workplace Wellbeing packages to support the mental health of staff in the corporate and statutory sectors in these challenging times. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://artlift.org\" target=\"_blank\">Artlift (Wellbeing Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:office@artlift.org?\" target=\"_blank\">office@artlift.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact Artlift via a form on this page: <a href=\"https://artlift.org/contact-artlift/\" target=\"_blank\">https://artlift.org/contact-artlift/</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">To self refer: <a href=\"tel:+443000200102\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>03000 200 102</strong></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c2840390e25028fdeee6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
