    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2880390e25028fdef32\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c2880390e25028fdef33\" id=\"block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Ayrshire Hospice bereavement service helps people to manage the emotional impact of their situation. They can provide counselling or support to family and friends of all ages who are affected by the life-limiting condition of someone important to them. Support is available before and after bereavement, depending on what individual families need.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Any individual with life-limiting illness who is not currently known to the hospice but would like to self refer to the Counselling and Bereavement Support Service can do this through our triage team by calling <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:01292269200\">01292 269200</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ayrshirehospice.org/supporting-you/services-we-offer/counselling-and-bereavement-support/\">Ayrshire Hospice (Bereavement Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone:  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:01292269200\">01292 269200</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c2880390e25028fdef33 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
