    "title": "BAC-IN",
    "excerpt": "<p>NOTTINGHAM: If bereavement is the cause of your alcohol addiction, or you are worried about someone who has been bereaved drinking to excess, find support and understanding from BAC-IN, support for Black, South Asian and Minoritised Communities</p>\n",
