    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6\" id=\"block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bear for an angel is a Community Organisation providing comfort and acknowledgement to families affected by pregnancy, baby and child loss by the provision of keepsakes. Currently supplying Quinn's bags of hope to Ipswich hospital epau and a local funeral directors, as well as to families in the UK directly all over the UK.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please donate today: <br><a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.gofundme.com%2Ff%2FQuinns-bags-of-hope17&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C72c2634f0edc4cc3c38d08dcf52b370c%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638654813192667031%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=rL%2Bw3x0YLwusszKJ8Oyh3tBumRxYpS9hn0K7v9CgQZE%3D&amp;reserved=0\">www.gofundme.com/f/Quinns-bags-of-hope17</a><br><br>Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.bearforanangel.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bear for an Angel (Pregnancy, Baby and Child Loss Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bfaabears@gmail.com\">bfaabears@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Facebook: bearforanangel<br>Twitter: @bearforanangel<br>Instagram: bearforanangel</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c2900390e25028fdefd6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
