    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e\" id=\"block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Family Team supports the mental health of children, young people and families during and/or after cancer and bereavement from cancer.  Service available for patients and families.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Beechwood Cancer Care Centre is based in Stockport.  It was established in 1990 to help and support patients, carers and family members who are affected by cancer. Beechwood Cancer Care Centre supports people with the shock of diagnosis and throughout their journey.  Offering one to one counselling, complementary therapies and support groups. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://beechwoodcancercare.org.uk/our-services/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Beechwood Cancer Care (Support Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@beechwoodcancercare.co.uk\">enquiries@beechwoodcancercare.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01614760384\" target=\"_blank\">0161 476 0384</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Beechwood Cancer Care Centre</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Chelford Grove</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Stockport</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cheshire</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">SK3 8LS</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c2920390e25028fdf01e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
