    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-68137eb578936e0df4e9a699\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f\" id=\"block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Peter’s Baptist Church in Worcester offers a welcoming, informal Bereavement Café for anyone coping with the loss of a loved one. This drop-in space provides a supportive environment where individuals can share experiences, find comfort, and connect with others who understand the journey of grief. Whether your bereavement is recent or from years past, you are warmly invited to attend.​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">No booking is required. Simply drop in during the session times. The café is free to attend, and all are welcome.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>When:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Once a month on the second Monday of each month, 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Where:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Peter’s Baptist Church<br>Eden Close, Worcester, WR5 3TZ​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stpetersbaptist.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Café - St. Peter’s Baptist (Community Support Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@stpetersbaptist.org.uk\">bereavement@stpetersbaptist.org.uk</a><br></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-ca6a151c60c25d8c6c8f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
