    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Bereavement Café provides an opportunity for those who have been bereaved, recently or in the past, to meet with others who have also been affected by the loss of a loved one.</p>",
