    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69d8b2b8ae3347241be9dce7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"04d594e2c60b16935b57\" id=\"block-04d594e2c60b16935b57\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Bereavement Café provides an opportunity for those who have been bereaved, recently or in the past, to meet with others who have also been affected by the loss of a loved one. A small group of helpers who have all experienced bereavement provide a warm welcome and a listening ear. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Café takes place every second Tuesday of the month at St Andrew's Church Centre, Station Road, Churchdown, Glos GL3 2JT, from 1.30 to 3pm. Come along to meet others and enjoy a cuppa and cake.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stastb.church/\">St Andrew’s and St Bartholomew’s Church</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@stastb.church\">admin@stastb.church</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01452712154\">01452 712154</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-04d594e2c60b16935b57 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-04d594e2c60b16935b57 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-04d594e2c60b16935b57 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-04d594e2c60b16935b57 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-04d594e2c60b16935b57 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
