    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c2980390e25028fdf080\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c2980390e25028fdf081\" id=\"block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Care</strong> has a team of trained volunteers to support adults and children in the London Boroughs of Harrow and Hillingdon and the surrounding area who would like some help in coping with their bereavement.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Care</strong> is an established charity. Services for bereaved people are given entirely free of charge and are completely confidential. They work with healthcare professionals, teachers, community leaders and family support workers throughout the local community.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.bereavementcareandsupport.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Care - Harrow and Hillingdon (Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please contact them on <a href=\"tel:02084275720\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>020 8427 5720</strong></a> to ask for bereavement support. The call would normally be expected to come from the person who is asking for the support so that Bereavement Care can ensure that the details are accurate. But please make a call to help then hand the phone over to the person needing support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: The Lodge, 64 Pinner Road, Harrow, Middlesex, HA1 4HZ<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@bereavementcareandsupport.co.uk\">admin@bereavementcareandsupport.co.uk</a><br><br></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c2980390e25028fdf081 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
