    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7\" id=\"block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bury Hospice has launched a monthly Bereavement Drop-in Group at Radcliffe Library. It is an opportunity to get out and meet new people, giving participants the chance to share how they feel, helping to prevent isolation often felt after a bereavement and the chance to gain new friends.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Hospice appreciate that bereavement is different for everyone and have developed initiatives to help facilitate the best ways of offering their support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Bereavement Drop-in Group is open to everyone. Guest speakers are invited to some of the drop-in sessions and you will have the opportunity to find out more about mindfulness and access to complementary therapies.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Last Wednesday of every month, 5pm-6:30pm. Free Parking available. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.bury.gov.uk/index.aspx?articleid=17208\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Drop-in Group (Held at Radcliffe Library) </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01612537160\" target=\"_blank\">0161 253 7160</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c351dc11c0396ca837a7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
