    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix2Q",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ad\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae\" id=\"block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A FREE monthly drop-in space for anyone who has been bereaved. Offering a relaxed and supportive group environment for conversations, peer support, signposting and refreshments. There is no need to register in advance, just turn up on the day. <strong>These are held on:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The second Monday of the month at Ladock Community Hall, Lacock, Nr Truro, TR2 4PG 10.00am – 12.00pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The second Tuesday of the month at Hayle Day Centre, Commercial Road, Hayle, TR27 4DE 1.30pm – 3.30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The third Thursday of the month at Neighbourhood Hub, Chapel Street, Redruth, TR15 2BY (beside Cornwall Hospice Care shop) 1.30pm – 3.30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The second Friday of the month at Launceston Health Hub, 8 Exeter Street, Launceston, PL15 9EQ 10.00am – 12.00pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The third Friday of the month at ‘Bridge 49’ at Mount Charles Church, Victoria Road, St Austell, PL25 4QF 10.30am – 12.30pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The first Monday of the month at ClayTAWC, Fore Street, St Dennis, St Austell, PL26 8AF 1.30pm – 3.30pm</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.cornwallhospicecare.co.uk/our-community-services/workshops-groups/\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Help Point (FREE Monthly Drop-In Spaces in Cornwall)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: <a href=\"tel:01726829874\" target=\"_blank\">01726 829874</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c352dc11c0396ca837ae .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
