    "title": "Bereavement Services - Dovehouse Hospice",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Dove House Hospice provides bereavement services that are designed to assist individuals of all ages in coping with loss, offering both group and individual support tailored to meet the needs of the community.</p>",
