    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67e4029ba62f520002a308e8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"226a10039e97c9586ebb\" id=\"block-226a10039e97c9586ebb\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dove House Hospice provides comprehensive care and support for individuals with life-limiting illnesses and their families. Their bereavement services are designed to assist individuals of all ages in coping with loss, offering both group and individual support tailored to meet the needs of the community.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Support:</strong> Emotional and practical assistance for individuals coping with the loss of a loved one. The Family Support Team offers personalized support to help navigate the grieving process. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Children's Bereavement Groups:</strong> Specialized support groups for children and teenagers who have experienced bereavement, providing a safe environment to share feelings and develop coping strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Welcome Wednesdays Bereavement Café:</strong> A community group open to all bereaved individuals, offering a space to connect with others who have had similar experiences. Meetings are held on the first and third Wednesday of each month, from 1 pm to 3 pm, at the Amy Johnson Community Hub, Dove House Hospice</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.dovehouse.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Bereavement Services - Dovehouse Hospice</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01482784343\">01482 784343</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-226a10039e97c9586ebb {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-226a10039e97c9586ebb .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-226a10039e97c9586ebb {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-226a10039e97c9586ebb {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-226a10039e97c9586ebb {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-226a10039e97c9586ebb {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-226a10039e97c9586ebb .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
