    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f\" id=\"block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Based at The Hope Centre, Melton Mowbray, Breathing Space was set up by Melton Vineyard Church and offers one to one listening and counselling services for bereaved people. Clients receive emotional support in times of crisis and distress through a grief support group facilitated by bereavement counsellors. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">There is a referral system through the local Medical Practice, which serves a population of 39,000 people, and they receive referrals from GP’s, Nurses, and a Mental Health Nurse. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.vineyardchurches.org.uk/resources/a-listening-ear-in-melton-mowbray/\" target=\"_blank\">Breathing Space (Support For Melton’s Local Psychological And Counselling Services)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:breathingspace@meltonvineyard.org.uk\">breathingspace@meltonvineyard.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07515313475\" target=\"_blank\">07515 313475</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c35edc11c0396ca8391f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
