    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e\" id=\"block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bridgend Pregnancy Crisis Centre was established and opened in January 2005 to provide support for women and their families in unexpected pregnancy, post abortion, miscarriage and following baby loss. Our counsellors are fully trained and specialise in pregnancy crisis issues.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"http://bridgendpcc.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> Bridgend Pregnancy Crisis Centre (Counselling And Support)  </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@bridgendpcc.org\">info@bridgendpcc.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01656654700\" target=\"_blank\">01656 654700</a></p><h1 data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></h1></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c360dc11c0396ca8395e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
