    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69c0fbcd6851c61701ed62b0\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"2bc030525eaa24b08ff1\" id=\"block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"is-empty is-editor-empty\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Butterfly Bereavement Café offers a place, where those who have been bereaved either recently or a long time ago, can come along for a free hot drink and some friendly chat with others who understand how they may be feeling. Those who run the café have been bereaved themselves and know how helpful peer-to-peer support can be. It is a drop-in café so everyone over 18 is welcome and if you are coming for the first time, you may bring a friend.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>When: </strong>Every Monday from 10 - 11.30am</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Where: </strong>Collydean Community Centre Torphins Avenue Glenrothes KY7 6UL</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>CONTACT </strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Email: </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:butterflybereavementcafe22@gmail.com\">butterflybereavementcafe22@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Telephone: </strong><a href=\"tel:07706209018\">07706209018</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-2bc030525eaa24b08ff1 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
