    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a12\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13\" id=\"block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CancerCare is an independent charity dedicated to helping people and their families in North Lancashire and South Cumbria who have been affected by cancer, life-shortening illnesses, or those bereaved by cancer, life-shortening illness, sudden and unexpected death. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We offer a range of complimentary therapy services, including one-to-one counselling, group sessions and other forms of holistic therapy. The services are provided by professional and highly trained practitioners and each client's journey is tailored to suit their individual needs and requirements. The services are designed to complement treatment and advice from other healthcare professionals. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">As well as services for adults, CancerCare also supports children and young people who have experienced a bereavement of any kind, or have been impacted by cancer.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have four centres in Lancaster, Kendal, Barrow-in-Furness and Morecambe, as well as a wealth of online resources. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you are based in North Lancashire or South Cumbria and have experienced a cancer diagnosis or a bereavement, please get in touch with CancerCare to see how we can help you. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://cancercare.org.uk/local-cancer-support-services/cancer-and-bereavement-counselling\" target=\"_blank\">CancerCare (Cancer And Bereavement Counselling)</a>   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:  <a href=\"tel:01524381820\" target=\"_blank\">01524 381820&nbsp;</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:tct@cancercare.org.uk\">tct@cancercare.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c366dc11c0396ca83a13 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
