    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c44c22796e02012641d7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c44c22796e02012641d8\" id=\"block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Centre 33 offers free and confidential counselling for young people between the age of 13 and 25 who live in Cambridgeshire. They offer a friendly and non-judgemental ‘drop-in’ service at their hubs in Cambridge, Ely, Huntingdon, Peterborough and Wisbech where you can meet with a member of staff to talk about any issues that are troubling you or provide services to support you – such as counselling, housing advice, or our sexual health service. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.centre33.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Centre 33 (Confidential Counselling)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:hello@centre33.org.uk\">hello@centre33.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:03334141809\" target=\"_blank\">03334141809</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Text/WhatsApp:</strong> <a href=\"sms:07514783745\" target=\"_blank\">07514783745</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Addresses:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cambridge: 33 Clarendon Street, Cambridge, CB1 1JX</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ely: 24a Barton Road, Ely, CB7 4DE</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Huntingdon: The Old Chapel, Ferrars Road, Huntingdon, PE29 3DH</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Peterborough: 4 Cumbergate, Peterborough, PE1 1YR</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wisbech: The Annabelle Davis Centre, Love Lane, Wisbech, PE13 1HP</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c44c22796e02012641d8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
