    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c44e22796e020126421b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"355a590c0bf478d84b6b\" id=\"block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Changes Bristol</strong> provide peer support groups in Bristol and online for anyone aged 18 or over, offering a safe and friendly space for people to share any worries they might have. The groups are free to access, confidential, with no referral needed and no diagnosis required. They also now offer one-to-one phone befriending for new and existing members.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://changesbristol.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Changes Bristol (Peer Support Groups) </a>    </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@changesbristol.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">info@changesbristol.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Changes Bristol</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Barton Hill Settlement</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">41-43 Ducie Road</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lawrence Hill</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bristol</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">BS5 0AX</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-355a590c0bf478d84b6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
