    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix3W",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45022796e0201264236\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45022796e0201264237\" id=\"block-67d1c45022796e0201264237\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CHAS Bereavement Service provides support to the family, and other significant others, of a child who has died from a life shortening condition at any age. They will also support where a child has received end of life care following an accident. The family doesn’t need to have been known to CHAS or have used any of their other services. CHAS’ bereavement support is available across Scotland.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CHAS offer one-one, family support, therapeutic groups and opportunities to connect with other bereaved parents.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> CHAS Bereavement Service can also provide support and consultation to those who are already supporting a child who has a life shortening condition, or has died – such as school communities, groups etc.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you are not sure if CHAS Bereavement Service offer the support you are looking for then please get in touch and they can talk through your options with you.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:BereavementTeam@chas.org.uk\">BereavementTeam@chas.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: Robin House:  <a href=\"tel:01389722055\" target=\"_blank\">01389 722055</a> or Rachel House: <a href=\"tel:01577865777\" target=\"_blank\">01577 865777</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45022796e0201264237 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
