    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/child-bereavement-uk-birmingham",
    "title": "Child Bereavement UK - Birmingham",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Child Bereavement UK supports families in Birmingham when a child grieves or when a child dies. They provide assistance to children and young people up to the age of 25 who have lost someone important, as well as to parents and families when a baby or child of any age dies or is dying.</p>",
