    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45b22796e0201264339\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45b22796e020126433a\" id=\"block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Service can support anyone of any age from the earliest days following a suspected suicide. Providing both emotional and practical support to all impacted by the death. Whether you are a parent seeking support in how to tell children, partner, parent, sibling, friend, colleague, or being impacted by the death of a stranger. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">BSBS can act as liaison with police, coroners and other professionals at this confusing, difficult time. We can continue support through the inquest process and those difficult important anniversaries. The BSBS provides a listening ear and if counselling is required, we will signpost or refer to different, relevant services according to need.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Offifical Website: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fchums.uk.com%2Fbedfordshire-suicide-bereavement%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csummer.othman%40ataloss.org%7C02d4c8af86b043eeebed08dd02fd7216%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638670009749418990%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=kaM51IhatUtgAoBkwl%2BP7GRHGKCss0%2Bv%2BhutIXahEeU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">CHUMS - Bedfordshire Suicide Bereavement Service (Emotional Wellbeing Services)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact</strong></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bsbs@chums.uk.com\">bsbs@chums.uk.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01525863924\" target=\"_blank\">01525 863924 </a>office hours</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For more information or to make a referral please email the bsbs or follow link to the referral form on the website.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45b22796e020126433a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
