    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f15\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16\" id=\"block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">City Counselling Services pride themselves in offering a professional and caring service to anyone struggling with their grief in the aftermath of a bereavement.  They provide counselling in Swansea and offer weekend and evening sessions and have both male and female qualified counsellors who are registered members of the BACP (British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy) or are working towards accreditation.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Disabled Access and parking nearby.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.citycounsellingservices.com/\" target=\"_blank\">City Counselling Services - Swansea (Counselling Support)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:ccsswansea@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">ccsswansea@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01792824590\" target=\"_blank\">01792 824590</a> (office hours 9am to 7pm)</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">City Counselling Services, <br>C/o Swansea Wellbeing Centre, 11 Walter Rd, Burman St, Swansea SA1 5PQ</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45202dc126ebbf55f16 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
