    "title": "City Hospice Bereavement Services - Bridgend and Rhondda Cynon Taff",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Bereavement support is available as a free service open to bereaved families who have lost someone at the City Hospice Cardiff, but living in the County of Bridgend and those living in Rhondda Cynon Taff<strong>.&nbsp;</strong></p>",
