    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b\" id=\"block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Concern Cymru’s purpose is to provide a community service that helps people in their time of need. As a registered charity, they do not charge for counselling, but rely on donations.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The key office is based at <strong>Cathays</strong> in Cardiff, where their dedicated counselling rooms are used to serve referrals from across the <strong>South Wales</strong> area. They also have bases in <strong>Pontypridd</strong>, the <strong>Afan Valley</strong>, <strong>Ebbw Vale</strong> and <strong>Peterston-Super-Ely</strong>, from which communities in this area can access our services.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They recognise that people can only come for counselling at certain days and times and are therefore entirely flexible. We offer counselling during the days <strong>Monday to Friday</strong> between the hours of <strong>10am until 9pm</strong> in the evening.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"https://concerncymru.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> Concern Cymru (Counselling Service)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02920664410\" target=\"_blank\">02920 664410</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Concern Cymru</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Ark Community Centre, Ararat Baptist Church,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Plas Teroda,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cardiff, CF14 1PT</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45602dc126ebbf55f6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
