    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix4F",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f98\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99\" id=\"block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Cornerstone Care Pregnancy Advice Centre offers Post-abortion counselling as a free service through Cornerstone available to men and women. They offer both support for abortions, and miscarriages.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Although an abortion is something a woman may have chosen for various reasons at a difficult time in her life, it may still be an extremely painful emotional experience for her afterwards. Even if it was a long time ago.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><br>Many women find it difficult to understand why they feel the way they do. Partners may not seem to understand; tension rises. Relationships break down. Life can seem overwhelming.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">These symptoms can surface even years after the abortion or miscarriage.  Our trained advisors are able to offer a programme of support to women who have had an abortion or miscarriage through confidential, one to one sessions that are done entirely at your own pace and are open to anyone, at any time following an abortion or miscarriage.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.pregnancyadvice.org.uk/Groups/263805/Had_an_abortion.aspx\">Cornerstone Care (Counselling And Caring Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email:  info@pregnancyadvice.org.uk</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:01480457711\">01480 457711</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Out of Hours: Huntingdon area is <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:07760146411\">07760146411</a>/ Cambridge area it is <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:07305744592\">07305744592</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Cornerstone Care in Confidence</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">1a Trinity Place, Huntingdon, PE29 3QA</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45802dc126ebbf55f99 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
