    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbd\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe\" id=\"block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Jo Williams is a qualified psychotherapist and an Individual Member of the British Association of Counselling and Psychotherapy (BACP). Her counselling experience also includes over 2 years working in the NHS Counselling Psychology Service within SBU, which as part of its work, offered bereavement support to patients. She has extensive experience of working with young people 11-25.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The counselling service is situated at Life Therapy Centre, and is ideally situated in the heart of Swansea, convenient for transport and opposite easy parking.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.counsellingwithjo.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Counselling With Jo (Counselling Service In Swansea) </a>   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07598380715\" target=\"_blank\">07598380715</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">1 Pell Street, Swansea, SA1 3ES</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c45a02dc126ebbf55fbe .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
