    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix65",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35ba\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb\" id=\"block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dandelion Dreams is able to offer each bereaved family as much support as they need, to help guide them through the process of creating a relevant and meaningful farewell for a child. Some families may choose to invite us to provide practical hands on assistance, while others a subtle guiding hand in the background is all that is required. Through its special support for bereaved families who have lost a child, Dandelion Farewells offer;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- care for the child who has died</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- completion of paperwork for the funeral</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- private premises for family visits</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- advice on venues, coffins, celebrants</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- provision of a vehicle and staff for the transport of the child on the day of the funeral</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- suggestions for elements of personalisation in the funeral</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://dandelionfarewells.com/dandelion-dreams/\" target=\"_blank\">Dandelion Dreams (Bereavement Support)</a>   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Judith@dandelionfarewells.com\">Judith@dandelionfarewells.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01403701001\" target=\"_blank\">01403 701001</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our general funeral support is at: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdandelionfarewells.com%2Findividual-funeral-arrangements%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csummer.othman%40ataloss.org%7C4b8e46509c444cf90ee208dd0f2c3424%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638683404768994729%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=1K7p0%2Fs2gPrbQ%2BSi18X8T1aH6%2FvRHMiHpO8jQf5MxdM%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">DandelionFarewells</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Church View,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Billinghurst Rd</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wisborough Green,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">West Sussex</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">RH14 0DY</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c58f1f66970dbfbb35bb .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
