    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb3609\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a\" id=\"block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Serving the communities of Macclesfield, Buxton, Congleton, High Leigh, High Peak, Knutsford, Poynton, Wilmslow and the surrounding areas.  Adult Counselling at East Cheshire Hospice is available to carers, family and close friends of people who have died in the three years preceding referral where loved ones accessed Hospice services in some way. Pre/anticipatory grief counselling is also available to carers and family members who’s loved one is currently using the services of East Cheshire Hospice.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.eastcheshirehospice.org.uk/our-care/patients-families/family-support-services/adult-therapy/\" target=\"\">Adult Therapy - East Cheshire Hospice</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <strong> </strong><a href=\"mailto:cmicb-cheshire.echospicefsbereavement@nhs.net\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">cmicb-cheshire.echospicefsbereavement@nhs.net</span></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01625610364\" target=\"_blank\">01625 610364</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">East Cheshire Hospice Adult Bereavement<br>East Cheshire Hospice<br>Millbank Drive<br>Macclesfield <br>Cheshire<br>SK10 3DR<br><br></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c5991f66970dbfbb360a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
