    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35ce\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf\" id=\"block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services available throughout Derbyshire and across the East Midlands offering home visits and monthly Lighthouse Group Meetings to anyone who has been bereaved, at any time, through an asbestos related disease.</p><h1 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Whats on offer?</h1><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They offer many different types of support. For bereavement support they offer one on one support, home visits, telephone befriending and Lighthouse Bereavement Support Groups who meet monthly. They also publish a bi-monthly newsletter on our website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">East Midlands Asbestos Support Team also offer advice for benefits and posthumous claims, as well as advice on compensation and probate applications. They also provide support through coroner process including inquest.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.emast.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">East Midlands Asbestos Support Team (Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement.support@emast.org.uk\">bereavement.support@emast.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01246 380415\">01246 380415</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c5921f66970dbfbb35cf .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
