    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8\" id=\"block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eden’s Trust provides a network of support/survival groups and educational workshops for parents and siblings who have suffered the loss of a child or sibling.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eden’s Trust runs support groups to help bereaved parents and siblings who have lost a child or sibling of any age. The charity offers<strong> FREE</strong> counselling: 1:1, couples, family, trauma counselling for bereaved parents and siblings, all facilitated by fully qualified counsellors, and there is no waiting list. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Healing Place' is open to parents who have suffered a loss of a child of any age. They help to support mums and dads as they struggle to come to terms with what has happened to them.  The Healing Place gives parents the chance to talk about their children, to share their experiences and to give and receive support. Dates: On the first and third Monday of each month.  Please check Eden's Trust website for times.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">‘Say Hello’ is open to anybody who has lost a brother or sister and needs support to help them come out of ‘the other side of bereavement’. For further information about the group, call on <a href=\"tel:07814550375\" target=\"_blank\">07814 550 375</a> or <a href=\"https://www.edenstrust.org.uk/contact/\">email</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dates: On the <strong>last</strong> Monday of every month, from 19:00 to 21:00.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">MIM - Men In Mind' is open to dads who have lost a child or men who have lost family members.  This group is specifically run for men as, by their very nature, they tend to hold back on talking about their feelings.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dates: on the 2nd Monday of each month from 19.00 to 21:00. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"http://www.edenstrust.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> Eden’s Trust (Support/Survival Groups)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@edenstrust.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">info@edenstrust.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07814550375\" target=\"_blank\">07814 550 375</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Venue: Wanstead House, 21 The Green, Wanstead, E11 2NT</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73373a24a5e1a3d12d8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
