    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12de\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df\" id=\"block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eleanor Barnes Counselling is registered with COSCA (Counselling &amp; Psychotherapy in Scotland). This is Scotland's professional body for counselling and psychotherapy which seeks to promote high quality counselling supervision and continuing professional development for all individuals and agencies delivering counselling services in Scotland. Please check the COSCA website for more information - <a href=\"https://www.cosca.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">COSCA</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This counsellor provides bereavement support and other services.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.eleanorbarnescounselling.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Eleanor Barnes Counselling (Counselling And Psychotherapy)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:07747624402\" target=\"_blank\">07747 624402</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73473a24a5e1a3d12df .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
