    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4\" id=\"block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Elsie's Moon host one off sessions including crafts, memory making and walks to continue with the journey in breaking the silence around fertility, loss and trauma. Providing a safe place surrounded by those who 'get it'.<br><br>They fund one to one counselling sessions for families across the Wirral and local areas, as well as offering Wellbeing Classes. For more information on these, please have a look at their 'support' page.<br><br>They provide different packages, to individuals, hospices, hospitals and organisations. These include Little Butterfly packs for early loss, Elsie's Essential's packs for those times families didn't expect to be in hospital, they include all the essentials for a first night's unprepared stay, and Virtual Hug packs for families when we can't reach out to give them a hug.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.elsiesmoon.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Elsie’s Moon (Counselling For Early Loss)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Through website.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73673a24a5e1a3d12f4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
