    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69c652a140821d01ee148b48\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8\" id=\"block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The St Vincent de Paul Society bereavement café based in Evesham is open to anyone who is bereaved it is free of charge and offers a monthly place for people to go for a chat, refreshment, find support and bereavement courses. You can be helped to find other support services as well. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>They provide:</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Bereavement Café on the 4th Tuesday of each month, 10am until 12, at Wallace House, Oat Street, Evesham WR11 4PJ 10am-12noon.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">They run The Bereavement Journey twice a year. Please contact them via the email detailed below to find out when the next course will run.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:eveshamreferrals@svp.org.uk\">eveshamreferrals@svp.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Tel: </strong><a href=\"tel:07713623997\">0771 362 3997</a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Note:</strong> All of this is free of charge and run by SVP volunteers who are DBS checked, references have been given, Safeguarding and how to support bereaved people training has also been done.&nbsp; This is support not counselling but they can signpost to further support if necessary.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-73a5bca4cf7ac31842e8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
