    "title": "Eye to Eye Counselling Service",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Eye to Eye Counselling Service offers a free and confidential counselling to people aged 10 to 30 years in schools and the community in Rhondda Cynon Taf. Their Trauma response team also cover Bridgend and Merthyr. They offer support, signposting and advice to young people and adults after a traumatic loss.</p>",
