    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d131f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320\" id=\"block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eye to Eye Counselling Service offers a free and confidential counselling to people aged 10 to 30 years in schools and the community in Rhondda Cynon Taf. Their Trauma response team also cover Bridgend and Merthyr. They offer support, signposting and advice to young people and adults after a traumatic loss.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eye to Eye has been working in RCT since 1995 and are the main delivers of counselling services to young people aged 10 to 30 years. They deliver all school counselling and have a dedicated Trauma team. Their counsellors work with clients for any loss they encounter, including a parent, sibling, grandparents or friend.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.eyetoeye.wales/\" target=\"_blank\">Eye To Eye Counselling Service (Free And Confidential Counselling)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@eyetoeye.wales?\" target=\"_blank\">info@eyetoeye.wales</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01443202940\" target=\"_blank\">01443 202940</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Eye to Eye Counselling Service<br>Beddau Community Education Centre<br>Bryncelynnog School<br>Beddau<br>CF38 2AE</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73b73a24a5e1a3d1320 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
