    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b\" id=\"block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Falkirk Trinity Church offers bereavement support groups for both adults and children / young people. This confidential service is open to all in the local community, of any faith or none, and is free of charge.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is an educational programme, not counselling or therapy. Using Seasons for Growth material we meet in small groups once a week. The aim is to build resilience and bring hope and confidence following a bereavement. It is the support from one another and the feeling that you are not on your own that is most valued as well as the opportunity to talk about your feelings in a safe place.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">To find out more please contact us by email or by phoning the Church Office.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>“Grief is not a problem to be solved. It’s an experience to be supported, witnessed and held.”</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://falkirktrinity.org.uk/adult-seasons-for-growth-bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Falkirk Trinity Church Bereavement Support (Educational Programme)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <strong> </strong><a href=\"mailto:bereavementsupport@falkirktrinity.org.uk\">bereavementsupport@falkirktrinity.org.uk</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01324611017\" target=\"_blank\">01324 611017</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Falkirk Trinity Church<br>Manse Place<br>Falkirk<br>Scotland<br>FK1 1JN</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73d73a24a5e1a3d133b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
