    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix6x",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f\" id=\"block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services offered: Counselling, 24-hour helpline and coffee mornings, reaching out across the UK and further to individuals and families seeking bereavement support.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A non-profit organisation, Finding Rainbows provide support to anyone who has suffered a loss, including families who have lost of a baby or child through early pregnancy loss. </p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They offer a one-to-one counselling and group sessions at a time convenient to you. Natalie Cook who is the founder and director of Finding Rainbows offers face to face support, over the phone, via email and home visits where needed.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Finding Rainbows understand that bereavement can lead to many other complex issues but work closely with other organisations in the community who can offer support in different areas and accept referrals from other organisations including GP services as well as being able to refer if needed. </p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://findingrainbows.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Finding Rainbows (Baby And Child Bereavement Service)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Finding.rainbows@outlook.com\">Finding.rainbows@outlook.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Natalie :    <a href=\"tel:07340799387\" target=\"_blank\">07340799387</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lisa :         <a href=\"tel:07557648154\" target=\"_blank\">07557648154</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address -9 Fletcher Street, 1st Floor, Ashton Under Lyne, OL6 6BY</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74173a24a5e1a3d135f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
