    "title": "Forest Holme Hospice Charity, Bereavement Café",
    "excerpt": "<p>Bereavement Café is open to everyone irrespective of any connection to Forest Holme. It takes place on the 2nd and 3rd Saturday of the month, and is based at Café at Lighthouse, 21 Kingland Road, Poole, BH15 1UG.</p>\n",
