    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b\" id=\"block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Offering Bereavement Support through counselling, music therapy and support groups for families of patients who have died at Forget Me Not Hospice. Specialist support is also provided for siblings and grandparents of child patients who have died.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.forgetmenotchild.co.uk/help-for-families/how-we-help/our-services/family-support-services/bereavement-support\" target=\"_blank\">Forget Me Not Children's Hospice (Family Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:contact@forgetmenotchild.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">contact@forgetmenotchild.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <strong> </strong><a href=\"tel:01484411040\" target=\"_blank\">01484 411040</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: Russell House, Fell Greave Rd, Huddersfield, HD2 1NH</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74573a24a5e1a3d138b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
