    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c\" id=\"block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Freddie's Wish offers immediate short term bereavement support for those who are bereaved less than two years and for after two years they have a more comprehensive bereavement counselling option.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wellbeing and bereavement support:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For those who are lost their baby or child less than 2 years ago</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">6 sessions maximum (including an initial assessment session)</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">These sessions will provide initial guidance and support on how to navigate the emotions of early grief.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please be aware that there may be a waiting list to access this support depending on demand. However, if this is the case, this will be communicated to you as soon as your referral has been made.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Specialist Bereavement Counselling:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For those whose child or baby died than two years ago</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">12 sessions maximum (Including initial assessment session)</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Full counselling support to navigate how to start to rebuild your life around the bereavement of your baby or child.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">After the first two years after suffering the death of a baby or child, people are generally able to start to explore ways of rebuilding their lives around their bereavement. Therefore, it is at this stage that more thorough counselling or other support can be pursued.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://freddieswish.org/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Freddie’s Wish (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@freddieswish.org\">info@freddieswish.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74673a24a5e1a3d139c .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
