    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13aa\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab\" id=\"block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Full Circle is a female-led organisation with backgrounds in health, social and pastoral care. As well as providing funeral services, they work hard to contribute to improving the well-being of every bereaved person by running educational programs, leading funeral research (in partnership with academics from various Universities), producing a funeral self-help book, raising awareness about funeral choices, continuing bonds and bereavement support and well-being in bereavement.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">To complement their funeral service, they host a monthly informal bereavement support meeting<strong> on the first Wednesday of the month held on Zoom</strong>, starting at 5.30pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The <a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/bereavement-support/bereavement-support-meeting/\" target=\"_blank\">support group</a> is a very informal peer support group with no formal agenda.  Some people choose to come and share their experiences whereas others prefer to simply listen. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/about-us/\" target=\"_blank\"> Full Circle Funerals &amp; Bereavement Services (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/contact/\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Full Circle</a></p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone details</strong></h4><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/funeral-directors-leeds/\" target=\"_blank\">Leeds</a>: <a href=\"tel:01133200049\" target=\"_blank\">0113 320 0049</a></h3><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/about-us/funeral-directors-guiseley/\" target=\"_blank\">Guiseley</a>: <a href=\"tel:01943262626\" target=\"_blank\">01943 262626</a></h3><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bradford: <a href=\"tel:01274271100\" target=\"_blank\">01274 271 100</a></h3><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://fullcirclefunerals.co.uk/about-us/funeral-directors-harrogate/\" target=\"_blank\">Harrogate</a>: <a href=\"tel:01423740799\" target=\"_blank\">01423 740 799</a></h3><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74773a24a5e1a3d13ab .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
