    "title": "Full Circle Funerals Peer Support",
    "excerpt": "<p>Full Circle Funerals, a Funeral Director in West Yorkshire helps to facilitate and support bereavement peer support groups in the area. You can see their directory of West Yorkshire peer support groups on their website.</p>\n",
