    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8354\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355\" id=\"block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Established by the Gloucester Crematorium team, all are welcome to join the weekly bereavement coffee morning however long ago they were bereaved.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">It is informal and an opportunity to talk to others who are also bereaved, make new friends and socialise with a group of people who really understand what you are going through. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you feel that someone needs extra support, please let them know about the group and that they are welcome to come along. Willows Tearoom is based at Gloucester Cemetery and Crematorium site.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Free tea, coffee and biscuits are provided at the Willows Tearoom every Wednesday from 10:00 - 12:00.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Location: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Willows Tearoom, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Gloucester Crematorium, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coney Hill, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Gloucester, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">GL4 4PA</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Phone</strong>: You can just turn up or call for more information <a href=\"tel:01452396902\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>(01452) 396 902</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c73f2a17bf0e569f8355 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
