    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6937ec1b7f17d72386310e55\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"924519ff687561b60b80\" id=\"block-924519ff687561b60b80\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A welcoming free to attend monthly drop-in café for people who have experienced the death of someone close. This peer-led bereavement support group is informal, offering a safe space to meet others, share experiences, and find comfort among people who understand, whether your loss is recent or from some time ago.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Cafe is part of the outreach from St Catherine’s Hospice’ Compassionate Communities programme. It is facilitated by volunteers from the hospice and local churches. No booking required, just turn up.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The café takes place:</strong> First Thursday of every month, 1:00 pm – 2:30 pm<br>Trinity Methodist Church, Gregson Lane, Gregson Lane, PR5 0ED (Preston / Chorley area)</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stcatherines.co.uk/shop/events/hospice-care-and-support/gregson-lane-bereavement-cafe-15/\" target=\"_blank\">Gregson Lane Bereavement Café</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact:</strong><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:communities@stcatherines.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">communities@stcatherines.co.uk</a><br>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01772629171\" target=\"_blank\">01772 629171</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-924519ff687561b60b80 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-924519ff687561b60b80 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-924519ff687561b60b80 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-924519ff687561b60b80 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-924519ff687561b60b80 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-924519ff687561b60b80 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-924519ff687561b60b80 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
