    "title": "Grieving Together Group at St James Church",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">'Grieving Together' at St James Church meets on Thursdays at 11.30am for about an hour. You are invited to have drinks and snacks and chat, and usually spend some part of the time doing an activity together, decided on by the group. </p>",
