    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-68495e3e60ac691b52b6dda7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"bbd43beff09f4f775991\" id=\"block-bbd43beff09f4f775991\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Grieving Together' at St James Church meets on Thursdays at 11.30am for about an hour. You are invited to have drinks and snacks and chat, and usually spend some part of the time doing an activity together, decided on by the group. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">These activities have included going for a walk in the park, making crafts, writing poetry, bringing in a memento of a loved one etc. The activity is usually themed around some aspect of grief, but the group is very informal and sometimes everyone  just chats and eat cake. <br><br>The group meets at St James Church, but welcomes people of any faith or none. Staff from the local funeral director bring their wealth of experience and help to facilitate the group.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For more information please call Rev. Tom on <a href=\"tel:01612261291\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">0161 226 1291</span></a> or email <a href=\"mailto:stedsandstjames@gmail.com\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">stedsandstjames@gmail.com</span></a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">.</span><br><br>Address: St James Church, 95a Princess Road, Moss Side, M14 4TH.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-bbd43beff09f4f775991 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
