    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7\" id=\"block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">HAHAV is a volunteer led charity, set up in 2015 to provide practical help, social care and companionship for people in the county of Ceredigion with chronic, life limiting illness. Their support offer is also open to family, carers and those loved ones affected by the death of a HAHAV client. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their services sit alongside and complement the work of the Hywel Dda Palliative Care Team with whom they have a strong, ongoing partnership.Offering a series of one-to-one bereavement support sessions with trained bereavement volunteers. All sessions are in person. Bereavement support is offered in Welsh or English, whichever language you are most comfortable with.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://hahav.org.uk/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">HAHAV (Hospice at Home Volunteers) (Bereavement Care)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:susie.scott@hahav.org.uk\">susie.scott@hahav.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01970611550\" target=\"_blank\">01970 611550</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Plas Antaron<br>Southgate <br>Aberystwyth<br>Ceredigion (mid-Wales)<br>SY23 1SF</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74b2a17bf0e569f83d7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
