    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5\" id=\"block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hannah's House is a place of refuge supporting children after the death of a sibling through any kind of baby loss. Coming alongside the whole family for every step of the journey through to healing after babyloss. Helping bereaved parents find hope after loss and support their children.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They provide peer support, a <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hannahshousecov/events/?ref=page_internal\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Parenting With Hope group</strong></span></a> a Facebook Group, parent support through Grief Recovery Method support - either in a group setting or one-to-one.  They provide goodie bags for children and online support group. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://hannahshouse.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Hannah's House (Grief Support)</a><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:hope@hannahshouse.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>hope@hannahshouse.org.uk</strong></span></a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74d2a17bf0e569f83e5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
