    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4\" id=\"block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Harry's Rainbow support children and young people who have been bereaved of a parent or sibling in, and around, the area of Milton Keynes, Buckinghamshire. We offer support through activity groups for ages 0-11, 11-18, 18-25 and a parent support group, trips, activities, a memory box for each bereaved child, books, school support and therapeutic services. There is no waiting list and you are registered for support up to the young person's age of 25. We also provide information and guidance on our website and on social media.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Our services are designed to support families, children and young people in their grieving process, reduce the loneliness of grief, encourage connections and give children a brighter tomorrow.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://harrysrainbow.co.uk/\">Harry's Rainbow (Youth Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Address : </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Harry's Rainbow</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Suite 631</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Milton Keynes Business centre</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Foxhunter Drive</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Linford Wood</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Milton Keynes</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">MK14 6GD</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Email: </strong><a href=\"mailto:info@harrysrainbow.co.uk\">info@harrysrainbow.co.uk</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Tel: </strong><a href=\"tel:01908061676\">01908 061676</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c74e2a17bf0e569f83f4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
