    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8\" id=\"block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Held In Our Hearts has over 40 years of experience of offering compassionate bereavement care through specialist baby loss counselling and peer support. Individual and group peer support and counselling and support groups is available for bereaved families throughout Edinburgh, the Lothians, Borders, Fife, Forth Valley and the Highlands. The majority of the staff are bereaved parents themselves so understand the impact of baby loss.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For more info please email or call as per below</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.heldinourhearts.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Held in Our Hearts (Baby Loss Counselling/Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@heldinourhearts.org.uk\">info@heldinourhearts.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <strong> </strong><a href=\"tel:01316226263\" target=\"_blank\">01316226263</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Held In Our Hearts, Craiglockhart Centre<br>177 Colinton Road <br>Edinburgh<br>Lothian<br>Eh14 1BZ</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8855d3c280a4e04a8d8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
