    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5\" id=\"block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A registered charity based in North London and are the longest serving counselling service in the UK. Offering affordable counselling to offer help with emotional and relationship problems. They provide counselling for individuals, families and groups and are BACP recognised. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their counsellors also speak a number of native languages as their first language. If you have a specific need, please make this known to them when you contact them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://highgatecounselling.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Highgate Counselling Centre (Psycho-dynamic Counselling)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:<a href=\"mailto:admin@highgatecounselling.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">admin@highgatecounselling.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02088835427\" target=\"_blank\">020 8883 5427</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Highgate Counselling Centre<br>58a Highgate High Street, London.<br>N6 5HX</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8895d3c280a4e04a8f5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
