    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a905\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906\" id=\"block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Vanessa May is a holistic grief coach, certified grief educator and nutritional therapist. Her approach is to holistically address both the physical and emotional aspects of grief. She offers tools to help ease some of the pain of loss, as well as heartfelt understanding and compassion.<br><br>Vanessa is a bereaved mother and widow, so has a deep personal understanding of grief. She works exclusively online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Vanessa has written three books on grief. 'Love Untethered: How to live when your child dies', 'Supporting Your Grieving Client: A guide for wellness practitioners' and ‘When Grief Takes Everything: A Survival Guide to Devastating Loss’.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.wellbeingandnutrition.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Holistic Grief Coaching (Grief Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:vanessa@wellbeingandnutrition.co.uk\">vanessa@wellbeingandnutrition.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07962978763\" target=\"_blank\">07962 978763</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88b5d3c280a4e04a906 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
