    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a913\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914\" id=\"block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The six-week 'Hope Again' programme offers the kind of support that is needed, as it focuses on particular aspects of the journey of loss, and allows people to feel they are in the company of those who are dealing with common concerns and feelings. The Hope Again programmes have been developed by a group of trained local people, a number of whom will deliver each programme and is supported by an experienced counsellor with CRUSE Bereavement Service</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">So the Hope Again programme is open to all who are living with loss. During the six weeks of the programme there will be an opportunity to think about the bereavement journey; health issues; looking after yourself; socialising; and moving on.  For more information visit the website. Contact the number/email address below to find out about the next programme.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.hifriends.org.uk/wellbeing/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Hope Again, Histon &amp; Impington Community (Bereavement Support)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:07707263353\" target=\"_blank\">0770 7263353 </a>or </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:hopeagain@hifriends.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">hopeagain@hifriends.org.uk</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88d5d3c280a4e04a914 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
