    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ix8J",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a91f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920\" id=\"block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>If you’ve experienced the trauma of having a loved one killed in a fire, a road traffic collision, or drowning — no matter your age, or how long ago it happened — HOPE is here for you.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We understand that a bereavement like this, or witnessing such a traumatic event, can change your life in ways that are hard to put into words. The impact may stay with you for years, in different ways and at different times.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You don’t have to face it alone.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you feel ready to talk, or if you’d like to connect with others who understand, HOPE offers support and a peer support group for individuals and families across South Yorkshire. Just call or email us, and someone from our team will reach out to you personally.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We’re here to walk alongside you, whenever you’re ready.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://hope-sy.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">HOPE Charity (Bereavement Support)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@hope-sy.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">info@hope-sy.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01142270105\" target=\"_blank\">0114-227-0105</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">HOPE - South Yorkshire Trauma Support<br>The Quadrant<br>99 Parkway Avenue<br>Sheffield<br>S9 4WG</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88e5d3c280a4e04a920 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
