    "title": "Hope House &amp; Tŷ Gobaith Counselling &amp; Bereavement Support",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This support is available to the bereaved families of children and young people up to 19 years of age at the time of death who were registered with the hospices and who live in Shropshire, Cheshire, Mid or North Wales. </p>",
