    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c\" id=\"block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hope Therapy is a select professional body of counsellors, psychotherapists and other practitioners. They are a mental health and wellbeing organisation providing high-quality care, counselling and therapeutic support. They offer support to and work with individuals, students, couples and families from all backgrounds. Working with issues from the aftershock of a unique and traumatic event, through to the personal crisis of alcohol dependency, feelings of grief &amp; loss, challenges within a relationship or feelings of anxiety, panic, anger or depression.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Due to the vast range of our team, they cover various locations, to be able to support you in a face-to-face capacity, wherever you are. However, due to the advancement in online therapies, they are also able to offer our services online via platforms such as zoom, teams and facetime. <br><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.hopefulminds.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Hope Therapy And Counselling Services (Counselling Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <strong> </strong><a href=\"mailto:contact@hopefulminds.co.uk\">contact@hopefulminds.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07379538411\" target=\"_blank\">07379538411</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hope Therapy and Counselling Services<br>44 Denchworth Road<br>Smiths Wharf<br>Wantage<br>Oxfordshire<br>OX12 9ES</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8915d3c280a4e04a93c .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
