    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a962\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963\" id=\"block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If U Care Share Foundation is a charity based in North East England, offering one to one practical and emotional support to those bereaved by suicide. Also support for those contemplating suicide and those supporting someone after suicide.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"http://www.ifucareshare.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> If U Care Share Foundation (Suicide Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:share@ifucareshare.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">share@ifucareshare.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01913875661\" target=\"_blank\">0191 3875661</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If U Care Share Foundation,<br>27, The Close East,<br>South Pelaw,<br>Chester-le-Street,<br>Co Durham,<br>DH2 2EY</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8945d3c280a4e04a963 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
