    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-69f9a05515477b1d4355de0e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"df1d52224d25243efcf4\" id=\"block-df1d52224d25243efcf4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Improving Lives Plymouth offers a weekly wellbeing walk in the beautiful grounds of the Saltram estate. The walk is therapeutic in the sense that it is a small group of people who have or are in the process of coming to terms with a bereavement. The walk is on the cancer care journey (The Mustard Tree Certified Hospital) map.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Meeting place:</strong> The group meets in front of the duck pond at Saltram.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Time:</strong> The walks are <strong>every Wednesday 3pm, </strong>the walk lasts for approximately 1/1.5 hours and then the group optionally goes for a coffee at the café.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">It’s best that people text (<a href=\"sms:07483365317\">074 8336 5317</a>) to let <strong>Saffron</strong> from Improving Lives Plymouth know, if they are planning to attend. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Saffron</strong> is also happy to have<strong> an initial phone call/ one to one</strong> walk at Saltram for those that are nervous to join a group walk and who might want to meet / talk to her first.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.improvinglivesplymouth.org.uk/\">Improving Lives Plymouth</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Ilp@improvinglivesplymouth.org.uk\">Ilp@improvinglivesplymouth.org.uk</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01752201766\">017 5220 1766</a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-df1d52224d25243efcf4 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-df1d52224d25243efcf4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-df1d52224d25243efcf4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-df1d52224d25243efcf4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-df1d52224d25243efcf4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
