    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Insights Bereavement Service is a free, local organisation staffed by volunteers trained to listen. We currently we have three peer support groups including an afternoon one, a new evening group and a carer's&nbsp;group for those with loved ones diagnosed with dementia and cognitive impairment.</p>",
