    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0c9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca\" id=\"block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Location:</strong> Southwick, West Sussex, UK.&nbsp; Available - Face-to-face (free parking and disability accessible) and online across the UK and worldwide.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Donna Williamson is a fully qualified therapeutic counsellor offering compassionate support for those navigating loss, bereavement, living with a lifelong illness, or caring for a loved one. She works alongside you at your own pace, creating a safe and supportive environment where you can explore your emotions freely.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Recognising that words are not always enough, Donna integrates a range of creative tools to help you express and process feelings in ways that feel natural and meaningful.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Counselling &amp; Psychotherapy:</strong> Tailored sessions designed to meet individual needs, addressing a wide range of emotional and psychological concerns.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement &amp; Anticipatory Grief Support:</strong> Calm, empathetic space, to explore feelings such as loneliness, anxiety, anger, and depression.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Professional Accreditation:</strong> Accredited Member of the National Counselling &amp; Psychotherapy Society (MNCPS Acc).</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Experience in bereavement:</strong> Supporting individuals and families through end-of-life and bereavement journeys in Private Practice and years of voluntary service at St Wilfrid’s Hospice and Macmillian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:intrepidcounselling@gmail.com\">intrepidcounselling@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07523218389\" target=\"_blank\">07523218389</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88ea9d454079c63d0ca .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
