    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2\" id=\"block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A team of trained Bereavement support workers and counsellors are here to offer one-to-one support for loved ones of patients who were cared for by Isabel Hospice. We offer support to both bereaved adults and children. We also offer a reciprocal service for those whose loved ones have died in other hospices, but who live in our catchment area.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Child Bereavement support and care is available to all children in Eastern Hertfordshire. Children are supported whether or not associated with a hospice patient.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For the children : group work and 1-1 support and Mindfulness groups are offered.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have our Compassionate Communities team who offer support to adults whether they are associated with a hospice patient or not.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>This includes:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Grief Encounters Bereavement group which is a 6 week course in Welwyn Garden City, Hoddesdon, Waltham Cross and Bishops Stortford. Need to self refer to be added to a group.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Compassionate cafes which are drop in social meet ups and are in Broxbourne, Ware, Hatfield, Bishops Stortford, Welwyn Garden City, Waltham Cross, Cheshunt and Hertford- no need to self refer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For more information on any the services, please contact below</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.isabelhospice.org.uk/supporting-you/family-support/bereavement/\" target=\"_blank\">Isabel Hospice (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:family.support@isabelhospice.org.uk\">family.support@isabelhospice.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01707382563\" target=\"_blank\">01707 382563</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c88fa9d454079c63d0d2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
