    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b\" id=\"block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">James Mullery was 28 years old when he took his own life, leaving behind a partner, family of three young children and many friends. The Group was formed by James Mullery's family and friends to help others in a similar situation. The meetings are free, and include parking &amp; refreshments. It is a safe place to talk or just to listen, with people who completely understand what you are going through.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">James Group are not counsellors, just a family stricken by grief who are prepared to help others in the same situation. They have taken it upon themselves to attend various training events &amp; information sessions, and actively network with other groups &amp; organisations for the common good.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong><em>24/7 Helpline is </em></strong><a href=\"tel:07563572471\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>07563 572471</em></strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Go along to the monthly meeting at the Tattoo Hut Studio in Culloden (near Spar) held on the last Sunday of the month, every month from 12am till 2pm. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Monthly group meetings are held in:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thurso</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Dingwall</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Invergordon</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Elgin</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fort William</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Meetings ‘by appointment’ are held in Aviemore, Nairn, Ullapool and Grantown on Spey.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Full details are on their webpage &amp; Facebook pages.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.jamessupportgroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\">James Support Group (Grief Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@jamessupportgroup.com\">support@jamessupportgroup.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Charity Number: SC050519  \"Its ok to not be ok\"</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c893a9d454079c63d10b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
