    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Janet Sneddon offers specialist bereavement counselling to adults and young people aged 14 and over. Sessions are available UK wide online (video or telephone) or in-person in Salford.</p>",
