    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c899a9d454079c63d156\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c899a9d454079c63d157\" id=\"block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement Support Group, One to One bereavement support and bereavement support for children on the Island of Jersey.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Clients may self-refer. Your GP may also refer you to the service. With your consent, your friends, family and workplace can also contact the service on your behalf, regardless of how long ago you experienced your bereavement. After an initial telephone assessment, clients are offered what the team feel may be the most appropriate support for their needs.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The service is a free of charge, confidential and managed by fully trained counsellors.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.jerseyhospicecare.com/our-care/counselling-and-support-services/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Jersey Hospice Community Bereavement Service (1:1/Group Bereavement Support)&nbsp;</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@jerseyhospicecare.com\">bereavement@jerseyhospicecare.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:<a href=\"tel:01534285144\" target=\"_blank\"> (01534) 285144</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Jersey Hospice Care<br>Mont Cochon<br>St Helier<br>JE2 3JB</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c899a9d454079c63d157 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
