    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d192\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193\" id=\"block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Jewish Bereavement Counselling Service offers confidential counselling in a sensitive, aware and knowledgeable way that respects social, cultural and religious needs. Services provided for individuals, couples, children and families in the Jewish Community who are experiencing loss, including suicide, disaster, holocaust issues, baby-loss, miscarriage and still birth. JBCS supports people from the entire spectrum of Jewish practice and observance. Counselling is done either in person, online or via telephone.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">JBCS also provides the following bereavement support groups:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Stronger Together</strong>: For people (60+) who have lost a partner or spouse</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peace of Mind</strong>: For people (60+) who have lost a partner or spouse</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Butterflies</strong>: For mums and dads (of young children) who have lost a parent</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereaved Parents:&nbsp;</strong>For people bereaved of an adult child</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Aftershock</strong>: For young adults (18 – 30 years) who have lost a parent</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Stepping Stones</strong>: For people (40 – 60 years) who have lost a partner</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All sessions of counselling are held either in person, or online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.jbcs.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Jewish Bereavement Counselling Service (Counselling Support)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@jbcs.org.uk\">enquiries@jbcs.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02089513881\" target=\"_blank\">0208 951 3881</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PO Box 875</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Edgware</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">HA8 4WX</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c89aa9d454079c63d193 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
