    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67e40a7eaacbff762d8e1183\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"db20188197c11651a03a\" id=\"block-db20188197c11651a03a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Jolly Brew Crew provides a welcoming environment for men to connect, share experiences, and support each other's mental health journeys. No prior booking is required; attendees are encouraged to simply bring themselves and an open mind. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A free, relaxed space for men to gather over brews, engage in conversations, and participate in workshops aimed at promoting mental well-being.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Meeting Details:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Schedule:</strong> Monthly on Sundays, 6:30pm– 8:00pm</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Venue:</strong> Newbridge Memo​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cost:</strong> Free of charge</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact Information:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Instagram:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jollybrewcrew/\" target=\"_new\">@jollybrewcrew</a>​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Facebook:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/61572244892493/\" target=\"_new\">Jolly Brew Crew</a></p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>WhatsApp Group:</strong> <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fchat.whatsapp.com%2FJYEQ17NIKvg5AeokY5Hkvm&amp;data=05%7C02%7Csummer.othman%40ataloss.org%7C4be6738c4a4345f2117608dd6c87d76d%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638786052875352279%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=6IkNny2Rl6jKy3WJDlbXtFTupyuN32aSI35oh7Y8vug%3D&amp;reserved=0\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/JYEQ17NIKvg5AeokY5Hkvm</a>​</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-db20188197c11651a03a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-db20188197c11651a03a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-db20188197c11651a03a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-db20188197c11651a03a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-db20188197c11651a03a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-db20188197c11651a03a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-db20188197c11651a03a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
