    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4\" id=\"block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Just B offers practical support to children, young people and adults who have been bereaved, as well as information and advice for the professionals working with them. They make no charge for our services and these are offered in a safe and confidential environment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Just ‘B’ exists to ensure people living in the Harrogate district get the professional support and information they need to cope with bereavement.  They offer expert support services to children, young people and adults who have been bereaved, as well as information and advice for professionals working with them. The service is suitable for people experiencing <strong>any</strong> type of bereavement, including suicide, road traffic accident or terminal illness.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.justb.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Just B (Bereavement Support)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@justb.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">info@justb.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01423814480\" target=\"_blank\">01423 814480</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c89ea9d454079c63d1b4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
