    "title": "Kelly's Heroes",
    "excerpt": "<p>NORTHAMPTONSHIRE: FREE support and counselling for anyone bereaved or has been affected by or has witnessed a suicide in the Northamptonshire area.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
