    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b\" id=\"block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Let’s Talk About Loss' was set up by young adults for young adults. They run peer-led meetup groups in a growing number of cities across the UK for people aged 18 to 35 who have been bereaved at any stage. It is a safe space to talk through taboos and address the reality of losing someone close to you when you are young. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They believe that meeting other young adults who have experienced loss, they can share their stories and struggles without fear, judgement or awkward silences. Meetups are relaxed and sociable, both face to face and virtual. They’d love you to join them if you are in Cheltenham. Check out other locations on the website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">There is also a blog on the website where individuals can submit and share their story by emailing <a href=\"mailto:blog@letstalkaboutloss.org\">blog@letstalkaboutloss.org.</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://letstalkaboutloss.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Let's Talk About Loss - Cheltenham (Grief Support)</a>   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:  <a href=\"mailto:cheltenham@letstalkaboutloss.org\">cheltenham@letstalkaboutloss.org</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c89c2e279d2e18f6ee2b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
