    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3\" id=\"block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Providing confidential support and advice to those in need. Their fully qualified staff and trained volunteers are happy to assist anyone who is bereaved who may also be experiencing difficulties in their lives relating to sexual orientation or gender identity. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">For those on benefits it is free of charge or £10 per session for those able to contribute.  All our counsellors are qualified and members of the BACP (British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy) working in accordance with the BACP ethical framework.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://lgbtcymru.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">LGBT Cymru Helpline (LGBTQ Counselling)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:08009804021\" target=\"_blank\">0800 980 4021</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Sam@LGBTCymru.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">Sam@LGBTCymru.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LGBT Cymru Helpline &amp; Counselling Service  <br>C/O YMCA Swansea <br>1 The Kingsway <br>Swansea<br>SA1 5JQ </p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c8ac2e279d2e18f6eee3 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
