    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe420f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210\" id=\"block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LGBT Helpline provide a place where you can bring anything to the call. They have access to a wide range of information on, for example,  support organisations, social groups, the commercial ‘scene’ and where to get support with any issues you have including bereavement support. They are also there if you just want to talk.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The helpline is supported by experienced, trained, friendly, non-judgemental staff and volunteers - many of whom identify as LGBTQ - are happy to listen. They are all experienced in supporting LGBT people with a wide range of issues.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.lgbthealth.org.uk/services-support/lgbt-helpline-scotland/\" target=\"_blank\">LGBT Helpline Scotland (Emotional Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:helpline@lgbthealth.org.uk\">helpline@lgbthealth.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Free phone number: <a href=\"tel:08004647000\">08004647000</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Opening hours: Tuesdays, Wednesdays, Thursdays (12-9pm) Sundays (1-6pm)</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c9fe0390e25028fe4210 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
