    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4225\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226\" id=\"block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Life and Soul Counselling exists as a safe place to embark on a process of developing resilience, strength and personal growth after experiencing bereavement.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We offer a holistic, integrative approach to counselling based on person-centred and psychodynamic approaches. We believe that all our lives are full of potential, possibilities and hope, and that every person accessing our service is worthy of love, belonging and connection. Our service is open to anyone regardless of faith or background.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.qpbc.org/life-soul/#:~:text=Life%20&amp;%20Soul%20exists%20as%20a%20safe%20place%20to%20embark\">Life &amp; Soul Counselling | Queen's Park Baptist Church Glasgow (qpbc.org)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Jo Turner</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Service Manager</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Life &amp; Soul Counselling Service</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Point, 180 Queens Drive</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Glasgow G42 8QD</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">E: <a href=\"mailto:lifeandsoul@qpbc.org\">lifeandsoul@qpbc.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">T: <a href=\"tel:01414233962\" target=\"_blank\">0141 423 3962</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1c9ff0390e25028fe4226 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
