    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca000390e25028fe4228\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca000390e25028fe4229\" id=\"block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">'Life Changes' is an independent community counselling service situated in central Southampton which is available to anyone over 18. Services are wide ranging but include bereavement counselling and PTSD support. The counselling provided offers the opportunity to reflect on life and understand the issues troubling you.  We offer time and space to explore personal change in a private, safe, non-judgemental and respectful environment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Counsellors are all members of the BACP and adhere to the BACP ethical framework.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.lifechangescounselling.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Life Changes Counselling (Affordable Community Counselling)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact:  </strong>Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07444001845\" target=\"_blank\">07444 001845</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services available Monday to Friday 9-5pm</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email through the website</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca000390e25028fe4229 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
