    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca030390e25028fe42af\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0\" id=\"block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lighthouse, a suicide prevention charity in North Belfast, supports those who have been bereaved through suicide and we are committed to providing support services to families who have lost loved ones and for individuals who are in crisis. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.lighthousecharity.com\" target=\"_blank\">Lighthouse (Suicide Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel:<a href=\"tel:02890755070\" target=\"_blank\">028 9075 5070</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:info@lighthousecharity.com?\" target=\"_blank\">info@lighthousecharity.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Opening Hours:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">8.30am – 5.00pm Monday to Friday</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">187-189 Duncairn Gardens,<br>Belfast,<br>County Antrim,<br>BT15 2GF</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca030390e25028fe42b0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
