    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43c9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca\" id=\"block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The LOROS Bereavement Hubs offer sessions that aim to provide those who are bereaved with a place where they can access information, talk to others and share their thoughts and feelings.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This new service will be based in different locations across Leicester, Leicestershire and Rutland, to offer support and information to communities.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The hubs are available to anyone over 18 who has been bereaved, regardless of the circumstances.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The hubs take place weekly/fortnightly on the same day and time and are supported by trained bereavement volunteers. For further information and location of our Bereavement Hubs please click the website link below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Other bereavement support services include group support sessions held at the hospice and one to one sessions at home.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can access the service by asking your GP or other health professional to refer you to the LOROS Bereavement Service. They will ask you to complete and return a self-assessment form to identify the best service for your needs; trained bereavement volunteers will help to guide you through your journey. Please click the website link below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://loros.co.uk/about-loros/news/2022/02/02/loros-to-provide-local-bereavement-support-across-the-county\" target=\"_blank\">LOROS Bereavement Hubs (Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email <a href=\"mailto:bereavementsupport@loros.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">bereavementsupport@loros.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:(0116) 231 3771\">(0116) 231 3771</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LOROS, Groby Road, Leicester LE3 9QE</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca0d0390e25028fe43ca .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
