    "title": "Lost Words Coaching and Mentoring",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lost Words Coaching &amp; Mentoring offers compassionate, one-to-one online coaching for individuals and couples navigating grief and loss. Led by Kat Proffitt, a certified coach. All sessions are conducted online, ensuring accessibility for clients regardless of location. No referral is necessary. </p>",
