    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6813800178936e0df4e9f9ff\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"a06552030fb744c4502e\" id=\"block-a06552030fb744c4502e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lost Words Coaching &amp; Mentoring offers compassionate, one-to-one online coaching for individuals and couples navigating grief and loss. Led by Kat Proffitt, a certified coach and registered nurse, the service provides a safe, non-judgmental space to explore emotions, rebuild confidence, and rediscover purpose after bereavement. Support is available to clients across the UK and internationally.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Grief &amp; Loss Coaching:</strong> Personalised sessions to help individuals process grief, reconnect with their inner strengths, and move forward at their own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Pregnancy &amp; Baby Loss: </strong>Specialist coaching services to support you find peace and joy again after the death of your baby, informed by personal and professional experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Relationships Coaching:</strong> Individual or couples coaching to manage relationships, whether romantic, platonic, or professional.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All sessions are conducted online, ensuring accessibility for clients regardless of location. No referral is necessary. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.lostwordscoaching.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Lost Words Coaching &amp; Mentoring</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@lostwordscoaching.com\">support@lostwordscoaching.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">WhatsApp: <a href=\"tel:+351920446297\" target=\"_blank\">+351 920 446 297</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">LinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lostwordscoaching\" target=\"\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/lostwordscoaching</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Instagram: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Flostwordscoach%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7C1e770e0319944d58121008de1d1a9710%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638980197234766403%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=n5E16P8RDDy%2FfsM8zCrQ3YolyAnWi4i0Waez1KaG%2B50%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">@lostwordscoach</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Book a call:<a href=\"https:// https://calendly.com/support-vch4/30min\" target=\"\"> https://calendly.com/support-vch4/30min</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-a06552030fb744c4502e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-a06552030fb744c4502e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-a06552030fb744c4502e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-a06552030fb744c4502e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-a06552030fb744c4502e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-a06552030fb744c4502e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-a06552030fb744c4502e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
