    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca100390e25028fe442d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca100390e25028fe442e\" id=\"block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Chaplaincy Service is available 24hrs a day, 7 days a week to offer pastoral, spiritual and emotional support to people of all faiths and beliefs as well as supporting those with no faith or belief. The Faith and Belief Room is open 24 hours a day, seven days a week and is a beautiful place of peace and tranquillity to reflect or pray.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Hospital Bereavement Service provides support and information to families of the deceased including those affected by issues surrounding post mortem procedures and the paperwork needed following a death in hospital.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.ldh.nhs.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Luton &amp; Dunstable Hospital Bereavement Service (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01582491166\" target=\"_blank\">01582 491166 </a>– switchboard – ask for Bereavement Office, for help with administrative matters</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Chaplaincy <a href=\"tel:01582497370\" target=\"_blank\">01582 497370</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:chaplaincy@ldh.nhs.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">chaplaincy@ldh.nhs.uk</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca100390e25028fe442e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
