    "catType": [
      "Counselling"
    ],
    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixB6",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd27\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28\" id=\"block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Martlet's bereavement service offers support to the family and friends of patients who have received care from Martlet's – whether that’s on the inpatient unit or out in the community. Their expert team of counsellors and trained volunteers will do their best to support your individual needs. They provide provide both one-off and ongoing sessions.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Spiritual support</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Martlet's welcome people of all faiths and beliefs. Their chaplain is available to speak with patients who need a listening ear, spiritual advice, religious guidance, or wish to explore what is meaningful to them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Chaplain is available to call you or visit you at home and is also available at the inpatient unit. If you’d like to speak with your own faith leader while you’re staying at the hospice, they are happy to arrange this too.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.martlets.org.uk/emotional-and-practical-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Martlet's Hospice, Brighton (Emotional &amp; Practical Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">TELEPHONE: <a href=\"tel: 01273 273400\">01273 273400</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Location: Martlet's Hospice, Wayfield Avenue, Hove, BN3 7LW</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca0ace761d61c703bd28 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
