    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b\" id=\"block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Martlets is a local charity, providing terminally ill people in Brighton and Hove, and surrounding areas, the very best care and support. Their expert team helps people do the things they love with the time they have and to feel hope, purpose and possibility.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Martlets’ bereavement service offers support to the family and friends of patients who have received care from Martlets – whether at the Hospice or out in the community. Their experienced counsellors provide <strong>one-to-one sessions</strong> at the Hospice, or via telephone or videoconferencing. They also have a team of specially trained bereavement volunteers who visit people at home.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Further support is offered through regular events. <strong>Monthly social evenings</strong> are an opportunity to meet others who have been bereaved, to make friends and to find a way to enjoy moments at a time of deep pain and loss. Remembrance events including <strong>A Time to Remember, Light Up a Life</strong> and a <strong>Pebble Memory Walk</strong> are also held throughout the year. Martlets also runs <strong>Earthworks, </strong>a weekly allotment group for bereaved men to meet and share their experiences of loss, with the opportunity to tend the allotment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.martlets.org.uk/support-for-carers/#BEREAVEMENT\" target=\"_blank\">Martlet's Hospice, East Sussex (Emotional and practical support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@martlets.org.uk\">bereavement@martlets.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:  <a href=\"tel:01273273400\">01273 273400</a> (ask to speak to the Patient and Family Support Administrator)</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca0bce761d61c703bd2b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
