    "title": "Menshare Listening Group (MSLG): Supporting Men’s Mental Health in Sussex",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Menshare Listening Group (MSLG) is a listening group run by men, for men, founded in Crawley in 2021. The group was set up to give men experiencing emotional distress (including bereavement) a safe space to talk openly and be heard, something many men say they have never experienced before.</p>",
