    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67dd470adb63967a86ad5259\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2\" id=\"block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mind is a leading mental health charity in England and Wales, offering comprehensive support and resources for individuals experiencing mental health challenges, including those dealing with bereavement. Their services are designed to ensure that no one faces a mental health problem alone.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>How Mind Can Help?</strong></h3><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Information and Support</strong> – Mind provides detailed guides on bereavement, exploring what grief feels like, how long it might last, and ways to cope. These resources help individuals understand their emotions and find strategies for self-care.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Support for Specific Bereavements</strong> – Recognizing that different types of loss can bring unique challenges, Mind offers tailored information for those who have lost someone to suicide, acknowledging the complex feelings that may arise. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Guidance for Supporting Others</strong> – Mind offers advice on how to support someone who is grieving, acknowledging the difficulties in finding the right words and actions during such times. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Local Mind Services</strong> – Across England and Wales, local Mind branches offer face-to-face services, including talking therapies, peer support, and advocacy. These services provide personalized support to help individuals navigate their grief and mental health challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Online Community</strong> – Mind's online peer support platform, Side by Side, allows individuals to connect with others who have experienced similar losses, fostering a sense of community and shared understanding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mind is committed to providing compassionate support and practical resources to help individuals cope with loss and maintain their mental well-being.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-4e38a3b190eb6e41d5e2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
