    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8\" id=\"block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Part of the nationwide Improving Access to Psychological Therapies (IAPT) service delivered by <strong>Lancashire and South Cumbria NHS Foundation Trust</strong>. Minds Matter offer a range of brief therapeutic interventions across our localities to support people’s differing emotional needs, this includes online, telephone and face-to-face treatment and therapy options. All treatment is FREE and provided by the NHS and their partners.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Minds Matter can help with a variety of problems and if you already know what the problem is, some of the most common mental health problems we work with: Panic Disorder, Depression, Postnatal Depression, Generalised Anxiety Disorder/Chronic Worry, Obsessive Compulsive Disorder (OCD), Phobias, Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD), Health Anxiety and Social Anxiety. The services are offered in the areas in the table below.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.lscft.nhs.uk/Mindsmatter\" target=\"_blank\">Minds Matter (Talking Therapies)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>PRESTON</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone: </strong><a href=\"tel:01772773437\" target=\"_blank\">01772 773437</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Block C, Strand Road, Preston PR1 8UY</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CHORLEY AND SOUTH RIBBLE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01772643168\" target=\"_blank\">01772 643168</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Civic Offices, Union Street, Chorley PR7 1AL</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>FYLDE AND WYRE (excludes Blackpool)</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone: </strong><a href=\"tel:01253955943\" target=\"_blank\">01253 955943</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Mountcroft Resource Centre, Albert Street Fleetwood, FY7 6AH</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>WEST LANCASHIRE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01695684177\" target=\"_blank\">01695 684177</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address: </strong>Bickerstaffe House, Ormskirk and District General Hospital, Wigan Road, Ormskirk L39 2AZ</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>HYNDBURN</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01254226007\" target=\"_blank\">01254 226007</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> The Mount Whalley Rd, Accrington BB5 5AD</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>ROSSENDALE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone: </strong><a href=\"tel:01282657792\" target=\"_blank\">01282 657792</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Union Rd,<br>Rawtenstall, Rossendale BB4 6S</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>RIBBLE VALLEY</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01282657927\" target=\"_blank\">01282 657927</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Marsh Way (Off Pimlico Road), Clitheroe, BB7 2AH</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>BURNLEY</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01282657268\" target=\"_blank\">01282 657268</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address: </strong>Gannow Lane Resource Centre, 164 Gannow Lane, Burnley BB12 6QH</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>PENDLE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01282657927\" target=\"_blank\">01282 657927</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Pendle House,<br>83-85 Leeds Rd, Nelson BB9 9TG</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>LANCASTER AND MORECAMBE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:01524550552\" target=\"_blank\">01524 550552</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Cameron House, White Cross Business Park, South Road, Lancaster, LA1 4XQ</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>BLACKBURN AND DARWEN</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Telephone: </strong><a href=\"tel:01254226037\" target=\"_blank\">01254 226037</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Main office address:</strong> Daisyfield Centre, Appleby Street, Blackburn BB1 3BL</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca11ce761d61c703bdd8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
