    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca13c171814713b3e545\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca13c171814713b3e546\" id=\"block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fife Specialist Palliative Care’s Children and Families Support Service provides psychosocial information, advice, support and counselling to patients and their partners and co-parents, children, stepchildren and young people facing parental death and bereavement. Counselling and group support is provided for as long as wished. Counselling for patients and carers pre and post bereavement and group support is available to all families involved with the specialist palliative care service.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.nhsfife.org/services/all-services/palliative-and-end-of-life-care/teams-and-services/fife-specialist-palliative-care-service/\" target=\"_blank\">NHS Fife Specialist Palliative Care, Children and Families and Bereavement Service (Counselling Support) </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:fife.palliativecareadmin@nhs.scot\">fife.palliativecareadmin@nhs.scot</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">NHS Fife Specialist Palliative Care, Children and Families and Bereavement Service<br>Victoria Hospice<br>Victoria Hospital, Hayfield Rd<br>Kirkcaldy<br>Fife<br>KY2 5BD</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca13c171814713b3e546 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
