    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca18c171814713b3e628\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca18c171814713b3e629\" id=\"block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">When tended with love, in communion with others, grief can be a pathway back to life. <br> <br>Norfolk Grief Tending is a non-profit community organisation that helps adults who are struggling with grief to find hope, healing and peace.<br> <br>Our workshops, retreats and group journeys offer a safe place where pain and loss can be witnessed, held and transformed.<br> <br>We welcome grief about life changes, bereavement and childhood losses, as well as ancestral, ecological and collective grief. <br> <br>We offer online and in-person workshops, group journeys and weekend retreats. We also offer short taster sessions, and training to support grief tending peer groups and professionals working in any context where grief and loss is an issue.<br> <br> All events are held by experienced facilitators, working with tried and tested trauma-informed practices that combine ancient wisdom with modern psychology. They are available on a gift basis, which means pay what you can so there is no financial barrier to participation.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.norfolkgrief.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Norfolk Grief Tending (Grief Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: Norfolk Grief Tending, The Gathering Gates, Carrow House, King Street, Norwich NR1 2TG</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone:<a href=\"tel:%2007951928877\"> 07951928877 </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@norfolkgrief.com\">hello@norfolkgrief.com</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca18c171814713b3e629 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
