    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ca21c171814713b3e79f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0\" id=\"block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Oldham Bereavement Support Service is a registered charity.  With a team of trained volunteers who support bereaved people by appointment at their centre.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their aim is to offer a one to one  confidential and supportive relationship to those who have suffered a loss no matter how long ago, giving the bereaved person the opportunity to use such support to talk through and express their grief while trying to understand and come to terms with their loss.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01616278207\" target=\"_blank\">0161 627 8207</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:oldhambereavement@Hotmail.co.uk\">oldhambereavement@Hotmail.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Whiteside Centre</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Oak View</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Royal Oldham Hospital</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Rochdale Road</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Oldham</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">OL1 2JH</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ca21c171814713b3e7a0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
