    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3\" id=\"block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Paiwand Ltd to deliver free counselling services that respect and work with the cultural and linguistic needs of refugees and asylum seekers. Backed by more than 16 years’ experience of helping people with emotional hardship. Paiwand aims to empower people from all ethnic groups with emotional problems from Barnet, Brent, Harrow and Ealing, as well as refugees and asylum seekers who came into the UK after the August 2021 events in Afghanistan, through one to one counselling and psycho-education support to overcome the emotional hardship, build confidence, resilience, enjoy life and achieve their potentials. Paiwand also provides counselling service to clients aged 11-30 who are immigrants or have a refugee background, living, working, or studying in Harrow. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.paiwand.com/support-services/mental-health-advocacy-and-counselling-services-london\">Paiwand (Counselling Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">CONTACT: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@paiwand.com\">admin@paiwand.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:07432728424\">07432 728424</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cba8c51f554220a9e1b3 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
