    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixCq",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1bd\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be\" id=\"block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is a FREE confidential helpline for parents and carers throughout NI, providing advice, support and guidance on a wide range of parenting issues including bereavement or concern about a grieving child. All calls are answered by our dedicated and professional team of Parent Support Officers, who wholeheartedly believe in the importance of parenting. Parent Support Officers are prepared to expect questions on a huge range of issues. There are no silly questions when it comes to parenting!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mon – Thurs 9am – 9pm Fri 9am – 5pm Sat 9am – 1pm</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.ci-ni.org.uk/parentline/\" target=\"_blank\">ParentLine CiNI (Bereavement Support Helpline)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Helpline: <a href=\"tel:08088020400\" target=\"_blank\">08088020400</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"mailto:Email:parentline@ci-ni.org.uk\">Email:parentline@ci-ni.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Children In Northern Ireland, Montgomery Road, Castlereagh, Belfast, UK</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cba9c51f554220a9e1be .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
