    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e241\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242\" id=\"block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PeerTalk Support Groups provide a forum for individuals who experience depression, anxiety and/or other related emotional distress to:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• <em>Meet other people who experience similar challenges and communicate with them in a supportive, confidential (within normal limits) and proactive environment with two trained PeerTalk facilitators.</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>• Give and / or receive support to help them cope better.</em></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The groups are for people over 18 who are experiencing depression, anxiety or similar distress. No referral is needed, you can simply come along to the meetings, which are free, friendly, confidential and with no waiting lists.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PeerTalk support groups meet face-to-face in: Batley, Bensham (Gateshead), Bradford, Bordon, Farnham, Guildford, Huddersfield, Leeds, North Shields, Preston (Central Methodist), Preston (Intact), Skipton, Warrington and Whitley Bay.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Note: While there is a Knowsley group, it is currently suspended until March 2026.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.peertalk.org.uk/support-groups\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: PeerTalk (Mental Health Support Groups)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@peertalk.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">enquiries@peertalk.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone or Text: <a href=\"tel:07719562617\" target=\"_blank\">07719 562 617</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbaac51f554220a9e242 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
