    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e274\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275\" id=\"block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Children's Bereavement Charity for families in Cornwall. Offering Memory Days, family groups and fun days, monthly teens peer support groups across the county, individual support for young people up to the age of 18, telephone support and advice. They also offer professional training.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://penhaligonsfriends.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Penhaligon's Friends (Children's Bereavement Support Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@penhaligonsfriends.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">enquiries@penhaligonsfriends.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01209210624\" target=\"_blank\">01209 210624</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Penhaligon’s Friends,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Trecarrel, Ground Floor,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Drump Road,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Redruth,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">TR15 1LU</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbacc51f554220a9e275 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
