    "title": "People Boost, Healthy Grief &amp; Loss Recovery",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">People Boost, founded by Clare Spiers MCIPD, is dedicated to supporting individuals through grief and significant loss. Based in Leamington Spa, Warwickshire, People Boost offers specialized services to help clients navigate their personal journeys toward healing and recovery.​</p>",
