    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixDD",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3bf\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0\" id=\"block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pregnancy Options Centre provides free, non-directive counselling and support to anyone struggling following a pregnancy loss, including miscarriage, stillbirth, ectopic pregnancy, therapeutic termination, or an abortion. Sessions are client led and provide a safe environment for women, partners, and family members to talk about their thoughts and emotions surrounding their circumstances. Support looks at complex issues and emotions that clients can feel after a pregnancy loss or abortion, such as grief, guilt, shame, depression, anger, and acceptance. Based in Chichester, West Sussex but serve the surrounding areas between Worthing, West Sussex and Portsmouth, South-East Hampshire. They are organisational members of the BACP (British Association for Counsellor and Psychotherapists) and adhere to their code of ethics.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://pregnancyoptionscentre.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Pregnancy Options Centre (West Sussex and South-East Hampshire)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:counselling@pregnancyoptionscentre.org.uk\">counselling@pregnancyoptionscentre.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01243784177\" target=\"_blank\">01243 784177</a> / <a href=\"tel:07843543792\" target=\"_blank\">07843543792</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Pregnancy Options Centre<br>Office F3<br>St John's House<br>St John's Street<br>Chichester<br>West Sussex </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">PO19 1UU</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb4c51f554220a9e3c0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
