    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixDG",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2\" id=\"block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Prospect Hospice offers end-of-life care for patients and support for their families in the Wiltshire area. Their approach is compassionate, respectful and personalised to everyone who seeks it.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They care for patients at home, at the hospice, in hospital and in care homes. They offer specialist support to the families and carers of patients under their care including bereavement support, individually or as a group. &nbsp;They offer drop-in bereavement cafes in three locations, Swindon, Royal Wootton Bassett and Marlborough, the drop-ins are for anyone experiencing grief. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They have produced a helpful leaflet for carers and families called <a href=\"https://www.prospect-hospice.net/wp-content/uploads/2019/05/Understanding-what-happens-when-someone-is-dying-Sep-2019.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">'Understanding what happens when someone is dying'</a>.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.prospect-hospice.net/contact-us/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Prospect Hospice (Swindon)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Prospect Hospice is open 24-hours a day, every day of the year for visitors to spend time with family and friends who are staying with us at the hospice. Please contact them for help and support whenever you need it.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"tel:01793816124\" target=\"_blank\">01793 816124</a> (Monday-Friday, 9am-5pm).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.prospect-hospice.net/contact-us/\" target=\"_blank\">Email via the website.</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb5c51f554220a9e3e2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
