    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/rehappy-neurodiversity-affirming-therapy-and-integrative-psychotherapy",
    "title": "RE:HAPPY (Neurodiversity-Affirming Therapy and Integrative Psychotherapy)",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">RE:HAPPY offers mental health, wellbeing support, and training, especially for people in the screen industries. Led by Octavia Landy, a psychotherapist with over 25 years of experience in production, their work bridges the gap between creative workplaces and emotional wellbeing.</p>",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1758886936711,
