    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b\" id=\"block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Reflect is a free support service in North Yorkshire for anyone in need of support after experiencing Pregnancy or Neonatal Loss. Reflect uniquely offers 'Reflections: Walking through loss’- A structured support programme. This programme is provided to individuals and couples and will help you to explore the emotional, physical and spiritual effects of your loss and to enable you to grieve and work through your suffering. Reflect also offers listening sessions. These sessions will give you the opportunity to share your story and your grief, and they can discuss some strategies for coping day to day with your loss and your emotions. These sessions can occur prior to starting Reflections: Walking through loss', or as stand alone appointments.<br><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://reflectsupport.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Reflect (Pregnancy Loss Support Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiry@reflectsupport.co.uk\">enquiry@reflectsupport.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01904676710\" target=\"_blank\">01904 676710</a><br><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Reflect @ The Gateway Centre<br>Front Street, Acomb<br>York<br>North Yorkshire<br>YO24 3BZ</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb01f66970dbfbb843b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
