    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84a9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa\" id=\"block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Rephael House is independent counselling charity established since 1997 and offers one to one professional therapy. Providing low-cost professional therapy to anyone who has experienced bereavement, no matter the circumstances, as well as other therapeutic services.<br><br>Rephael House provides a professional therapeutic service for a cross section of the community, including a bespoke robust in-school therapy service. Alongside our comprehensive range of services, they also offer a free CAMHS funded Hertfordshire service for anyone that lives within the Hatfield and Welwyn area. This service is for young people aged between 13 – 19 years.<br><br>CAMHS Barnet also fund a weekday and Saturday service for anyone aged 4 – 19 years from the London Borough of Barnet.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.rephaelhouse.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Rephael House (Counselling Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:csm@rephaelhouse.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">csm@rephaelhouse.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02084409144\" target=\"_blank\">0208 440 9144</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">36B Woodhouse Road<br>Finchley<br>London<br>N12 0RG</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb31f66970dbfbb84aa .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
