    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ac\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad\" id=\"block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><em>Respect for All</em> offers client led counselling for autistic people, for learning disabled people, and for their families and carers, throughout the whole of Greater Manchester.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The counselling service is funded by the NHS and therefore free to access. They work alongside mental services and /or GPs to request funding for each individual person wanting to access their counselling service. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Counsellors are either neurodivergent themselves or have significant lived experience with the client group. Counselling can be conducted in English or British Sign Language.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The team of specialist counsellors deliver various models of therapy tailored to suit individual needs including, play therapy, Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT), Behavioural, Person Centred, Integrative, Neuro Linguistic Programming (NLP) and non-verbal and art therapy.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.respectforall.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Respect for All (Counselling Charity)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:counselling@respectforall.org.uk\">counselling@respectforall.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01615324070\" target=\"_blank\">01615324070</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84ad .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
