    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67f50e04831c2143f94b8965\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"274f46ed899b2af68875\" id=\"block-274f46ed899b2af68875\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Restorative Justice for All (RJ4All) is a charitable, user-led international institute dedicated to preventing and addressing harm at individual, community, and societal levels. Their mission is to tackle power abuse, conflict, and poverty by promoting restorative justice values such as power-sharing, equality, dignity, and respect.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Services Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Restorative Justice Services:</strong> RJ4All accepts referrals and self-referrals, providing both online and face-to-face restorative justice processes, including direct and indirect mediation. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Wellbeing Circles:</strong> RJ4ALL offers weekly wellbeing circles.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Community Resources:</strong> The RJ4All Community Centre serves as a hub featuring a restorative justice library, children's books, free Wi-Fi, computers, tablets, and SIM cards available for free use and borrowing. ​</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Training and Resources:</strong> RJ4All provides accredited face-to-face courses, e-courses, webinars, and access to journals focused on restorative justice and related fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">RJ4All is committed to promoting peace and well-being through restorative justice practices. ​</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://rj4all.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Restorative Justice for All (Restorative Justice Charity)</a><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><br></span><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@rj4all.org?\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">admin@rj4all.org</span></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07708758600\" target=\"\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">+44(0)7708758600</span></a> (Admin)</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address: The RJ4All Rotherhithe Community Centre, 30 Plough Way, London, SE16 2LJ, UK</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-274f46ed899b2af68875 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-274f46ed899b2af68875 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-274f46ed899b2af68875 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-274f46ed899b2af68875 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-274f46ed899b2af68875 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-274f46ed899b2af68875 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-274f46ed899b2af68875 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
