    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3\" id=\"block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Based within the Black Country providing a range of support to those affected by bereavement by suicide. Providing support for next of kin and close family members who are bereaved by suicide in the Black Country of any age including children and young people.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Offering:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- one to one practical provided through face to face sessions, online, telephone or Whatsapp.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Bereavement Counselling for between 6-8 weekly sessions with the option to extend to an additional 8 fortnightly sessions if needed with a qualified counsellor who is registered with the BACP</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Bereavement Support Groups provide closed support groups with a maximum of 6 participants. The group is facilitated by a Suicide Bereavement Worker and a volunteer with lived experience of bereavement by suicide.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.rethink.org/help-in-your-area/services/community-support/black-country-support-after-suicide/\" target=\"_blank\">Official Website: Rethink Black Country (Support After Suicide Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:blackcountrysupportaftersuicide@rethink.org\">blackcountrysupportaftersuicide@rethink.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:<a href=\"tel:08000086516\" target=\"_blank\">0800 008 6516</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb41f66970dbfbb84b3 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
