    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixDm",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5\" id=\"block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ripples of Compassion strive to ensure that all parents/carers and families experiencing the heartache of having a child with cancer, life-limiting condition or that has died receive the appropriate social, emotional and mental health support at the time they need it in a way that is accessible to them.&nbsp;We work with hospitals, hospices, and charities to support children, parents and siblings at this critical time. Whilst our support to children is only available to those with cancer or a life limiting condition our bereavement support is available to ALL parents regardless of the reason the child died.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> <strong>All our support is free to families and includes:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement therapy for as long as it is needed for parents at any point after a child has died.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement libraries to hospitals, hospices and voluntary groups to support bereaved parents and siblings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contributions towards keepsakes and headstones for families to help them remember their child.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Self-care boxes for bereaved families to support their emotional and mental well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Healthy home/chef-made ready meals for bereaved parents on leaving hospital/hospice following the death of their child.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Activity packs for children to support engagement in meaningful activity whilst in hospital/isolation.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Children's Relaxation Flashcards specifically designed by a trained mental health professionals with bereaved siblings and children going through treatment in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bespoke Requests to support families in whatever way best helps them to achieve their desired outcomes for their child and support them when they can't access this elsewhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Free downloadable resources to support bereaved parents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.ripplesofcompassion.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Ripples Of Compassion (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:contact@ripplesofcompassion.com\">contact@ripplesofcompassion.com</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbb81f66970dbfbb85a5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
