    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbb91f66970dbfbb85ab\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7\" id=\"block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Rosedale Offer group support with qualified bereavement support facilitators, at present online but usually in a group setting. This eight week programme runs several times a year and is complimentary and available to all no matter how long ago the bereaved happened or what funeral director was used. This is available to anyone in Norfolk and Suffolk. They can signpost to 1-1 support. Cost : Free.<br><br>You can learn more about <a href=\"/s/New-Online-Support-A4-Poster.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Rosedale Funeral Home Bereavement Support&nbsp;online services.</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Attendees can self refer or through their GP and Health and Social Care.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Group Locations include Attleborough, Beccles, Bungay, Diss, Halesworth, Wymondham. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Monthly friendship group also runs following on from course. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.rosedalefuneralhome.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Rosedale Funeral Home (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone your local branch of ROSEDALE FUNERAL HOMES for information or go to the website for more information and lots of resources.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Attleborough <a href=\"tel:01953452538\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01953 452538</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Beccles <a href=\"tel:01502714445\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01502 714445</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bungay <a href=\"tel:01986892790\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01986 892790</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Diss  <a href=\"tel:01379640810\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01379 640810</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Halesworth <a href=\"tel:01986875588\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01986 875588</strong></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wymondham  <a href=\"tel:01953601103\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>01953 601103</strong></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-3ad6b9a2fd6e7f2fd6b7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
