    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixE7",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6\" id=\"block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Run by bereaved parents, with trained befrienders who aim to support anyone affected by pregnancy or baby loss, before, during or around the time of their birth. They hold face to face support meetings which are very informal in person&nbsp; please check their website for current arrangements. They have a Main Support Meeting on the 1st Thursday of the month and a Next Pregnancy After A Loss Group on the 3rd Wednesdays. In Moray there is a support meeting on the third Wednesday of the month in Elgin and there are trained befrienders locally in this area. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">We also have a family group that meets monthly and&nbsp; a walking group. For more information of dates please see our website which has updated information. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Mothers, Partners and Grandparents are welcome to join for support. They also have a library of support books and send out a newsletter three times a year. Two Christmas Services are held at ARI chapel in December. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Sands is a UK charity that works across the country to support anyone affected by pregnancy and baby loss; improve the care bereaved parents receive from health care and other professionals; and reduce the number of babies who do die by funding research and working closely with other organisations to create a world where fewer babies die. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">They also have a free national helpline offering bereavement support and information on the telephone and by email. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Official Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.aberdeen-sands.org\">SANDS - Aberdeen (Baby Loss Charity) </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Contact:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support.aberdeen@sandsvolunteer.org.uk\">support.aberdeen@sandsvolunteer.org.uk</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Telephone: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"tel:08707606649\">0870 760 6649</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1cbc11f66970dbfbb86b6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
