    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3681\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682\" id=\"block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you have lost someone who used alcohol or drugs, the Scottish Families Bereavement Service is here to support you. They can provide bereavement support, advice and information. Scottish Families can also put you in touch with an accredited counsellor who is local to you. Their service is free and is available across Scotland.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The quickest way to contact the Scottish Families Bereavement service is through the helpline: 08080 10 10 11.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Official Website:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.sfad.org.uk/support-services/bereavement\" target=\"_blank\">SFAD - Scottish Families Affected by Alcohol and Drugs (Bereavemnt Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:counselling@sfad.org.uk\">counselling@sfad.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Address:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">152 Bath Street,&nbsp;Glasgow&nbsp;G2 4TB</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccb1e22cb244bb7e3682 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
