    "title": "Sikh Recovery Network",
    "excerpt": "<p>If bereavement is the cause of your alcohol addiction, or you are worried about someone who has been bereaved drinking to excess, find support and understanding from the Sikh Recovery Network, culturally sensitive support for the Sikh community</p>\n",
