    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/slow-surviving-the-loss-of-your-world",
    "title": "SLOW - Surviving the Loss of Your World",
    "excerpt": "<p>Self help groups providing support for bereaved parents and siblings in North & South London and nationwide via Zoom.  All groups are facilitated by bereaved parents or siblings.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626520080050,
