    "title": "Somerset Suicide Bereavement Support Service",
    "excerpt": "<p>SOMERSET: Supporting individuals, families, and professionals across Somerset who’ve been bereaved by suicide.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626519600050,
