    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37cf\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0\" id=\"block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Somerset Suicide Bereavement Support Service offers a range of support options across Somerset to enable anyone aged from 14yrs+ who has been bereaved, or affected by a suicide, to find the right level of support for their needs.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1-2-1 Bereavement Support: </strong>Offering 1-2-1 bereavement support, and specialist bereavement counselling sessions, via online, telephone, and a number of locations across the county.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peer Groups: </strong>They run a regular facilitated in-person Peer Groups in a number of locations where you can meet with, talk to, and hear from, other people who’ve been bereaved by suicide, in a safe, supportive and open environment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Peer Walking Groups: </strong>They run a regular in-person walking groups that meet bi-monthly.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Crisis support referral: </strong>For anyone who is feeling especially vulnerable they can refer you to a specialist listening service for dedicated calls.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Community Interventions:</strong> Sometimes a suicide can impact a whole community.  They can bring our service to your community to offer support to anyone who needs it.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Early response support: </strong>Working with Avon &amp; Somerset Constabulary, they will respond within 72hrs of a suspected suicide, offering support, or a listening ear to those immediately affected.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Information and Resources</strong>: If you’re a professional supporting someone who’s been bereaved by suicide as part of your role, they are here to offer advice and guidance to help you meet the needs of the individual.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>HELPLINE 0300 330 5463</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.mindinsomerset.org.uk/our-services/somerset-suicide-bereavement-support-service/\" target=\"_blank\">Somerset Suicide Bereavement Support Service</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereaved@mindinsomerset.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">bereaved@mindinsomerset.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">HELPLINE <a href=\"tel:03003305463\" target=\"_blank\">0300 330 5463</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/SuicideBereavementSomerset/\">SuicideBereavementSomerset</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccbfe22cb244bb7e37d0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
