    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fd\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe\" id=\"block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Space2grieve offers free bereavement support to anyone in the London Borough of Richmond Upon Thames who has lost someone, no matter when, or how.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Expert volunteers &amp; administrators make space for you to talk in a series of <strong>free</strong> one-to-one sessions, either in person, on the phone, or online.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We offer support for adults, children, young people, families &amp; older people. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our reach includes the following areas:</p><blockquote><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Barnes, Castlenau, East Sheen, East Twickenham, Fulwell, Ham, Hampton, Hampton Hill, Hampton Wick, Kew, Mortlake, North Sheen, Petersham, Richmond, St Margarets, Strawberry Hill, Teddington, Twickenham &amp; Whitton.</p></blockquote><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You don’t need a referral.  Just get in touch via our website or by email or phone.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.space2grieve.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Space2Grieve (Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@space2grieve.org.uk\">support@space2grieve.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07519376363\" target=\"_blank\">0751 937 6363</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccc2e22cb244bb7e37fe .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
