    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixGd",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3858\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859\" id=\"block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Support Drop In</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The bereavement support drop in is open to everyone; not only those with a connection to the hospice.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The groups provide mutual support to bereaved people and provide an opportunity to speak with the St Catherine’s Support Team and others in your community, in a welcoming and informal setting.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They have introduced an additional session each month to better meet the needs of our community and offer people a choice to attend during the day or the evening; enabling them to reach more people in the local area who may benefit from this support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">People are invited to attend on the second Wednesday of the month from 1.30pm until 3pm, or on the third Thursday of the month from 6pm until 7.30pm, in the hospice’s Garden Room.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please email <a href=\"mailto:supportteam@stcatherines.co.uk\">supportteam@stcatherines.co.uk</a> or call <a href=\"tel:01772629171\" target=\"_blank\">01772 629171</a> for updates if you would like to attend.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Counselling</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement counselling can be provided to people whose loved ones have been cared for at St Catherine’s Hospice.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The hospice is an organisational member of the British Association of Counselling and Psychotherapy (BACP) and they also have volunteer counsellors who give their time to support our families and loved ones.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you declined bereavement support at the time of your loved one’s death but now feel you need some support, please contact the hospice and ask to speak to the Support Team.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stcatherines.co.uk/our-care/bereavement-and-remembrance/\" target=\"_blank\">St Catherines Hospice, Lancashire (Bereavement Support Services)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Emails: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@stcatherines.co.uk\">enquiries@stcatherines.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01772629171\" target=\"_blank\">01772 629171</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Catherines Hospice, Lostock Lane<br>Lostock Hall<br>Preston<br>Lancashire<br>PR5 5XU</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d1ccc6e22cb244bb7e3859 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
