    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eaa\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab\" id=\"block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Helena's offers informal groups designed to provide support, information and also coping strategies for people who are adjusting to living with grief. They also offer therapeutic counsellor-led groups for support after bereavement by suicide, stillbirth and neo-natal death, or the death of a child. The groups are welcoming and run by experienced staff and volunteers. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their bereavement support may also include one-to-one counselling and support, based on an assessment of your needs. They have an experienced team of specialist bereavement volunteers and counsellors able to provide this support. At present, all one to one support is provided via telephone.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.sthelena.org.uk/referral-area/bereavement-services\" target=\"_blank\">St Helena Hospice - Adults (Bereavement Support Services)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:<a href=\"https:// enquiries@sthelena.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> enquiries@sthelena.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01206984274\" target=\"_blank\">01206 984 274 </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Helena<br>Bereavement Support<br>The Joan Tomkins Centre<br>Barncroft Close<br>Colchester<br>CO4 9JU</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6d438dfd32e935a9eab .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
