    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixGt",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec0\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1\" id=\"block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coping with grief is a challenge nearly everyone has to face at one time or another. But it’s not something you have to face alone.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The pain and sense of loss can be overwhelming, especially if you’ve been closely involved with the care and end-of-life experience of a loved one.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Our highly experienced team is here to help adults who have had a relative or friend cared for by the Hospice. We also have a range of resources to help families support children with their grief.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you have been bereaved and have no prior connection to the Hospice, we can still help. Our Living With Grief programme is here for adults who have been bereaved in the past year.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are here to listen and to talk through the best ways we can provide help and support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Call 01904 777 760 from 8am to 4pm, Monday to Friday to self refer for ongoing, planned bereavement support with a dedicated member of our team.</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Leonards hospice catchment area, includes City of York, and parts of North and East Yorkshire.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://stleonardshospice.org.uk/grief/\" target=\"_blank\">St Leonard's Hospice Bereavement Support</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@stleonardshospice.org.uk\">enquiries@stleonardshospice.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01904777760\" target=\"_blank\">01904 777 760</a>  8am to 4pm, Monday to Friday to self refer for ongoing, planned bereavement support with a dedicated member of our team.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec1 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
