    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5\" id=\"block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you are struggling with a Bereavement and would like support, the trained team of listeners are on hand during our weekly Thursday sessions from 12pm to 1.30pm. Meet in St Mary’s Café. Come and talk to them over a cup of coffee. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They also offer The Bereavement Journey, a 7 week course working through grief and the loss of a loved one. The course is for any person who is bereaved, whether recently or dating back several years. Based on Christian principles, the course is suitable for anyone with or without a Christian faith. Attendance is not advisable for those who have been bereaved within the past three months.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.smem.org.uk/lyn/bereavement-support\" target=\"_blank\">St Mary's East Molesey Bereavement Support Group</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <strong> </strong><a href=\"mailto:kate.lee@smem.org.uk\">kate.lee@smem.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02084023129\" target=\"_blank\">020 8402 3129</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Marys Church<br>St Marys Road<br>East Molesey<br>Surrey<br>KT8 0ST<br><br></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6d738dfd32e935a9ec5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
