    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ecd\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece\" id=\"block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The specially trained Family and Bereavement Support Team, along with a team of highly trained and supervised volunteers, are based at St.Mary's Hospice Ulverston. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The support services offered for individuals and families are available to <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">anyone</span> over the age of 18 who is experiencing loss, irrespective of time lapsed, cause or relationship. There is also no requirement to have had previous contact with the hospice services or lost someone who was a patient at the hospice.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stmaryshospice.org.uk/our-care/for-families/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">St Mary's Hospice, Cumbria (Family &amp; Bereavement Support</a>) </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01229580305\" target=\"_blank\">01229 580305</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Mary’s Hospice,<br>Ulverston, Cumbria,<br>LA12 7JP</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">121022</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ece .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
