    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed0\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1\" id=\"block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You don’t have to have had any previous contact with the Hospice to be able to access support. You may decide to contact them in the first month or it may be some time after your bereavement. They offer a choice of attending individual or group sessions as well as a monthly social group, <a href=\"https://www.stmichaelshospice.com/index.php?p=our-services/bereavement-services-1/grows-grief-recovery-with-support\">GRoWS</a> (Grief Recovery with Support) and a twice monthly <a href=\"https://www.stmichaelshospice.com/index.php?p=our-services/bereavement-services-1/walk-and-talk-group\">Walk and Talk </a>Group both of which provide an opportunity to speak with others who are bereaved.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://stmichaelshospice.com/bereavement-services/ \" target=\"_blank\">St Michael's Bereavement Services </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@stmichaelshospice.com\">bereavement@stmichaelshospice.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01424456361\" target=\"_blank\">01424 456361 </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Michael's Hospice<br>25 Upper Maze Hill<br>St Leonards on Sea<br>East Sussex<br>TN38 0LB</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6d838dfd32e935a9ed1 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
