    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4\" id=\"block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bereavement Cafes are held at the Hospice, on the last Friday of every month 1pm-3pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The cafes are a chance for those living with any kind of bereavement to chat to the Counselling and Emotional Care team and volunteers about the help and support that can be provided by St. Rocco's.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please check on the website whether cafe's are running.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stroccos.org.uk/Support-and-Advice/The-Vitality-Centre/Family-Support\" target=\"_blank\">St Rocco's Hospice (Complementary Therapy)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@stroccos.org.uk\">enquiries@stroccos.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01925575780\" target=\"_blank\">01925 575 780</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Lockton Lane</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bewsey</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Warrington</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">WA5 0BW</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6dc38dfd32e935a9ef4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
