    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67dd42c6460a5f23c1ebeb0c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409\" id=\"block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sudden provides helpful resources for people facing unexpected bereavement. Whether due to illness, an accident, suicide, or another sudden cause, their national services offer immediate and practical guidance to help individuals and families navigate the shock and challenges of a sudden loss. <strong>They used to provide other services but now only their advice articles are available.</strong> </p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>How Sudden Can Help (Advice Articles Only)</strong></h3><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Immediate Guidance</strong> – Practical resources and step-by-step guidance to help with urgent decisions, legal matters, and coping in the early days of bereavement including a range of articles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://sudden.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Sudden (Bereavement Support)</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-6c9e4e22d96d9a96c409 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
