    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f54\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55\" id=\"block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Commissioned by the North West London and South West London NHS Clinical Commissioning Groups, this service offers:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">1:1 support</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">provision of relevant information including Help at Hand booklet</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">provision of Beyond the Rough Rock booklet for children</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">signposting to bereavement support organisations, peer support groups and/ or mental health services for counselling/support</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">an offer of advocacy and liaison support during inquests or related meetings that may be part of the process following the suicide</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">long-term support to contacts with the service, working closely with existing bereavement services and other agencies to support  individuals and families</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Covering the areas of North West London: Ealing; Hillingdon; Harrow &amp; Hounslow, Hammersmith and Fulham; Westminster; Brent and Kensington and Chelsea. And South West London boroughs: Croydon, Merton, Kingston, Richmond, Sutton and Wandsworth.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.bwwmind.org.uk/local-mind-services-london/local-counselling-services/suicide-prevention-support-services/suicide-postvention/\" target=\"_blank\">Suicide Bereavement Service, Brent, Wandsworth and Westminster</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:sbls@BWWMIND.org.uk\">sbls@BWWMIND.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Brent, Wandsworth and Westminster Mind</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Address: 23 Monck St, London SW1P 2AE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br><br></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6e738dfd32e935a9f55 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
