    "title": "Suicide Bereavement Support Service - Hull and East Yorkshire and North East Lincolnshire Mind",
    "excerpt": "<p>HULL, EAST YORKSHIRE & N.E LINCOLNSHIRE: Support to people who have been bereaved or affected by suicide including witnesses and professionals.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626518460050,
    "updatedOn": 1759936401386,
