    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixHU",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c\" id=\"block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support is available to anyone living in Hull, East Riding of Yorkshire, North and North East Lincolnshire who have been affected by a suicide or suspected suicide. When someone dies by a suspected suicide, the experience is like no other. Everyone’s emotions are unique and there is no right or wrong way to feel but support is often very helpful to help you through.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The aim at Hull and East Yorkshire and North East Lincolnshire Mind is to provide emotional and practical support for individuals of any age who have been been bereaved by suicide. The service also includes supporting people who have witnessed a suicide, as well as professionals dealing with the aftermath of a suicide.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br>Types of support could include:<br>● One-to-one support with our trained volunteers<br>● Signposting<br>● Support during an inquest<br>● Support for professionals</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support is tailored to your needs.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01482240133\" target=\"_blank\">01482 240133 </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@heymind.org.uk\">info@heymind.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6e838dfd32e935a9f5c .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
