    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f74\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75\" id=\"block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sadly, bereavement is something that we will all experience at some point in our lives, but Sunderland Counselling Service can support you with one to one counselling to try to make sense of your feelings, feel understood and provide you with a place to talk.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At Sunderland Counselling Service, we offer a range of options of support if you have experienced a bereavement including one to one counselling and small group bereavement support, supported by two experienced bereavement counsellors. The service is BACP accredited.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.sunderlandcounselling.org.uk/bereavement-support-group/\" target=\"_blank\">Sunderland Counselling Service</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01915147007\" target=\"_blank\">0191 5147007</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:office@sunderlandcounselling.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">office@sunderlandcounselling.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br>Sunderland Counselling Services,<br>51 John Street,<br>Sunderland SR1 1QN</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f75 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
