    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7b\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c\" id=\"block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Sunrise Bereavement Support Group aims to provide a comfortable place where bereaved people can go and talk about their feelings and difficulty adjusting to life following personal bereavement or just to be in the presence of others.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Professional listeners are present at every meeting. They ask for a small donation towards refreshments.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sunrise Bereavement Group is for people aged 18 and over, and runs at the Louise Hamilton Centre at the James Paget University Hospital, Great Yarmouth on the 4th Wednesday of every month from 5.45 p.m - 7.15 p.m. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please call for more details.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: Janis Turner <a href=\"tel:07511472648\" target=\"_blank\">07511 472648</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:sunrise.bereavement@outlook.com\">sunrise.bereavement@outlook.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">James Paget Hospital<br>Lowestoft Road<br>Gorleston<br>Great Yarmouth<br>Norfolk</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">NR31 6LA</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6ddcae1897849b94f7c .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
