    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/survivors-of-bereavement-by-suicide-sobs-lewisham",
    "title": "Survivors of Bereavement by Suicide (SoBS)  - Lewisham",
    "excerpt": "<p>Befriending and support for people bereaved by suicide of a family member or friend.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626518520050,
