    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002jblj",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7\" id=\"block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Peer-led support groups and national helpline can provide a safe, confidential environment in which those impacted by suicide can share experiences and feelings, thus giving and gaining support from each other.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you have lost someone to suicide, a local peer support group is now meeting in Colburn. The group is facilitated by SoBS volunteers, who have also experienced this type of bereavement. The group is open to all those aged 18 years and over who have lost someone to suicide, such as a friend, family member or work colleague.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The group meets on the last Thursday evening of the month from 7pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services also include email support <a href=\"mailto:email.support@uksobs.org?\" target=\"_blank\">email.support@uksobs.org</a> and an online community forum. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.uksobs.org\" target=\"_blank\">Survivors Of Bereavement By Suicide (SoBS) - Colburn (Support Groups)</a>  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:<strong> </strong><a href=\"tel:07507295719\" target=\"_blank\">07507 295719</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:colburn@uksobs.org\">colburn@uksobs.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">National Helpline number is <a href=\"tel:03001115065\" target=\"_blank\">0300 111 5065</a> and available Monday to Sunday 9am -7pm  </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6ebcae1897849b94fe7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
