    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c6f769fee86e04969991\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c6f769fee86e04969992\" id=\"block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Swan Team provide immediate emotional support to loved ones who have recently lost someone either in hospital or at home, within the Fylde Coast. The Swan Team also offer support to staff to ensure the teams are supported and able to provide care that meets the SWAN Model Standards, offering compassionate and discreet support through the immediate grief journey<br><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.bfwh.nhs.uk/our-services/end-of-life-care/swan-end-of-life-and-bereavement-care-team/\" target=\"_blank\">Swan End Of Life Bereavement Team (Emotional Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bfwh.swanteam@nhs.net\">bfwh.swanteam@nhs.net</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01253952456\" target=\"_blank\">01253 952456</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Swan End of Life Bereavement Team<br>Old Blue Skies Offices<br>Blackpool Victoria Hospital<br>Whinney Heys Road<br>Blackpool<br>Lancashire<br>FY3 8NR<br><br></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c6f769fee86e04969992 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
