    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf129\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a\" id=\"block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All of the Talkzone counsellors work in accordance with the British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy (BACP) Ethical Framework for the Counselling Professions. They are trained and experienced and will always respect your right to make your own decisions. Their counselling services include bereavement support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.talkzone.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Talkzone (Counselling And Psychotherapy)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@talkzone.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">info@talkzone.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:  <a href=\"tel:01909530943\" target=\"_blank\">01909 530943</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Abbey Street Community Centre, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Abbey Street,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Worksop, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nottinghamshire</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">S80 2LA</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c8c576dc911dd0caf12a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
