    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/the-bereavement-cafe-cic",
    "title": "The Bereavement Café CIC",
    "excerpt": "<p>Offering peer to peer support, to meet others locally who are going through similar experiences - friendship, advice and hope.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626520440050,
    "updatedOn": 1760635559111,
