    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf250\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251\" id=\"block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Giles Hospice has arranged a Bereavement Help Point in Bath for those who have been bereaved. It takes place on the first and third Monday of every month from 1.30pm to 3.30pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you’re experiencing or have experienced bereavement, whether recently or some time ago, this Bereavement Help Point may be just what you need.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">These sessions help with the practical and emotional aspects of loss, with the chance to chat over a cup of tea and meet others in a similar situation.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They also offer support for families as well as a dedicated bereavement helpline (below).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stgileshospice.com/how-we-can-help-you/our-care/bereavement-support-services/\" target=\"_blank\">The Bereavement Help Point - Bath</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:sct@stgileshospice.com\" target=\"_blank\">sct@stgileshospice.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01543434536\" target=\"_blank\">01543434536</a> (Monday to Friday, from 9am – 4:30pm) </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Hub,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mulberry Way</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mulberry Park,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Combe Down,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">BA2 5BU</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c8cd76dc911dd0caf251 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
