    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/the-bereavement-journey-acocks-green",
    "title": "The Bereavement Journey - Acocks Green",
    "excerpt": "<p>Run over 7 weeks, The Bereavement Journey is a great place to talk and will help anyone coming to terms with a bereavement.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626519840050,
    "updatedOn": 1751371094209,
