    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6\" id=\"block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p>The Bereavement Journey is a seven session series of films and discussion groups that gently guide people bereaved at any time through the most common aspects of grief and bereavement, enabling them to process the implications for themselves and discern next steps.   Usually run by churches, the course uniquely offers a seventh session on faith questions in bereavement, provided from a Christian perspective.  This follows the six main sessions and is optional, making The Bereavement Journey suitable for people of any faith or none.</p>\n<p>The sessions are being hosted by Gold Hill Baptist Church.</p>\n<p>For session dates and registration contact Maria Bond.  </p>\n<p>Email: maria.bond@goldhill.org</p>\n<p>Telephone: 01753 341010</p>\n<p>Website: <a href=\"https://www.goldhill.org/quick-links/calendar/\">https://www.goldhill.org/quick-links/calendar/ </a></p>\n<p>Gold Hill Baptist Church The Hub Church Lane Chalfont St Peter Buckinghamshire SL9 9RF</p>\n<p><img src=\"/GetImage.aspx?IDMF=00ee46dd-10db-4fad-85c7-bf340be32b99&amp;w=250&amp;h=135&amp;src=mc\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" class=\"mediaImage\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>14/12/23</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2c8eab2be0b232f3634f6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
