    "title": "The Bereavement Journey - University of Nottingham Chaplaincy",
    "excerpt": "<p>Run over 7 weeks, The Bereavement Journey is a great place to talk and will help anyone coming to terms with a bereavement.  Only open to the staff and students of the University of Nottingham.</p>\n",
