    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20bf929934533b5699d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20bf929934533b5699e\" id=\"block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Beresford Centre is a registered charity, established in 1993 to support couples in unexpected pregnancy, post termination and following baby loss.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They aim to provide client led long and short term support. Help is impartial and confidential. They provide support to anyone from Newport, Cardiff, Caerphilly, Chepstow, Caldicot, Gwent, Glamorgan and Rhymney Valleys</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"http://www.beresfordcentre.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> The Beresford Centre, Newport (Baby Loss Charity)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01633212320\" target=\"_blank\">01633 212320</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ty Gaer Park Drive, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Newport, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">NP20 3NN</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20bf929934533b5699e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
