    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Bethany Bereavement Support Service provides assistance to people of all faiths or none who are over the age of 18 years old and living in the Bury St Edmunds area in Suffolk.</p>",
