    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixIH",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20cf929934533b569c2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20cf929934533b569c3\" id=\"block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Navigating the challenging landscape of grief and trauma, especially for children, demands an expert hand and a supportive environment. Care for Bobby, is dedicated to providing specialised counselling services tailored for children aged 4 to 19. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Key Points of Their Services: </p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Specialised Counselling: Trained counsellors provide individual sessions and group support, ensuring that the therapy is age-appropriate and effective. </p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Family Support Network: Care for Bobby has established a robust network for families who've endured similar tragedies, offering an invaluable platform for shared experiences, mutual support, and community understanding.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Awareness &amp; Advocacy: Mental health's importance cannot be overstated, especially in the context of children grappling with grief. Care For Bobby works relentlessly to raise awareness, combat stigmas, and encourage families to acknowledge and seek assistance for their emotional needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Community Collaboration: Our strength lies in understanding our community's unique challenges. Collaborating with healthcare providers, local authorities, and institutions like yours, Care For Bobby is determined to create holistic solutions for both emotional and physical well-being. </p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.thebobbycollerantrust.org.uk/what-we-do/counselling-support\" target=\"_blank\">The Bobby Colleran Trust (Youth Counselling Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:takecare@thebobbycollerantrust.org.uk\">takecare@thebobbycollerantrust.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01513053798\" target=\"_blank\">01513053798</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Verified</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20cf929934533b569c3 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
