    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e\" id=\"block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Corner is a confidential health and wellbeing service for young people aged 11-19 (and up to 25 if vulnerable). The Corner is located at 13 Shore Terrace, Dundee, on the corner of Castle and Exchange Street, across from Slessor gardens in Dundee’s City Centre.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Corner offers a wide range of services including sexual health, emotional health, counselling and crisis support. Additional support includes young people experiencing exam pressures, bullying, body changes, relationship concerns and more. The Corner's City Centre drop-in is a safe and welcoming space where an experienced team of staff offer young people confidential support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Corner team are currently available to offer confidential support between 9am-5pm, Monday to Friday, online and over the telephone, but these hours may change as COVID-19 restrictions ease, so please keep up to date with any changes via our social media platforms.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Facebook and Twitter: @thecornerdundee</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Instagram: @cornerdundee</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"https://www.thecorner.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> The Corner Dundee (Youth Wellbeing Services)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:tay.office.corner@nhs.scot\">tay.office.corner@nhs.scot</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01382206060\">01382 20 60 60</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Drop in:</strong> 13 Shore Terrace, Dundee, DD1 3DP<br><strong>Office:</strong> 18 Dock Street, Dundee, DD1 3NP</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d202ac6c8e765ee8ba1e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
