    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b\" id=\"block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Counselling Foundation provides counselling training and counselling. It has been working to support its communities since 1974. It works with people to prepare for a career in counselling and by offering counselling support. We offer in person, safe and confidential counselling across Herts and Beds and online and telephone counselling across the UK.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The charity is registered with the BACP (British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy) and therefore operates within strict, ethical standards. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We have centres in St Albans, Hertford, Broxbourne, Stevenage, Luton and Bedford. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://gbr01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcounsellingfoundation.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cservices%40ataloss.org%7Cc7749a9ac0894b2e613f08dd2344c789%7Ce40cd9e2366641e8b6d7eaa8e579d977%7C0%7C0%7C638705500509227698%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=1pV%2B7qvaU60VZUuLYgGEraAiYVzVnhLc3RidPdROIoA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">The Counselling Foundation - Hertfordshire And Bedfordshire</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:foundation@counsellingfoundation.org\" target=\"_blank\">foundation@counsellingfoundation.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:03003036690\" target=\"_blank\">0300 303 6690</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Centres:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedford</strong>: Tavistock Yard, 58 Tavistock Street, Bedford. MK40 2RD</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Broxbourne</strong>: Bishops College, Churchgate, Cheshunt. EN8 9XQ</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Hertford</strong>: Hertford Wellbeing, 5a Great Northern Works, Hartham Ln, Hertford, SG14 1QW</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Luton</strong>: Hilde Eccles House, 70-72 Princess Street, Luton. LU1 5AT</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>St Albans</strong>: 1 College Yard, Lower Dagnall Street, St Albans. AL3 4PA</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Stevenage</strong>: Springfield House Community Centre, 24 High Street, Stevenage. SG1 3EJ</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d203ac6c8e765ee8ba6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
