    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d\" id=\"block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Counsellors come from many differing theoretical and experiential backgrounds.   The Haven Counselling Centre has counsellors that are individually accredited or working towards accreditation with BACP (British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy) or UKCP (United Kingdom Council for Psychotherapy). They provide support, offering short and long term therapy dependant on the needs of the client. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.thehavenashby.org.uk/#section1\" target=\"_blank\">The Haven Counselling Centre</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Contact</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@thehavenashby.org.uk\">admin@thehavenashby.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01530560921\" target=\"_blank\">01530 560921</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Haven<br>Castle House, South Street, Ashby de la Zouch, Leicestershire LE651BR from The Old Police Station.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20bac6c8e765ee8bb2d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
