    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b\" id=\"block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Junction Cardiff is a non-judgmental counselling and bereavement support service, offering support to anyone who has experienced pregnancy loss, baby loss or pregnancy related distress. They are located in the Llanedeyrn area of Cardiff, South Wales, UK and are part of the HOPE charitable trust.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"https://www.thejunctioncardiff.org/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.hopecardiff.org/junction\" target=\"_blank\">The Junction (Counselling Service) </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact: </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@thejunctioncardiff.org\">info@thejunctioncardiff.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07807608009\" target=\"_blank\">07807 608009</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Glenwood Wellbeing Centre</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Circle Way West</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Llanedeyrn</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cardiff</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CF23 6UA</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20cac6c8e765ee8bb6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
