    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f\" id=\"block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The service provides a safe space for people who have been bereaved by suicide to come together and talk openly about their experience. The groups are facilitated by trained professionals who bring with them the skills and knowledge around coping with grief, loss, and bereavement. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.kaleidoscopeplus.org.uk/suicide-bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">The Kaleidoscope Plus Group (Suicide Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:SPPARK@kaleidoscopeplus.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">SPPARK@kaleidoscopeplus.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:01215655605\" target=\"_blank\">0121 565 5605</a> / <a href=\"tel:07970040016\" target=\"_blank\">07970 040016</a> (Melanie Griffin)</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">321 High Street </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">West Bromwich</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">West Midlands                  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">B70 8LU</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20dac6c8e765ee8bb6f .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
