    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb94\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95\" id=\"block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Laura Centre offers specialist bereavement support to parents who's child of any age has died, we offer one to one therapy and couples therapy. We also provide support to children and young people 5-25 years old after the death of a parent/carer or a sibling using one to one talking and specialist creative play therapies, as well as systemic family therapy. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Laura centre also support those families who are in anticipatory grief, supporting them through the stages in preparation for a death. We run therapeutic groups, drop in groups and a walking group. The advice Line operates Monday to Friday, it is for parents, professionals and anyone over the age of 16, our bereavement advice line will connect you with a professional bereavement therapist. <br><br>Our advice line is also open to social services, mental health organisations, GP’s, educational establishments and any other professionals who are working to support bereaved individuals and families, please call 0116 2544341.The Laura centre also provide bespoke training and supervision to other organisations.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We take self referrals and referrals from professionals.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.thelauracentre.org\" target=\"_blank\">The Laura Centre (Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:<a href=\"https:// info@thelauracentre.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> info@thelauracentre.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01162544341\" target=\"_blank\">0116 254 4341</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20eac6c8e765ee8bb95 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
