    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b\" id=\"block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Light House is a registered charity which provides a general counselling service and bereavement support to over 18’s irrespective of race, gender, sexual orientation, belief or social background. The Light House offers face-to-face, telephone and video counselling provided by trained counsellors. Sessions are charged at an affordable rate based on household income including any benefits and before tax. The Light House is committed to providing a counselling service that is accessible to all.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://lighthousechristiancare.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">The Light House (Counselling/Bereavement Support Charity)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:office@lighthousechristiancare.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">office@lighthousechristiancare.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02476440095\" target=\"_blank\">02476 440095</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">1A Argyll Street,</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Coventry</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CV2 4FJ</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bb9b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
