    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/the-lily-mae-foundation",
    "title": "The Lily Mae Foundation",
    "excerpt": "<p>Provides support to parents and families who have lost a baby to stillbirth, neonatal death, miscarriage or medical termination.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
