    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb7\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8\" id=\"block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Working alongside Medical &amp; Healthcare Professionals, other Charities and the All Party Parliamentary Group for Babyloss, the LilyMae Foundation want to be recognised as the main provider of bereavement support for families who have lost a baby to Stillbirth, Neonatal Death, Miscarriage or Medical Termination in the West Midlands.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A wide range of services is available including babyloss support groups (grandparents and wider family members are welcome); memory boxes to Bereaved Parents; Memory Making Kits to Grandparents; Counselling Support for Parents, Siblings and Family Members; special support for Dads. Information for Parents, Families, Health Care and Medical Professionals. Please check the website for services currently running and to find information to download. Service includes out of hours phone number.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.lilymaefoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\">The Lily Mae Foundation (Pregnancy Support Services)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email Address: <a href=\"mailto:info@lilymaefoundation.org\">info@lilymaefoundation.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:<a href=\"tel:01676535716\" target=\"_blank\"> 01676 535716</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Lily Mae Foundation, First Floor, The Annex , Fernhill Court, Balsall Common, CV7 7PH</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d20fac6c8e765ee8bbb8 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
