    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4\" id=\"block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Offering a compassionate and comfortable environment that gives adults and children the help they need – or points them towards another service, if what will help them best is outside our scope. They are an Organisational Member of the British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy and work in accordance with its ethical framework.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Linden Centre takes self-referrals – just pick up the phone and ask for an appointment, email or simply call in for more information. From your initial telephone contact or visit, they will arrange an assessment appointment. This session takes about an hour, and will explore your current situation, talk about how you are feeling, and explain what kind of support is available.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.trinityhospice.co.uk/our-services/counselling-and-support/\" target=\"_blank\">The Linden Centre, Trinity Hospice (Counselling And Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:trinity.linden.centre@nhs.net\">trinity.linden.centre@nhs.net</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01253952582\" target=\"_blank\">01253 952582</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d210ac6c8e765ee8bbd4 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
