    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768cf\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0\" id=\"block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please Read:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Grief is one of the triggers to mental ill health and can be confused with having a mental health ‘problem’ - it is natural to go through a range of physical and emotional processes as we come to terms with our loss. With timely bereavement support to help you process your loss and move forward with your life, most people can avoid mental ill health. There are many bereavement services listed on this website that could help you. I<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">f you are seeking mental health support rather than bereavement support, please mention to the provider that you have been bereaved - however long ago this happened - as it will help them decide how best to support you. </span></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Moorings at Devon offers out-of-hours mental health support to anyone aged 18+ in the Devon area.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They are now located at Torbay hospital at the Health and Wellbeing unit (Torquay service) and their Exeter service has moved to Wonford house Exeter. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.mhm.org.uk/the-moorings-devon\" target=\"_blank\">The Mooring (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:devontorquay.mhm@nhs.net\">devontorquay.mhm@nhs.net</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07483991848\" target=\"_blank\">07483 991848</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d25e1d17792ec81768d0 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
