    "fullUrl": "https://www.ataloss.org/more-info/bereavement-services/the-niamh-louise-foundation",
    "title": "The Niamh Louise Foundation",
    "excerpt": "<p>NORTHERN IRELAND: Provides support for bereaved families who have lost a loved one to suicide and support for those who have been affected by suicide.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626521280050,
    "updatedOn": 1760889466689,
