    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f5\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6\" id=\"block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Olive Branch Counselling Service offers affordable counselling for people 18 and over in Winchester and the surrounding areas. Counselling delivered weekly online or face to face in Central Winchester and &nbsp;for up to one year.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.theolivebranch.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">The Olive Branch Counselling Service</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01962842858\" target=\"_blank\">01962 842858</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">E-mail: <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@theolivebranch.org.uk\">enquiries@theolivebranch.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:<br>The Olive Branch<br>14 St. Clement Street<br>Winchester<br>Hants<br>SO23 9HH</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d25f1d17792ec81768f6 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
