    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Rowland Brothers Foundation is a registered charity offering free, professional bereavement support to individuals and families in Croydon and the surrounding areas in person.</p>",
