    "title": "The Seddon Legacy Project",
    "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The Seddon Legacy Project is a community-led initiative supporting bereaved children in Northamptonshire. Founded by Anne-Marie following the loss of her children's father to suicide in April 2024, the project offers free, volunteer-run services to help children navigate grief in a safe, inclusive, and child-friendly environment.</p>",
