    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-68359e1f0c33bf26e15beefc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"61352e2509dd8982b238\" id=\"block-61352e2509dd8982b238\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Seddon Legacy Project is a community-led initiative supporting bereaved children in Northamptonshire. Founded by Anne-Marie following the loss of her children's father to suicide in April 2024, the project offers free, volunteer-run services to help children navigate grief in a safe, inclusive, and child-friendly environment.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Services are scheduled as per group meetings and school sessions; please contact for specific timings. The service is open to self-referrals and referrals from professionals. Referral forms can be submitted via the website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Support Offered:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The Starlight Group:</strong> A monthly peer support group for children aged 3–10, featuring memory-making crafts and open conversations about grief in a relaxed setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bereavement Befriender:</strong> One-to-one support within Northamptonshire schools, providing emotional assistance and a tailored bereavement support plan in collaboration with school staff and safeguarding teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Mini Mourning &amp; Me:</strong> A chat series designed to facilitate discussions around grief and bereavement.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The Funeral Friend:</strong> Guidance and support for children attending funerals, helping them understand and cope with the experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.seddonlegacyproject.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\">The Seddon Legacy Project (Youth Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:theseddonlegacyproject@gmail.com?\" target=\"_blank\">theseddonlegacyproject@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:07984685223\" target=\"_blank\">07984685223</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-61352e2509dd8982b238 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-61352e2509dd8982b238 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-61352e2509dd8982b238 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-61352e2509dd8982b238 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-61352e2509dd8982b238 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-61352e2509dd8982b238 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-61352e2509dd8982b238 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
