    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a05\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06\" id=\"block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>The</strong> <strong>Young People’s Counselling Service (YPCS)</strong> is a registered charity providing a <strong>free</strong> and <strong>confidential </strong>service that can be accessed by anyone aged between 11 and 18 years old in emotional difficulty, which includes distress caused by bereavement. The Young People’s Counselling Service offers up to 12 sessions of free counselling. This service currently operates out of three locations in Yaxley, Whittlesey, Wisbeach and Ramsey. Young people can refer themselves or be referred by a parent/carer, GP, professional or school.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.ypcs.uk/free-counselling-service/\" target=\"_blank\">The Young People’s Counselling Service, Peterborough</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:admin@ypcs.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">admin@ypcs.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01733903288\" target=\"_blank\">01733 903288 </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Annabelle Davis Centre<br>School Bungalow<br>Broadway<br>Yaxley<br>Peterborough PE7 3JD</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26a1d17792ec8176a06 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
