    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d\" id=\"block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Thrive offer flexible appointment times to fit your needs and schedule including early mornings, Wednesday daytimes, Friday mornings and weekday evenings to best suit your needs. Please check on arrangements by contacting them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Jenny is an experienced and qualified Integrative Counsellor and counselling supervisor who is committed to offering you a safe and confidential place to identify and talk through your issues and to work towards the changes you desire.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://thrivecounsellingcumbernauld.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Thrive Counselling Cumbernauld</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:jenny@thrivewestofscotland.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">jenny@thrivewestofscotland.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07711089670\" target=\"_blank\">07711 089 670</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">c/o Thrive Counselling Cumbernauld, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Suite 18b Carron House, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Carron Way, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cumbernauld Town Centre, </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">G67 1ER</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26b1d17792ec8176a0d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
