    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b\" id=\"block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Touched by Suicide Scotland is a Self Help organisation, run by people that have been “Touched by Suicide”. It exists to meet the needs and break the isolation of those bereaved by the suicide of a close relative or friend.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They offer emotional and practical support in a number of ways including counselling, a confidential telephone helpline and support and information help by e-mail.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">They run group and network meetings to share information relating to practical issues and problems.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Their aim is to provide a safe confidential environment in which bereaved people can share their experiences and feelings so giving a gaining support from each other.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONFIDENTIAL TELEPHONE  HELPLINE</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"tel:01294229087\" target=\"_blank\">01294 229 087</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://touchedbysuicidescotland.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Touched by Suicide Scotland (Emotional And Practical Support) </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email:- <a href=\"mailto:touchedbysuicidescotland@hotmail.co.uk\">touchedbysuicidescotland@hotmail.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d2701d17792ec8176a9b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
