    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d2711d17792ec8176aba\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb\" id=\"block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Towards Tomorrow Together provide free or low cost services including:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">-<strong>Funeral support</strong>. 1:1 support from our celebrant, or 'soul midwife' can help you to navigate the choices available to you, and help you plan to say goodbye to your baby in a way which suits your family.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- <strong>Butterfly Bags</strong>. These little organza bags are given to families experiencing an early pregnancy loss. They contain a crocheted butterfly, and a card as an acknowledgement of your loss.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- <strong>Support Groups</strong>. A monthly support group on Zoom, facilitated by trustees and core volunteers, which is open to all. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Also holistic therapies, counselling and bespoke support.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://towards-tomorrow.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Towards Tomorrow Together (Counselling Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://towards-tomorrow.com/contact/\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Towards Tomorrow Together on their contact page.</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d2711d17792ec8176abb .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
