    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2\" id=\"block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Treetops Hospice offer counselling and emotional support, and complementary therapy to adults, children and young people who have been bereaved; and to adults with a life-limiting illness and their family members.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Counselling and Emotional Support services are available to all users of Treetops clinical services and people registered with a GP practice in Derby city, Erewash or Southern Derby. Our Complementary Therapy service is available to people who are currently in receipt of our care.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All services are provided free of charge, and are not means-tested.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We will arrange an assessment with you, at which the most appropriate form of support for you can be discussed.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Please phone Therapeutic Services on&nbsp;<a href=\"tel:0115%20949%206944\">0115 949 6944</a>&nbsp;during our opening hours (8.30am-4pm Monday-Thursday, 8.30am-3.30pm Friday).</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.treetopshospice.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Treetops Hospice (Counselling &amp; Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">E:<a href=\"https:// info@treetopshospice.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> info@treetopshospice.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Treetops Hospice, Derby Road, Risley, Derbyshire, DE72 3SS</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
