    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixJy",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5\" id=\"block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Sadly, grief isn’t something we can simply think ourselves out of.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">As Bessel van der Kolk, psychotherapist and author of the best-seller The Body Keeps the Score said: “Nobody talked you into grief, why are you expecting to talk yourself out of it?” </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Grief often shows up in the body, e.g. as tension, fatigue or even unexplained aches and pains.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">When the body carries what the heart can’t express, it’s often asking for a gentler way to release.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">That’s where TRE (Tension and Trauma Releasing Exercises, developed by David Berceli, PhD) can offer support. It's a body-based practice that allows your body to unwind what words can’t reach and let the body do what it is naturally designed to do.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Once you’ve learned how to practise TRE safely, it becomes a lifelong tool for self-care and balance.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">I’m Sylvia, a certified TRE Provider with a foundation in counselling (COSCA) and I hold space for those who are ready to address their grief in a healing and somatic way.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">And if this resonates with you, I can share more about how TRE can support you in a free fact-finding chat. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Natural. Innate. TREmendous.</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.tremendoustre.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">TREmendous TRE (Grief Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:sylviatillmann@mail.uk\">sylviatillmann@mail.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:07904427122\" target=\"_blank\">07904 427122</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">St Augustines Road<br>Chartham<br>Ramsgate<br>Kent<br>CT11 9NZ</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d2721d17792ec8176ac5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
