    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixK5",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e182\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183\" id=\"block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will explore your own feelings about loss and bereavement and learn about the ways in which bereavement affects people. This is helpful for anyone who has been bereaved to better understand their grief but also for people in the community supporting bereaved people.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will also look at your own coping strategies for supporting people who have been bereaved.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">What grief is</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The ‘cycle of grief’ (using Kubler Ross model of grief)</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The difference between ‘normal’ and ‘abnormal’ grief</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">What advice and support we can provide to people who are bereaved</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fee: £25</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This session will be delivered online by St Catherine’s Hospice. The specialist Knowledge Exchange Team delivers high quality education through interactive training sessions. The study sessions and courses are continually reviewed and updated, with new subjects added regularly to provide the most up-to-date guidance and expert advice, and to facilitate topical and diverse discussions amongst health care professionals and members of the community.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You would need to have access to a computer or mobile device with internet connection, a webcam and a microphone. Please note attendees must log into the event via the invite received from St Catherine’s Hospice 15 minutes before the start.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.stcatherines.co.uk/shop/events/study-sessions/understanding-bereavement-for-all-september/\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding Bereavement Course (Bereavement Support)</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT: </strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:education@stcatherines.co.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">education@stcatherines.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01772629171\" target=\"_blank\">01772 629171</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26919989f3ddc02e183 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
