    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e193\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194\" id=\"block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A community service to support people to find ways of coping and living with grief following the death of a significant other, however, whenever and wherever they died. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Support may include:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Information and advice about grief or other services you may need.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">An agreement for 1:1 emotional support.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">An opportunity to join a group.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A referral for specialist support e.g. financial, advocacy, mental health.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You can refer yourself or ask a health or social care professional to make the referral.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.pwh.org.uk/our-care/for-patients/w-d-bereavement-service\" target=\"_blank\">Wakefield And District Bereavement Support Service</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@pwh.org.uk\">bereavement@pwh.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone:  <a href=\"tel:01977781452\" target=\"_blank\">01977 781452</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Prince of Wales Hospice<br>Halfpenny Lane<br>Pontefract<br>West Yorkshire<br>WF8 4BG</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26b19989f3ddc02e194 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
