    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd\" id=\"block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wandsworth Bereavement Service provides one to one bereavement counselling for anyone who is resident in the Borough of Wandsworth and for residents of neighbouring Boroughs who have been unable to access bereavement counselling elsewhere.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anyone who has been bereaved or is facing an anticipated death can access the service irrespective of age, gender, sexuality, disability, race, ethnic origin or religion.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Service offers counselling either in person or online via Zoom.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.wandsworthbereavement.org.ukhttp://www.wandsworthbereavement.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">W</a><a href=\"https://www.wandsworthbereavement.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">andsworth Bereavement Service (Bereavement Counselling)</a><a href=\"http://www.wandsworthbereavement.org.ukhttp://www.wandsworthbereavement.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@wandsworthbereavement.org.uk\">support@wandsworthbereavement.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:02072233178\" target=\"_blank\">020 7223 3178</a></p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26d19989f3ddc02e1bd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
