    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fc\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd\" id=\"block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Affordable &amp; Accessible Counselling service offers low and no cost counselling services to ensure that everyone can access the support they need. Fees are reduced to make therapy affordable and accessible for individuals from all backgrounds. The lowest fee currently is £20. The initial consultation has a non-refundable fee of £60 if you are employed or £30 if you are on a low income or unemployed. Please call the office if you believe that the above fees are unmanageable due to your financial circumstances. Service users are usually offered 18 sessions of counselling which can be extended up to a maximum of 2 years. Service users can self-refer via our website.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Multilingual Counselling for Refugees &amp; Asylum-Seekers provides free mother-tongue counselling to migrants, refugees, and asylum seekers. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">See their website for a list of the languages that they can offer support in currently.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">WCC also runs various social activity groups for its isolated service users, including regular meetups for Refugees and Asylum-Seekers. These activities range from cultural excursions to hands-on workshops, designed to bring refugees and asylum-seekers together.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website:<a href=\"https://waterloocc.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"> Waterloo Community Counselling</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Opening times</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Office hours</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">9.30am-5.30pm Monday-Friday</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">10-4pm Saturday</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Access</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ramp for wheelchair access</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">No disabled toilet access</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Catchment area</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Greater London</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Target group</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Adults living in London, especially those needing to access low-cost counselling as well as refugees and asylum-seekers needing to access counselling in their mother-tongue.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Further information</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@waterloocc.co.uk\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">info@waterloocc.co.uk</span></a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tel: <a href=\"tel:02079283462\" target=\"_blank\">020 7928 3462</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Referral method</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Professional or self-referral for each service via referral forms on the website. No drop-in facility and appointments must be made in advance.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e1fd .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
