    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e201\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202\" id=\"block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wathall's are an independent funeral directors in Derby providing free bereavement support to anyone in the local community. They run 'Dandelion's' Bereavement support groups and deliver the Grief Journey Programme as a bereavement programme. They have also won the Derby Telegraph Business awards for their contribution to the community. You don't have to be a client to benefit.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>What's on offer?</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Derby</strong> Dandelions Meets every 2nd and last Tuesday of the month at St. Peter’s in the City, St Peter’s Street, Derby, between 1:30-3:30pm. Evening Group first Tuesday of each month 6-8pm at Derby Rugby Club, Haslam’s Lane, Derby.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Ashbourne</strong> Dandelions Meets 1st Wednesday of the month at Century Hall. 1:30 – 3pm.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wathall’s also run a 4 week support programme – Dandelions Grief Journey Programme throughout the year. Please see the website for the latest dates or contact Fay Bloor to reserve a place on the next programme.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.wathalls.co.uk/bereavement-support/\" target=\"_blank\">Wathall's Funerals (Bereavement Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:  Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01332 345268\">01332 345268</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:fay.bloor@wathalls.co.uk\">fay.bloor@wathalls.co.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Wathall's,<br>101-111 Macklin St,<br>Derby<br>DE1 1LG </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d26f19989f3ddc02e202 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
