    "salesforceId": "a01J5000002ixKV",
    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e\" id=\"block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"is-empty\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"> Grieving for someone we have loved is a completely normal experience but sometimes taking up support at such a difficult time can be really helpful. Often what someone who is grieving needs the most, is the chance to talk and express their feelings with someone who isn’t family or friends.&nbsp; </p><p class=\"is-empty\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">  If you are grieving the loss of someone cared for by <strong>Willowbrook Hospice</strong> or any of the following: <strong>Whiston Hospital Specialist Palliative Care Team, St. Helens &amp; Knowsley Community Specialist Palliative Care Team, Whiston Upper GI Team or Breast Mates Secondaries Support Group</strong>, we can help you. </p><p class=\"is-empty\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">  If you want our support please call our Patient &amp; family Support Team on <a href=\"tel:01514308796\">0151 430 8796</a> or email us on <a href=\"mailto:bereavement@willowbrookhospice.org.uk\">bereavement@willowbrookhospice.org.uk</a>. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">‍  ‍</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e33e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
