    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e359\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a\" id=\"block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Willows Counselling are committed to providing professional and effective counselling and seek to reach those in greatest need. Willows Counselling Service is an organisational member of both the Association of Christian Counsellors (ACC) and the National Counselling Society (NCP), and works to both frameworks of ethics and practice.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">You may self refer to this service.  </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.willowscounselling.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Willows Counselling</a> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>CONTACT:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:willows@willowscounselling.org.uk?\" target=\"_blank\">willows@willowscounselling.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01793426650\" target=\"_blank\">01793 426650</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Willows Counselling Service<br>The Willows Centre<br>11 Prospect Place<br>Old Town<br>Swindon<br>SN1 3LQ</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27519989f3ddc02e35a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
