    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a6\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7\" id=\"block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All services are free and they do not ask client for donations.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Impartial counselling<br>- Caring Support<br>- Relevant Information<br>- Confidentiality<br>- Unplanned Pregnancy Support<br>- Post-abortion Support<br>- Miscarriage Support</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.winchesterpregnancycrisis.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Winchester Pregnancy Crisis Centre (Support Services)</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:office@winchesterpregnancycrisis.com\">office@winchesterpregnancycrisis.com</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01962813302\" target=\"_blank\">01962813302</a> / <a href=\"tel:07742976064\" target=\"_blank\">07742976064</a></p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bradbury House, Durngate Place<br>Winchester, Hampshire<br>SO23 8DX</h2></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27819989f3ddc02e3a7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
