    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b1\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2\" id=\"block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Woodside Bereavement Support (WBS) is a professional counselling service. The key aim of the Service is to support clients mental and physical well being through understanding their loss and increasing their capacity and ability to better manage their daily tasks at a time of stress and chaos to manage re-engagement with their family, friends and the local community to maintain or improve their well being.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Through the bereavement support received it is aimed to assist to regain a sense of purpose at a challenging time in their lives and the resilience to lead healthy and independent lives and reach their full potential. The bereavement support sessions are delivered through 1 to 1 and group sessions.<br><br></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"http://www.thelisteningear.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\">Woodside Bereavement Service (Counselling Service)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONTACT:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Phone:<a href=\"tel:02032562009\" target=\"_blank\">0203 256 2009</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <strong> </strong><a href=\"mailto:wbs@thelisteningear.org.uk\">wbs@thelisteningear.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Waterside Centre<br>26 Avenue Road<br>Croydon<br>London<br>SE25 4DX</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3b2 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
