    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3bd\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be\" id=\"block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Worthing Counselling Service has been a provider of counselling - including bereavement counselling- for almost 35 years. With 30 counsellors they offer significant depth and breadth of experience. The centre is accredited by the the British Association for Counselling and Psychotherapy and they adhere to BACP's ethical framework for the Counselling Professions.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.worthingcounsellingcentre.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Worthing Counselling Centre</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@worthingcounsellingcentre.org?\" target=\"_blank\">info@worthingcounsellingcentre.org</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01903212275\" target=\"_blank\">01903 212275</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Worthing Counselling Centre</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Field Place Manor House</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Boulevard</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Worthing</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">BN13 1NP</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27a19989f3ddc02e3be .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
