    "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c8\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/7bec8ac6-604d-421a-bd5b-ac60fa6e23e7_888/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9\" id=\"block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content=\"\"><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">A Wrexham and Chester based confidential listening, pregnancy and post loss advisory support service providing impartial advice and confidential support to women and men experiencing stress due to unplanned or unwanted pregnancy, pregnancy loss (eg miscarriage, ectopic pregnancy) or abortion.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All appointments are FREE and confidential</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Official Website: <a href=\"https://www.ybont.org.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">Y Bont (Pregnancy Support)</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Contact:</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:info@ybont.org.uk\">info@ybont.org.uk</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: <a href=\"tel:01978359645\" target=\"_blank\">01978 359645</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Text: <a href=\"tel:07749391181\">07749 391181</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Priory Centre,<br>12 Priory Street, Wrexham, LL11 1SP</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-67d2d27c19989f3ddc02e3c9 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>"
