    "title": "Yarm Association for the Widowed and People who live alone alone (YAW)",
    "excerpt": "<p>Social events for those widowed or who live alone in the  Yarm/Stockton area.</p>\n",
    "featured": false,
    "publishOn": 1626518700050,
